#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:PRESET_10_BANDS
msgid ""
"10-band equalizer preset with initial frequencies: 31.25 Hz, 62.5 Hz, 125 Hz, 250 Hz, 500 Hz, "
"1000 Hz, 2000 Hz, 4000 Hz, 8000 Hz, 16000 Hz."
msgstr "十频段均衡器预设，初始频率依次为 31.25、62.5、125、250、500、1000、2000、4000、8000 和 16000 Hz。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ10/brief_description:0
msgid "10-band graphic equalizer audio effect."
msgstr "10 段均衡器预设。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:FFT_SIZE_1024
msgid ""
"1024-point FFT (default). Good balance between frequency and time resolution. Recommended for "
"most spectrum analyzer visualizations."
msgstr "1024 点 FFT"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/constants:6/constant:FILTER_12DB
msgid "12 dB per octave rolloff. Moderate slope, good for general filtering purposes."
msgstr "每倍频程 12 dB 的斜率"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_HIGHPASS_12DB
msgid "12 dB/octave high-pass filter."
msgstr "12 dB 高通"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_LOWPASS_12DB
msgid "12 dB/octave low-pass filter."
msgstr "12 dB 低通"

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/constants:6/constant:FORMAT_16_BITS
msgid ""
"16-bit PCM audio format (default). Good balance between audio quality and file size. Recommended "
"for most recording applications."
msgstr "导出 16-bit PCM WAV"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_FORMAT_PCM16
msgid "16-bit signed PCM."
msgstr "16位整数PCM数据"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:FFT_SIZE_2048
msgid ""
"2048-point FFT. Higher frequency resolution for detailed spectrum analysis. Best for visualizing "
"complex audio or musical content."
msgstr "2048 点 FFT"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ21/brief_description:0
msgid "21-band graphic equalizer audio effect."
msgstr "21 段均衡器预设。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:PRESET_21_BANDS
msgid ""
"21-band graphic equalizer preset with frequencies: 22Hz, 32Hz, 44Hz, 63Hz, 90Hz, 125Hz, 175Hz, "
"250Hz, 350Hz, 500Hz, 700Hz, 1000Hz, 1400Hz, 2000Hz, 2800Hz, 4000Hz, 5600Hz, 8000Hz, 11000Hz, "
"16000Hz, 22000Hz."
msgstr "21 段均衡器"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/constants:6/constant:FILTER_24DB
msgid ""
"24 dB per octave rolloff. Very steep slope, aggressive filtering with minimal bleed-through of "
"unwanted frequencies."
msgstr "每倍频程 24 dB 的斜率"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_HIGHPASS_24DB
msgid "24 dB/octave high-pass filter."
msgstr "24 dB 高通"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_LOWPASS_24DB
msgid "24 dB/octave low-pass filter."
msgstr "24 dB 低通"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_FORMAT_PCM24
msgid "24-bit signed PCM."
msgstr "24位整数PCM数据"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:FFT_SIZE_256
msgid ""
"256-point FFT. Lower frequency resolution but better time resolution. Useful for analyzing "
"transient sounds or when low latency is required."
msgstr "256 点 FFT"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_2D
msgid "2D sound that ignores 3D positioning and attenuation."
msgstr "作为 2D 声音播放"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_FORMAT_PCMFLOAT
msgid "32-bit floating-point PCM."
msgstr "32位浮点PCM数据"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_FORMAT_PCM32
msgid "32-bit signed PCM."
msgstr "32位整数PCM数据"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_PARAMETER_DATA_TYPE_3DATTRIBUTES
msgid "3D attributes data parameter type."
msgstr "三维属性数据参数类型。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_3D_RIGHTHANDED
msgid "3D calculations use right-handed coordinates instead of the default left-handed coordinates."
msgstr "三维计算将采用右手坐标进行，而非默认的左手坐标。更多信息请参见词汇表的“惯性”部分"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_IGNOREGEOMETRY
msgid "3D sound ignores geometry-based occlusion and environmental effects."
msgstr "忽略几何遮挡"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_WORLDRELATIVE
msgid "3D sound position is in world coordinates (default for 3D sounds)."
msgstr "3D 位置相对世界"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_HEADRELATIVE
msgid "3D sound position is relative to the listener's head orientation."
msgstr "3D 位置相对听者"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D
msgid "3D sound that is affected by 3D positioning and attenuation settings."
msgstr "作为 3D 声音播放"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_CUSTOMROLLOFF
msgid "3D sound uses a custom rolloff curve defined by [method FmodChannelControl.set_3d_custom_rolloff]."
msgstr "自定义距离衰减 （参见 [method FmodChannelControl.set_3d_custom_rolloff] ）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSEROLLOFF
msgid "3D sound uses inverse distance rolloff model (volume decreases with 1/distance)."
msgstr "反比距离衰减"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF
msgid "3D sound uses inverse tapered rolloff model with smooth transition at max distance."
msgstr "锥形反比距离衰减"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_LINEARROLLOFF
msgid "3D sound uses linear distance rolloff model."
msgstr "线性距离衰减"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_3D_LINEARSQUAREROLLOFF
msgid "3D sound uses linear squared distance rolloff model."
msgstr "线性平方距离衰减"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:FFT_SIZE_4096
msgid ""
"4096-point FFT. Very high frequency resolution but poor time resolution. Best for analyzing low-"
"frequency content or when precise frequency detection is needed."
msgstr "4096 点 FFT"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_HIGHPASS_48DB
msgid "48 dB/octave high-pass filter."
msgstr "48 dB 高通"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_LOWPASS_48DB
msgid "48 dB/octave low-pass filter."
msgstr "48 dB 低通"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_5POINT1
msgid ""
"5.1 surround output (6 channels: front left, front right, center, LFE, surround left, surround "
"right)."
msgstr "5.1 环绕输出"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:FFT_SIZE_512
msgid "512-point FFT. Moderate frequency resolution suitable for simple visualizations."
msgstr "512 点 FFT"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/constants:6/constant:FILTER_6DB
msgid "6 dB per octave rolloff. Gentle slope, minimal effect on neighboring frequencies."
msgstr "每倍频程 6 dB 的斜率"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_HIGHPASS_6DB
msgid "6 dB/octave high-pass filter."
msgstr "6 dB 高通"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_LOWPASS_6DB
msgid "6 dB/octave low-pass filter."
msgstr "6 dB 低通"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ6/brief_description:0
msgid "6-band equalizer audio effect."
msgstr "6 段均衡器预设。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:PRESET_6_BANDS
msgid "6-band equalizer preset with frequencies: 32Hz, 100Hz, 320Hz, 1000Hz, 3200Hz, 10000Hz."
msgstr "6 段均衡器"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_7POINT1
msgid ""
"7.1 surround output (8 channels: front left, front right, center, LFE, surround left, surround "
"right, back left, back right)."
msgstr "7.1 环绕输出"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_7POINT1POINT4
msgid "7.1.4 surround output (12 channels: 7.1 plus 4 overhead channels for Dolby Atmos)."
msgstr "7.1.4 沉浸式输出"

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/constants:6/constant:FORMAT_8_BITS
msgid ""
"8-bit PCM audio format. Smaller file size but lower audio quality with audible quantization "
"noise. Suitable for low-quality recordings or when memory is constrained."
msgstr "导出 8-bit PCM WAV"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_FORMAT_PCM8
msgid "8-bit signed PCM."
msgstr "8位整数PCM数据"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/brief_description:0
msgid "A 2D node for playing FMOD audio streams with spatial audio support."
msgstr "用于在 2D 场景中播放带距离衰减和声像的音频流"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/brief_description:0
msgid "A 3D node for playing FMOD audio streams with full spatial audio support."
msgstr "用于在 3D 空间中播放音频流的节点"

#. FmodSoundGroup/brief_description:0
msgid "A group of sounds for controlling playback limits and collective behavior."
msgstr "用于限制和管理一组 FmodSound 播放行为的对象"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/brief_description:0
msgid "A node for playing FMOD audio streams with full playback control."
msgstr "用于播放 2D 非空间化音频流的节点"

#. FmodSound/brief_description:0
msgid "A reference-counted wrapper around FMOD::Sound representing a loaded audio resource."
msgstr "FMOD::Sound 的引用计数包装器，表示已加载的音频资源"

#. FmodAudioStream/brief_description:0
msgid "A resource representing an audio stream for FMOD playback."
msgstr "表示用于 FMOD 播放的音频流的资源"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/brief_description:0
msgid "A reverb effect for adding spatial ambience and simulated acoustic spaces to audio."
msgstr "总线混响效果，参数风格接近 Godot 的 AudioEffectReverb。"

#. FmodAudioEffectAmplify/brief_description:0
msgid "A simple gain/volume effect for amplifying or attenuating audio signals."
msgstr "简单增益效果，用于放大或衰减信号。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_TYPE_ASF
msgid "ASF/WMA metadata tag."
msgstr "高级系统格式元数据通常与Windows Media格式（如WMA）相关"

#. FmodAudioEffect/brief_description:0
msgid "Abstract base class for audio effects in the FMOD audio system."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffect[/b] 是所有 FMOD 音频效果资源的基类。它负责把效果创建出的 DSP 应用到 [code skip-"
"lint]FmodChannelGroup[/code] ，并保存当前所属总线和 DSP 链。"

#. FmodChannelControl/brief_description:0
msgid "Abstract base class that provides common functionality for Channel and ChannelGroup."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodChannelControl[/b] 封装 FMOD::ChannelControl 的共享能力，为 [code skip-lint]FmodChannel[/code] 和 "
"[code skip-lint]FmodChannelGroup[/code] 提供播放控制、音量、3D 空间化、声像矩阵、滤波、DSP 链和样本精确调度等功能。"

#. ModifyAndroidBuildTemplatePlugin/description:1
msgid ""
"Adds [code]Configure FMOD Android Export[/code] to the editor Tools menu. Accepts an extracted "
"FMOD Core Android SDK folder or a [code].tar.gz[/code]/[code].tgz[/code] archive and presents the"
" proposed changes for review.\n"
"Configures the installed Android build template: copies [code]fmod.jar[/code] and available ABI "
"runtime libraries into debug, dev, and release directories; copies available arm64 extension "
"libraries; updates Gradle dependencies and Java runtime initialization.\n"
"This class is only available in the editor."
msgstr ""
"在编辑器的工具菜单中添加 [code]Configure FMOD Android Export[/code] 。可选择解压后的 FMOD Core Android SDK 目录或 "
"[code].tar.gz[/code] / [code].tgz[/code] 压缩包，并在执行前预览更改。\n"
"配置已安装的 Android 构建模板：复制 [code]fmod.jar[/code] ，将可用架构的运行库复制到 debug、dev 和 release 目录，复制可用的 arm64 "
"扩展库，并更新 Gradle 依赖和 Java 运行时初始化代码。\n"
"此类仅在编辑器中可用。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:add_input/description:3
msgid "Adds a DSP unit as an input to this DSP. Returns the connection handle."
msgstr "将一个 DSP 单元添加为当前 DSP 的输入，返回连接对象。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:add_dsp/description:3
msgid ""
"Adds a DSP unit to the DSP chain at the specified index. The DSP will be inserted at the given "
"position in the processing chain, affecting how audio is processed."
msgstr "在 DSP 链指定索引处插入一个 DSP 单元。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:add_bus/description:3
msgid ""
"Adds a bus named [param name] and routes it to [param send_id]. Returns its stable ID, or "
"[code]-1[/code] if the name is blank, contains a comma, is already used, the target does not "
"exist, or the layout has reached its limit of 4096 buses."
msgstr ""
"添加名为 [param name] 的总线并发送到 [param send_id]，返回稳定 ID。名称为空白、包含逗号、重复，目标不存在，或已达到 4096 条总线的上限时，返回 "
"[code]-1[/code]。"

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:add_group/description:3
msgid ""
"Adds a child [FmodChannelGroup] to this group as an input.\n"
"When [param propagatedspclock] is [code]true[/code], the child group's DSP clock is synchronized "
"with this group, enabling sample-accurate scheduling across the hierarchy.\n"
"This method creates the parent-child relationship in the channel group tree, causing all audio "
"from the child group to flow through this group."
msgstr ""
"将子 [FmodChannelGroup] 添加为此组的输入。\n"
"[param propagatedspclock] 为 [code]true[/code] 时，子组的 DSP 时钟与此组同步，可在层级间进行采样精度的调度。\n"
"此方法建立通道组树中的父子关系，使子组的全部音频流经此组。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_fade_point_ramp/description:3
msgid ""
"Adds a fade point at the specified DSP clock time with volume ramping. Similar to [method "
"add_fade_point], but the volume transition will use a ramp curve for smoother changes."
msgstr "添加从当前音量到指定 DSP 时钟音量的淡变斜坡。 （参见 [method add_fade_point] ）"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:add_polygon/description:5
msgid ""
"Adds a polygon using the positions in [param vertices]. The array must contain at least three "
"finite vertices. [param direct_occlusion] and [param reverb_occlusion] are clamped to "
"[code]0.0[/code] through [code]1.0[/code]. [param double_sided] enables occlusion from both "
"sides.\n"
"Returns the new polygon index, or [code]-1[/code] on failure. Capacity is fixed by [method "
"FmodSystem.create_geometry]."
msgstr ""
"使用 [param vertices] 中的位置添加多边形。数组至少应包含三个有限顶点； [param direct_occlusion] 和 [param reverb_occlusion] "
"会限制在 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]1.0[/code] 之间， [param double_sided] 启用双面遮挡。\n"
"返回新多边形的索引，失败时返回 [code]-1[/code] 。容量由 [method FmodSystem.create_geometry] 确定。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:add_fade_point/description:3
msgid ""
"Adds a sample-accurate fade point at the specified DSP clock time. This allows precise volume "
"automation synchronized to the audio clock. The volume will transition to the specified value at "
"the exact clock time specified."
msgstr "在指定 DSP 时钟处添加一个音量淡变点。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:add_sync_point/description:4
msgid ""
"Adds a sync point at the specified position in the sound and returns its handle. Returns "
"[code]0[/code] on failure. Sync points trigger the [signal FmodChannel.syncpoint] signal during "
"playback when reached.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method get_sync_point_info] to get information about the returned sync point "
"handle."
msgstr ""
"在声音的指定位置添加同步点并返回句柄，失败时返回 [code]0[/code] 。播放到同步点时触发 [signal FmodChannel.syncpoint] 信号。\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 可用 [method get_sync_point_info] 查询返回的同步点句柄的信息。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_pan/description:2
msgid ""
"Adjusts the left/right panning of the channel.\n"
"- [code]-1.0[/code]: Full left\n"
"- [code]0.0[/code]: Center (default)\n"
"- [code]1.0[/code]: Full right\n"
"Values between these points create intermediate panning positions."
msgstr ""
"设置左右声像。 [code]-1.0[/code] 为左， [code]0.0[/code] 为中间， [code]1.0[/code] 为右。\n"
"- [code]-1.0[/code] ：完全偏左\n"
"- [code]0.0[/code] ：居中（默认值）\n"
"- [code]1.0[/code] ：完全偏右\n"
"中间值表示相应的中间声像位置。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_ALSA
msgid "Advanced Linux Sound Architecture. Legacy Linux audio output."
msgstr "高级 Linux 声音架构（如果 Linux 上没有 PulseAudio，默认使用 Linux 版本）"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_ASF
msgid "Advanced Systems Format (ASF/WMA/WMV)."
msgstr "Microsoft 高级系统格式（.asf、.wma、.wmv）。平台提供解码器，仅在 Windows 上可用"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_DISTANCEFILTER
msgid ""
"All 3D-based voices have software lowpass and highpass filters added to the DSP chain as an "
"automatic distance-based bandpass filter. Use [method set_distance_filter_center_freq] to adjust "
"the default center frequency."
msgstr "为所有 3D 声音的 DSP 链添加软件低通和高通滤波器，作为随距离变化的带通滤波器。通过 [method set_distance_filter_center_freq] 调整默认中心频率。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_ALLPASS
msgid "All-pass filter that passes all frequencies but changes the phase."
msgstr "全通滤波"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_UNIQUE
msgid "Allows only one playback of this sound at a time."
msgstr "同一时间只允许播放此声音的一个实例。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OPEN_STATE_ERROR
msgid "An error occurred while opening the sound."
msgstr "无法打开，通常是找不到文件、内存不足等"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_LOUDNESS_METER
msgid "Analyzes the loudness and true peak of the signal."
msgstr "分析信号响度和真峰值。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_FFT
msgid "Analyzes the signal and returns spectrum information via getParameter."
msgstr "分析信号，通过 getParameter 返回频谱数据。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AAUDIO
msgid "Android AAudio output. Modern low-latency Android audio API."
msgstr "AAudio（Android 8.1及以上默认）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AUDIOTRACK
msgid "Android AudioTrack output. Legacy Android audio output."
msgstr "Java 音频轨（Android 2.2及以下默认）"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_MEDIACODEC
msgid "Android MediaCodec."
msgstr "Google Media 编解码器（.m4a，.mp4）。平台提供的解码器，仅在安卓上提供"

#. Class reference template
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "注解"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_PHASE
msgid "Apple PHASE output."
msgstr "PHASE 框架（禁用）"

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:flush_bus_updates/description:1
msgid ""
"Applies pending configuration and effect parameter changes to the runtime graph immediately. The "
"server normally does this once per frame. This call does not poll Godot AudioServer or save "
"layout files."
msgstr "立即将待处理的配置和效果器参数应用到运行时图。服务器通常每帧执行一次。此调用不会轮询 Godot AudioServer，也不会保存布局文件。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:sync_bypass/description:1
msgid ""
"Applies the stored bypass flag to the DSP chains of this bus's stored effect instances. The "
"channel-group fader and DSPs added separately through low-level APIs are unchanged. Use [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass] to combine bus bypass with each managed slot's enabled state."
msgstr ""
"将保存的旁路标记应用到总线所保存效果器实例的 DSP 链。通道组音量推子及通过低层 API 单独添加的 DSP 保持原状。通过 [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass] 同时处理总线旁路与受管槽位的启用状态。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:apply_mute/description:2
msgid ""
"Applies the stored mute flag and solo state to the channel group. The [param mute] argument means"
" that any bus in the layout is soloed; this bus is muted when that argument is [code]true[/code] "
"and its own solo flag is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "将保存的静音标志和独奏状态应用到通道组。 [param mute] 参数表示布局中存在独奏总线；此参数为 [code]true[/code] 且当前总线未独奏时，当前总线会被静音。"

#. FmodAudioEffect/methods:3/method:apply_to/description:2
msgid ""
"Applies this effect to the specified audio bus. Subclasses should override this method to add "
"their DSP units to the bus."
msgstr "将效果应用到指定通道组。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/constants:6/constant:MODE_ATAN
msgid "Arctangent soft clipping. Creates smooth, tube-like distortion with gradual saturation."
msgstr "反正切软削波"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_release_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code skip-lint]release[/code] callback. The callable receives no "
"arguments and may return an FMOD result code. Notifications from other threads are deferred to "
"the main thread; their return values cannot affect the completed FMOD call. Pass an empty "
"[Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code skip-lint]release[/code] 回调。不接收参数，可返回 FMOD 结果码。来自其他线程的通知会延迟到主线程执行，其返回值无法影响已经完成的"
" FMOD 调用。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_reset_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code skip-lint]reset[/code] callback. The callable receives no arguments "
"and may return an FMOD result code. Notifications from other threads are deferred to the main "
"thread; their return values cannot affect the completed FMOD call. Pass an empty [Callable] to "
"clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code skip-lint]reset[/code] 回调。不接收参数，可返回 FMOD 结果码。来自其他线程的通知会延迟到主线程执行，其返回值无法影响已经完成的 "
"FMOD 调用。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_create_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]create[/code] callback. The callable receives no arguments and may "
"return an FMOD result code. Assigning it does not recreate the DSP. Notifications from other "
"threads are deferred to the main thread; their return values cannot affect the completed FMOD "
"call. Pass an empty [Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code]create[/code] 回调。不接收参数，可返回 FMOD 结果码。设置回调不会重新创建 "
"DSP。来自其他线程的通知会延迟到主线程执行，其返回值无法影响已经完成的 FMOD 调用。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_getparam_bool_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]getparam_bool[/code] callback. The callable receives [code]index: "
"int[/code] and returns a [Dictionary] with [code]value[/code] (bool), optional "
"[code]valuestr[/code] ([String]), and optional [code]result[/code] (an FMOD result code). Values "
"are returned synchronously on the main thread. On other threads the callable is deferred and the "
"immediate result is zero or empty. Pass an empty [Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code]getparam_bool[/code] 回调。接收 [code]index: int[/code] ，返回 [Dictionary] ，其中包含 "
"[code]value[/code] （bool），以及可选的 [code]valuestr[/code] （ [String] ）和 [code]result[/code] （FMOD "
"结果码）。主线程会同步返回结果；其他线程会延迟调用回调，并立即返回零或空值。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_getparam_data_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]getparam_data[/code] callback. The callable receives [code]index: "
"int[/code] and returns a [Dictionary] with [code]data[/code] (PackedByteArray), optional "
"[code]valuestr[/code] ([String]), and optional [code]result[/code] (an FMOD result code). Values "
"are returned synchronously on the main thread. On other threads the callable is deferred and the "
"immediate result is zero or empty. Pass an empty [Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code]getparam_data[/code] 回调。接收 [code]index: int[/code] ，返回 [Dictionary] ，其中包含 "
"[code]data[/code] （PackedByteArray），以及可选的 [code]valuestr[/code] （ [String] ）和 [code]result[/code]"
" （FMOD 结果码）。主线程会同步返回结果；其他线程会延迟调用回调，并立即返回零或空值。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_getparam_float_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]getparam_float[/code] callback. The callable receives [code]index: "
"int[/code] and returns a [Dictionary] with [code]value[/code] (float), optional "
"[code]valuestr[/code] ([String]), and optional [code]result[/code] (an FMOD result code). Values "
