#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_getparam_int_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]getparam_int[/code] callback. The callable receives [code]index: "
"int[/code] and returns a [Dictionary] with [code]value[/code] (int), optional "
"[code]valuestr[/code] ([String]), and optional [code]result[/code] (an FMOD result code). Values "
