msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code]getparam_int[/code] 回调。接收 [code]index: int[/code] ，返回 [Dictionary] ，其中包含 "
"[code]value[/code] （int），以及可选的 [code]valuestr[/code] （ [String] ）和 [code]result[/code] （FMOD "
"结果码）。主线程会同步返回结果；其他线程会延迟调用回调，并立即返回零或空值。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_setparam_bool_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]setparam_bool[/code] callback. The callable receives [code]index: "
"int[/code] and [code]value: bool[/code], and may return an FMOD result code. Notifications from "
"other threads are deferred to the main thread; their return values cannot affect the completed "
"FMOD call. Pass an empty [Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code]setparam_bool[/code] 回调。接收 [code]index: int[/code] 和 [code]value: bool[/code] "
"，可返回 FMOD 结果码。来自其他线程的通知会延迟到主线程执行，其返回值无法影响已经完成的 FMOD 调用。传入空 [Callable] 可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_setparam_data_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code]setparam_data[/code] callback. The callable receives [code]index: "
"int[/code] and [code]value: PackedByteArray[/code], and may return an FMOD result code. "
"Notifications from other threads are deferred to the main thread; their return values cannot "
"affect the completed FMOD call. Pass an empty [Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 DSP 的 [code]setparam_data[/code] 回调。接收 [code]index: int[/code] 和 [code]value: "
"PackedByteArray[/code] ，可返回 FMOD 结果码。来自其他线程的通知会延迟到主线程执行，其返回值无法影响已经完成的 FMOD 调用。传入空 [Callable] "
"可清除回调。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_setparam_float_callback/description:2
