#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_state/description:2
msgid ""
"Atomically replaces the bus configuration with [param state], using the format returned by "
"[method get_state]. Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA], preserving "
"the previous configuration when validation fails. The layout accepts up to 4096 buses and 512 "
"slots per bus."
msgstr ""
"使用 [method get_state] 的格式，以 [param state] 原子替换总线配置。成功返回 [constant OK]；验证失败时返回 [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_DATA]，并保留原配置。布局最多接受 4096 条总线，每条最多 512 个槽位。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:attach_channel_group_to_port/description:5
msgid ""
"Attaches a channel group's output to an audio port on the output driver.\n"
"This allows routing audio to specific output destinations like controller speakers or auxiliary "
"outputs.\n"
"See [enum FmodPortType] for available port types."
msgstr ""
"将通道组的输出附加到输出驱动器上的音频端口。\n"
"这允许将音频路由到特定的输出目标，例如控制器扬声器或辅助输出。\n"
"可用端口类型见 [enum FmodPortType] 。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_PARAMEQ
msgid "Attenuates or amplifies a selected frequency range (deprecated)."
msgstr "衰减或放大指定频段，已弃用。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:attenuation
msgid "Attenuation factor controlling how quickly sound fades with distance."
msgstr "距离衰减曲线强度"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:emission_angle_filter_attenuation_db
msgid ""
"Attenuation outside the emission cone in dB, clamped to [code]-80.0[/code] through "
"[code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr "发声锥外的衰减量，单位为 dB，限制在 [code]-80.0[/code] 到 [code]0.0[/code] 之间。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_PARAMETER_DATA_TYPE_ATTENUATION_RANGE
msgid "Attenuation range data parameter type."
msgstr "衰减范围数据参数类型。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_AIFF
msgid "Audio Interchange File Format (AIFF/AIFC)."
msgstr "音频交换文件格式（.aif，.aiff）。仅限无压缩整数格式"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_ASIO
msgid "Audio Stream Input/Output. Low-latency professional audio interface for Windows."
msgstr "低延迟ASIO 2.0"

#. AudioImporterFmod/description:1
msgid ""
"AudioImporterFmod is an editor plugin that handles importing audio files into [FmodAudioStream] "
"resources. It integrates with Godot's import system to provide seamless audio asset management.\n"
"Supported formats include common audio types like MP3, WAV, OGG, FLAC, and others supported by "
"FMOD.\n"
"The importer processes audio files during project import, creating optimized [FmodAudioStream] "
"resources that can be used with [FmodAudioStreamPlayer] and [FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D]."
msgstr ""
"AudioImporterFmod 将音频文件导入为 [FmodAudioStream] 资源，并接入 Godot 的资源导入流程。\n"
"支持 MP3、WAV、OGG、FLAC 等常见格式，以及 FMOD 支持的其他音频格式。\n"
"导入器在项目导入时处理音频文件，生成供 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer] 和 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D] 使用的 [FmodAudioStream] 资源。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AUTODETECT
msgid "Automatically select the most appropriate output mode for the platform."
msgstr "选择平台的最佳输出模式，这是默认的"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_PORT_TYPE_AUX
msgid "Auxiliary output port. Use [code]FMOD_PORT_INDEX_NONE[/code] as the port index."
msgstr "辅助输出端口"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_BACK_LEFT
msgid "Back left speaker (7.1)."
msgstr "后置左声道"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_BACK_RIGHT
msgid "Back right speaker (7.1)."
msgstr "后置右声道"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_PORT_TYPE_MUSIC
msgid "Background music port. Use [code]FMOD_PORT_INDEX_NONE[/code] as the port index."
msgstr "音乐输出端口"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_BANDPASS
msgid "Band-pass filter that allows only a specific frequency range to pass."
msgstr "带通滤波"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/brief_description:0
msgid "Base class for multi-band equalizer audio effects."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectEQ[/b] 使用一个或多个 FMOD [code]MULTIBAND_EQ[/code] DSP 组成多段均衡器。它可以按预设创建 6、10 或 21 "
"个频段，也可以逐频段修改增益、中心频率、Q 值和滤波器类型。"

#. FmodAudioEffect/description:1
msgid ""
"Base resource for FMOD audio effects such as Amplify, Filter, EQ, Reverb, and Delay. Add a "
"configuration resource to a [FmodAudioBusLayout] with [method FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect]."
" A configuration can be shared by several slots; each slot receives a separate runtime instance "
"and DSP chain. Parameter changes update the bound instances without rebuilding their DSPs.\n"
"Use [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] to read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, and "
"Record data. The configuration resource stored in a layout does not hold the slot's audio buffers"
" or analysis state.\n"
"For standalone routing, apply an effect directly to a [FmodChannelGroup] with [method apply_to] "
"and detach it with [method remove_from_bus]. A directly attached effect instance belongs to one "
"bus at a time."
msgstr ""
"FMOD 效果器的基类资源，包含 Amplify、Filter、EQ、Reverb 和 Delay 等。通过 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect]"
" 将配置加入 [FmodAudioBusLayout]。多个槽位可共享配置，每个槽位都有独立运行实例和 DSP 链。参数变化会更新绑定实例，保留现有 DSP。\n"
"通过 [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] 读取 Capture、SpectrumAnalyzer 和 Record "
"的实时数据。布局中的配置资源不保存槽位的音频缓冲或分析状态。\n"
"独立路由可通过 [method apply_to] 将效果器直接挂到 [FmodChannelGroup]，再通过 [method remove_from_bus] "
"移除。直接挂接的效果器实例同时只属于一条总线。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_DATA_TYPE_STRING_UTF16BE
msgid "Big-endian UTF-16 encoded string."
msgstr "16位UTF字符串大端序字节序"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_DATA_TYPE_BINARY
msgid "Binary data."
msgstr "原始二进制数据"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/constants:6/constant:MODE_BITCRUSH
msgid "Bit crush. Reduces bit depth for aggressive digital degradation artifacts."
msgstr "比特压碎"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_BATHROOM
msgid "Bright reflective bathroom preset."
msgstr "浴室"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OPEN_STATE_BUFFERING
msgid "Buffering data from a network stream."
msgstr "缓冲数据"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/constants:6/constant:SOURCE_COLLISION_SHAPES
msgid "Builds from [CollisionShape3D] nodes."
msgstr "从 [CollisionShape3D] 构建"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/constants:6/constant:SOURCE_MESH_INSTANCE
msgid "Builds from a [MeshInstance3D]."
msgstr "从 [MeshInstance3D] 构建"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/constants:6/constant:SOURCE_MESH_RESOURCE
msgid "Builds from a [Mesh] resource."
msgstr "从 [Mesh] 资源构建"

#. FmodAudioBus/members:4/member:volume
msgid "Bus volume in decibels. A value of [code]0.0[/code] is unity gain."
msgstr "总线音量，单位为分贝。 [code]0.0[/code] 表示单位增益。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/members:4/member:immediate_mode
msgid "Calculates FFT data synchronously. Useful for offline processing and same-frame queries."
msgstr "同步计算 FFT 数据，适合离线处理和同帧查询。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_ACCURATETIME
msgid ""
"Calculates accurate length and position information for VBR formats like MP3. Increases opening "
"time."
msgstr "精确计算长度"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_audibility/description:1
msgid ""
"Calculates and returns the final audibility of the channel based on all volume attenuation "
"factors. This considers volume levels from the channel itself, its parent channel groups, and any"
" applied 3D attenuation. Returns a value between 0.0 (silent) and 1.0 (full volume)."
msgstr "返回综合音量、静音、3D 衰减和父级混音后的最终可听度。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_geometry_occlusion/description:3
msgid ""
"Calculates occlusion between a listener and a sound source position.\n"
"Returns a Dictionary with occlusion values for direct and reverb paths."
msgstr ""
"计算听者与声源位置之间的遮挡情况\n"
"返回包含直达声和混响路径遮挡量的字典。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE
msgid ""
"Calculates the average magnitude across the specified frequency range. This provides a smoother "
"response that represents the overall energy in the range."
msgstr "返回频率范围内的平均幅度"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_PAN
msgid "Can pan the signal in 2D or 3D, possibly with upmixing or downmixing."
msgstr "在二维或三维空间调整声像，可执行声道扩展或缩减。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/brief_description:0
msgid "Captures audio output to an internal ring buffer for audio visualization, recording, or analysis."
msgstr "将音频输出捕获到内部环形缓冲区，用于音频可视化、录音或分析。"

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/brief_description:0
msgid "Captures audio passing through a bus and exposes it as a WAV resource."
msgstr "捕获流经总线的音频，并以 WAV 资源提供录音。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/description:1
msgid ""
"Captures the signal passing through an audio bus without changing its output. Attach it with "
"[method FmodAudioEffect.apply_to], then read complete stereo frames with [method get_buffer]. "
"Each [Vector2] contains the left sample in [code]x[/code] and the right sample in [code]y[/code]."
" Mono input is duplicated; input with more than two channels keeps its first two channels.\n"
"When the ring buffer is full, incoming frames are discarded and unread frames are preserved. "
"[method clear_buffer] clears the queue and resets both counters. Changing [member buffer_length] "
"clears queued audio but keeps the counters.\n"
"When added through [method FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect], read from the slot's runtime "
"instance returned by [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance]. The configuration resource "
"remains separate from the capture buffer. The example below uses a directly attached standalone "
"effect.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodAudioEffectCapture.new()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"\t_capture.apply_to(FmodServer.get_main_system().get_master_channel_group())\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"\tif _capture.can_get_buffer(256):\n"
"\t\tvar frames: PackedVector2Array = _capture.get_buffer(256)\n"
"\t\tprint(frames[0].x, frames[0].y)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"捕获流经音频总线的信号，保持总线输出不变。使用 [method FmodAudioEffect.apply_to] 挂载效果器，再通过 [method get_buffer] "
"读取完整的立体声帧。每个 [Vector2] 的 [code]x[/code] 存放左声道采样， [code]y[/code] "
"存放右声道采样。单声道输入会复制到两个声道，多声道输入只保留前两个声道。\n"
"环形缓冲区已满时会丢弃新帧，保留尚未读取的旧帧。 [method clear_buffer] 会清空队列并重置两个计数器。修改 [member buffer_length] "
"会清空队列，但保留计数器。\n"
"通过 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect] 添加时，应从 [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] "
"返回的槽位运行实例读取数据。配置资源与捕获缓冲分别保存。以下示例使用直接挂接的独立效果器。\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodAudioEffectCapture.new()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    _capture.apply_to(FmodServer.get_main_system().get_master_channel_group())\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if _capture.can_get_buffer(256):\n"
"        var frames: PackedVector2Array = _capture.get_buffer(256)\n"
"        print(frames[0].x, frames[0].y)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

