#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_mix_matrix/description:5
msgid ""
"Channel counts must be between [code]1[/code] and [code]32[/code]. [param inchannel_hop] must be "
"[code]0[/code] or between [param inchannels] and [code]32[/code]. The input must include every "
"active element; padding after the last row is optional. Invalid dimensions, strides, and short "
"arrays are rejected before calling FMOD.\n"
"Sets a custom mix matrix that maps input channels (columns) to output speaker channels (rows).\n"
"The matrix is row-major. If [param inchannel_hop] is [code]0[/code], each row is assumed to "
"contain [param inchannels] values."
msgstr ""
"通道数必须在 [code]1[/code] 到 [code]32[/code] 之间。 [param inchannel_hop] 必须为 [code]0[/code] ，或介于 [param "
"inchannels] 和 [code]32[/code] 之间。输入必须包含所有有效元素，最后一行末尾可省略填充。无效尺寸、步长和过短数组会在调用 FMOD 前被拒绝。\n"
"设置自定义混音矩阵，将输入通道（列）映射到输出扬声器通道（行）。\n"
"矩阵按行优先顺序排列。 [param inchannel_hop] 为 [code]0[/code] 时，每行视为包含 [param inchannels] 个元素。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/constants:6/constant:SOURCE_AUTO
msgid "Chooses the source type automatically."
msgstr "自动选择可用来源"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/brief_description:0
msgid "Chorus effect for thickening and enriching audio with multiple detuned voices."
msgstr "合唱效果，支持多个 voice 的延迟、速率、深度、电平、截止频率和声像控制。"

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:clear/description:1
msgid ""
"Clears the audio data and releases the internal [FmodSound] resource. This frees up memory and "
"resets the stream to an empty state. The stream will need to be reloaded before it can be played "
"again."
msgstr "清除音频数据并释放内部 [FmodSound] 资源。这将释放内存并将流重置为空状态。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:close/description:1
msgid ""
"Closes the connection to the output device and returns the system to an uninitialized state "
"without releasing the object. The system can be reinitialized by calling [method init] again.\n"
"This method rejects borrowed system wrappers, such as those returned by [method "
"FmodDSP.get_system_object]."
msgstr ""
"关闭与输出设备的连接，并将系统恢复到未初始化状态，而不释放对象。可以通过再次调用 [method init] 来重新初始化系统。\n"
"此方法不接受借用的系统包装器，例如 [method FmodDSP.get_system_object] 返回的包装器。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Closes the system connection and releases all associated resources. After calling this method, "
"the system object is no longer valid and should not be used.\n"
"This method rejects borrowed system wrappers, such as those returned by [method "
"FmodDSP.get_system_object]."
msgstr ""
"关闭系统连接并释放所有相关资源。调用此方法后，系统对象不再有效，且不应再使用。\n"
"此方法不接受借用的系统包装器，例如 [method FmodDSP.get_system_object] 返回的包装器。"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/constants:6/constant:FILTER_18DB
msgid ""
"Compatibility slope option. The current implementation maps this value to the same 24 dB/octave "
"low-pass filter as [constant FILTER_24DB]."
msgstr "用于兼容的斜率选项。当前实现将其映射到与 [constant FILTER_24DB] 相同的每倍频程 24 dB 低通滤波器。"

