#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_reverb_3d/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D reverb zone for spatial audio reverberation effects.\n"
"Returns a [FmodReverb3D] object that can be positioned in 3D space and configured with reverb "
"parameters.\n"
"Use this to create environmental audio effects like caves, halls, or rooms."
msgstr ""
"创建一个用于空间音频混响效果的3D混响区域。\n"
"返回一个 [FmodReverb3D] 对象，该对象可以在3D空间中定位并配置混响参数。\n"
"使用此功能可以创建如洞穴、礼堂或房间等环境音效。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_dsp_by_type/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a DSP effect of the specified built-in type. Use [method get_dsp_info_by_type] to query "
"available DSP types and their information."
msgstr "创建指定内置类型的 DSP 效果。使用 [method get_dsp_info_by_type] 查询可用的 DSP 类型及其信息。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_from_res/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a [FmodSound] from a Godot resource path (starting with [code]res://[/code]). The file is"
" loaded through Godot's file system and then passed to FMOD.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags."
msgstr ""
"从 Godot 资源路径（以 [code]res://[/code] 开头）创建一个 [FmodSound] ，它会内部使用 [code skip-"
"lint]create_sound_from_memory()[/code] 方法。文件通过 Godot 的文件系统加载进内存，然后传递给 FMOD。\n"
"- [code skip-lint]mode[/code] —— 参数使用 [enum FmodMode] 标志指定创建选项"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_from_file/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a [FmodSound] from a file path. If the path starts with [code]res://[/code], it will use "
"[method create_sound_from_res] internally.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags, such as looping "
"behavior ([constant FMOD_MODE_LOOP_NORMAL]), 3D positioning ([constant FMOD_MODE_3D]), or "
"streaming ([constant FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM])."
msgstr ""
"从文件路径创建一个 [FmodSound] 。如果路径以 [code]res://[/code] 开头，它将内部使用 [method create_sound_from_res] 。\n"
"- [code skip-lint]mode[/code] —— 参数使用 [enum FmodMode] 标志指定创建选项 （参见 [constant "
"FMOD_MODE_LOOP_NORMAL] ） （参见 [constant FMOD_MODE_3D] ） （参见 [constant FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM] ）"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_from_memory/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a [FmodSound] from audio data loaded in memory and adds [constant FMOD_MODE_OPENMEMORY] "
"to [param mode]. The returned sound retains the data array, so the caller does not need to keep a"
" separate reference to it.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags."
msgstr ""
"从内存中的音频数据创建 [FmodSound] ，并向 [param mode] 添加 [constant FMOD_MODE_OPENMEMORY] "
"标志。返回的声音会保留数据数组，调用者无需额外持有该数组。\n"
"- [param mode] —— 参数使用 [enum FmodMode] 标志指定创建选项"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_CREATECOMPRESSEDSAMPLE
msgid ""
"Creates a compressed sample that stays compressed in memory, decoding in real-time during "
"playback. Saves memory but uses more CPU."
msgstr "创建压缩采样"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_dsp_connection/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a connection for [method FmodDSP.add_input_preallocated]. Configure the mix or matrix "
"before attaching it. The FMOD system owns the connection; disconnecting it invalidates the "
"handle."
msgstr "为 [method FmodDSP.add_input_preallocated] 创建连接。挂载前应先配置混合电平或矩阵。连接归 FMOD 系统所有，断开连接后句柄失效。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_dsp/description:6
msgid ""
"Creates a custom FMOD 2.04 filter or generator. Cooldown is measured in sample frames. A channel "
"count of zero follows the input/system format. Set the sample callback using [method "
"FmodDSP.set_process_callback]."
msgstr ""
"创建 FMOD 2.04 自定义滤波器或信号生成器。冷却时间以采样帧计；通道数为零表示跟随输入或系统格式。通过 [method FmodDSP.set_process_callback] "
"设置采样回调。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_geometry/description:3
msgid ""
"Creates a geometry object for 3D occlusion calculations.\n"
"Geometry is used to simulate sound occlusion by physical objects in the scene."
msgstr ""
"为 3D 遮挡计算创建一个几何体对象，用于模拟场景中物理物体对声音的遮挡。\n"
"几何体用于模拟场景中实体物体对声音的遮挡。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_channel_group/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FmodChannelGroup] with the specified name. Channel groups allow you to organize "
"channels for collective control of volume, pitch, and effects."
msgstr "使用指定的名称创建一个新的 [FmodChannelGroup] 。通道组允许您组织通道，以便对音量、音调和效果进行集体控制。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_group/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FmodSoundGroup] with the specified name.\n"
"Sound groups allow you to organize sounds into categories with shared playback limits and "
"collective control.\n"
"Useful for managing weapon sounds, ambient sounds, or dialogue with max audible limits."
msgstr ""
"使用指定的名称创建一个新的 [FmodSoundGroup] 。\n"
"声音组允许您将声音组织到具有共享播放限制和集体控制的类别中。\n"
"对于管理武器声音、环境声音或具有最大可听限制的对话非常有用。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM
msgid "Creates a stream for the sound. Audio is decoded on-the-fly, saving memory for large files."
msgstr "创建流式声音"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_stream_from_file/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a streaming [FmodSound] from a file. Streams decode audio data on-the-fly, which is "
"memory-efficient for large files like background music.\n"
"For [code]res://[/code] paths, the wrapper loads the whole encoded file into memory and retains "
"it for the lifetime of the sound; decoding still happens as a stream.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags."
msgstr ""
"从文件创建一个流式 [FmodSound] 。流式会即时解码音频数据，对于像背景音乐这样的大文件非常节省内存。\n"
"对于 [code]res://[/code] 路径，包装器会将整个编码文件载入内存，并在声音存活期间保留；音频仍按流式方式解码。\n"
"- [code skip-lint]mode[/code] —— 参数使用 [enum FmodMode] 标志指定创建选项"

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:create_layout_from_godot/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates an independent configuration from the current Godot AudioServer buses and supported "
"effects. Unsupported effects are skipped. This does not activate or save the result. The Dock "
"conversion command also reports skipped effects."
msgstr "从 Godot AudioServer 当前总线及支持的效果器创建独立配置，跳过不支持的效果器。此方法不激活或保存结果，面板的转换命令还会报告跳过项。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_system/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates and returns a new, uninitialized [FmodSystem]. Returns [code]null[/code] if creation "
"fails.\n"
"Configure the system as needed, then call [method init] to initialize it.\n"
"To use the system managed by [FmodServer], call [method FmodServer.get_main_system]."
msgstr ""
"创建并返回一个尚未初始化的 [FmodSystem]。创建失败时返回 [code]null[/code]。\n"
"根据需要配置系统，再调用 [method init] 完成初始化。\n"
"通过 [method FmodServer.get_main_system] 获取由 [FmodServer] 管理的系统。"

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:preload/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates the internal [FmodSound] immediately using the current [member mode_flags].\n"
"Use this before playback to move FMOD sound creation and stream prebuffering out of the first "
"[method FmodAudioStreamPlayer.play] call.\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the sound is ready."
msgstr ""
"立即创建并缓存内部 [FmodSound] ，用于减少首次播放时的延迟。创建成功返回 [code]true[/code] 。 （参见 [member mode_flags] ）\n"
"播放前调用，可提前完成 FMOD 声音创建和流预缓冲，减少首次 [method FmodAudioStreamPlayer.play] 的工作量。\n"
"声音准备就绪时返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioStream/members:4/member:mode_flags
msgid ""
"Creation mode flags that determine how the audio is loaded and played. This is a bitmask of [enum"
" CreateMode] values. When these flags are changed, the internal [FmodSound] is released and will "
"be recreated with the new flags on the next call to [method get_sound].\n"
"Default value is [constant MODE_STREAM] (1)."
msgstr ""
"创建模式标志，用于确定音频的加载和播放方式。这是 [enum CreateMode] 值的位掩码。当这些标志被更改时，内部的 [FmodSound] 会被释放，并将在下一次调用 [method "
"get_sound] 时使用新的标志重新创建\n"
"默认值为 [constant MODE_STREAM] （1）。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_CUBIC
msgid "Cubic interpolation (slower, better quality)."
msgstr "三次插值重采样"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/members:4/member:playing
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:playing
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:playing
msgid "Current playback state. Can be set to start/stop playback."
msgstr "设置为 [code]true[/code] 开始播放，设置为 [code]false[/code] 停止播放"

#. FmodAudioPreviewProperty/brief_description:0
msgid "Custom property editor control for previewing FMOD audio streams in the editor."
msgstr "用于在编辑器中预览 FMOD 音频流的自定义属性控件。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_CUSTOM
msgid "Custom user-edited reverb properties."
msgstr "自定义参数"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_UNKNOWN
msgid "DSP created through a non-FMOD plugin, purpose unknown."
msgstr "通过第三方插件创建的 DSP，用途未知。"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_STREAM
msgid ""
"Decodes the in-memory audio data progressively. The complete source file remains in [member "
"audio_data]; streaming avoids decoding the entire sound into PCM at creation time."
msgstr "逐步解码内存中的音频数据。完整源文件仍保存在 [member audio_data] 中；流式模式避免在创建声音时将整段音频解码为 PCM。"

#. Class reference template
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_DEFAULT
msgid "Default resampler (platform-dependent, usually linear)."
msgstr "默认重采样方式"

#. FmodAudioStream/members:4/member:default_frequency
msgid ""
"Default sample rate used when importing or opening raw PCM data. Only needed for formats that "
"cannot describe their own frequency."
msgstr "导入或打开原始 PCM 数据时使用的默认采样率，仅用于无法自行提供采样率的格式。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_DEFAULT
msgid "Default sound creation mode."
msgstr "默认创建模式"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_DEFAULT
msgid "Default speaker mode for the selected output device."
msgstr "平台默认扬声器模式"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/brief_description:0
msgid "Delay/echo effect with dual taps and feedback support."
msgstr "双 Tap 延迟与反馈延迟效果。"

#. Class reference template
msgid "Deprecated:"
msgstr "已弃用："

#. Class reference template
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/members:4/member:bus
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:bus
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:bus
msgid ""
"Destination bus name from [method FmodServer.get_bus_names]. Godot provides the list when bus "
"synchronization is enabled; independent mode uses [method FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout]. An "
"unknown or renamed destination falls back to [code]Master[/code] when playback starts. Changing "
"the name does not reroute an existing channel."
msgstr ""
"目标总线名称，选项来自 [method FmodServer.get_bus_names]。开启总线同步时由 Godot 提供列表，独立模式使用 [method "
"FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout]。目标未知或被重命名时，下次播放回退到 [code]Master[/code]。修改名称不会重新路由已有的播放通道。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:detach_channel_group_from_port/description:2
msgid ""
"Detaches a channel group from its assigned audio port.\n"
"The channel group will return to normal routing to the master output."
msgstr ""
"将通道组从其分配的音频端口中分离。\n"
"通道组将恢复到主输出的正常路由。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/members:4/member:direct_occlusion
msgid "Direct sound occlusion factor from [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "直达声遮挡强度"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_OFF
msgid "Disables the reverb effect."
msgstr "关闭混响"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_THREAD_UNSAFE
msgid ""
"Disables thread safety for API calls. Only use if FMOD is called from a single thread and Studio "
"API is not used!"
msgstr "禁用 API 调用的线程安全。只有在从 FMOD 从单线程调用且未使用 Studio API 时才使用！"

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/methods:3/method:clear_buffer/description:1
msgid ""
"Discards all queued frames and resets [method get_pushed_frames] and [method "
"get_discarded_frames] to zero."
msgstr "丢弃队列中的所有帧，并将 [method get_pushed_frames] 和 [method get_discarded_frames] 计数器归零。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:disconnect_all/description:3
msgid "Disconnects all inputs and/or outputs from this DSP."
msgstr "断开当前 DSP 的所有输入和／或输出连接。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:disconnect_from/description:3
msgid "Disconnects this DSP from the specified target DSP."
msgstr "断开当前 DSP 与指定目标 DSP 的连接。"

#. FmodAudioPreviewProperty/description:1
msgid ""
"Displays an audio waveform, playback controls, a position indicator, and time labels for "
"[FmodAudioStream] in the inspector. Clicking the waveform seeks playback.\n"
"Shares waveform cache data with the [code]stream[/code] property previews on "
"[FmodAudioStreamPlayer], [FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D], and [FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D]. Waveform "
"generation is deferred to a later main-thread call.\n"
"Inspector audition uses an internal [FmodAudioStreamPlayer] routed to [code]Master[/code]. In "
"independent bus mode, its levels appear in the visible FMOD Audio Dock. The Dock does not display"
" levels from a separate running game process."
msgstr ""
"在检查器中为 [FmodAudioStream] 显示波形、播放控件、位置指示器和时间标签。点击波形可跳转播放位置。\n"
"与 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer]、[FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D] 和 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D] 的 "
"[code]stream[/code] 属性预览共享波形缓存。波形生成延迟到之后的主线程调用。\n"
"检查器试听通过内部 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer] 播放，发送到 [code]Master[/code]。独立总线模式下，可在展开的 FMOD Audio "
"面板查看其电平；独立运行游戏进程的电平暂未接入。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:attenuation_model
msgid "Distance attenuation model. See [enum AttenuationModel]."
msgstr "3D 距离衰减模型 （参见 [enum AttenuationModel] ）"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_max_distance/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_max_distance/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:max_distance
msgid ""
"Distance attenuation range in pixels, clamped to at least [code]1.0[/code]. The player sets its "
"channel volume to [code]-80.0[/code] dB when the listener is farther than this distance."
msgstr "以像素表示的距离衰减范围，最小为 [code]1.0[/code] 。监听器距离大于此值时，播放器将通道音量设为 [code]-80.0[/code] dB。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:max_distance
msgid "Distance from the center where the reverb fades out."
msgstr "混响淡出结束半径"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:min_distance
msgid "Distance from the center where the reverb is fully applied."
msgstr "完整混响半径"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:attenuation_filter_db
msgid ""
"Distance-filter level in dB, clamped to [code]-80.0[/code] through [code]0.0[/code]. "
"[code]0.0[/code] bypasses filtering; more negative values increase filtering around [member "
"attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz]. This controls filter strength, not a uniform volume reduction.\n"
"The player converts dB to the native filter amount as [code]1 - pow(10, db / 20)[/code]. Requires"
" [code]audio/fmod/init_flags/channel_distance_filter[/code] to be enabled before the FMOD system "
"is initialized. Restart the project after changing this setting."
msgstr ""
"距离滤波级别，单位为 dB，限制在 [code]-80.0[/code] 到 [code]0.0[/code] 之间。 [code]0.0[/code] 旁路滤波，数值越负， [member "
"attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz] 附近的滤波越强。此属性控制滤波强度，并非整体音量衰减。\n"
"播放器使用 [code]1 - pow(10, db / 20)[/code] 将 dB 转换为原生滤波量。需要在 FMOD 系统初始化前启用 "
"[code]audio/fmod/init_flags/channel_distance_filter[/code] ，修改此设置后请重启项目。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/brief_description:0
msgid "Distortion and overdrive effect with multiple distortion modes."
msgstr "失真效果，支持削波、反正切、低保真、过载、波形整形和比特压碎。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_DISTORTION
msgid "Distorts the sound."
msgstr "生成失真效果。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_MIXER
msgid "Does not process the signal, acts purely as a unit for mixing inputs."
msgstr "将输入信号混合，不进行额外处理。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:DOPPLER_TRACKING_IDLE_STEP
msgid ""
"Doppler effect is calculated during the idle/process step.\n"
"Suitable for visual-only movement tracking."
msgstr ""
"在普通处理帧中计算速度\n"
"在普通处理帧中计算速度"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:DOPPLER_TRACKING_PHYSICS_STEP
msgid ""
"Doppler effect is calculated during the physics step.\n"
"Recommended for physics-based movement for accurate results."
msgstr ""
"在物理处理帧中计算速度\n"
"在物理处理帧中计算速度"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED
msgid "Doppler effect is disabled. No pitch changes based on velocity."
msgstr "禁用多普勒追踪"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:doppler_tracking
msgid "Doppler effect tracking mode. See [enum DopplerTracking]."
msgstr "多普勒速度追踪模式 （参见 [enum DopplerTracking] ）"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_DLS
msgid "Downloadable Sounds format (DLS)."
msgstr "可下载音频（.dls）。MIDI（.mid）使用的多声音库格式"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_COMPRESSOR
msgid "Dynamic compression (linked/unlinked multi-channel, wideband)."
msgstr "动态压缩，支持多声道联动或独立处理，作用于全频段。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/brief_description:0
msgid "Dynamic range compressor for reducing the dynamic range of audio signals."
msgstr "动态压缩器。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_PARAMETER_DATA_TYPE_DYNAMIC_RESPONSE
msgid "Dynamic response data parameter type."
msgstr "动态响应数据参数类型。"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:early_late_mix
#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:early_late_mix
msgid "Early/late reflection mix in percent."
msgstr "早期与后期反射的混合百分比。"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:diffusion
msgid "Echo density of the late reverb (0.0 to 100.0)."
msgstr "回声扩散度，范围通常为 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]100.0[/code]"

#. FmodReverbZone3DGizmoPlugin/brief_description:0
msgid "Editor gizmo plugin for [FmodReverbZone3D]."
msgstr "[FmodReverbZone3D] 的编辑器辅助图形插件。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3DGizmoPlugin/brief_description:0
msgid "Editor gizmo plugin for visualizing FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D nodes in the 3D viewport."
msgstr "在三维视口中显示 FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D 节点辅助图形的编辑器插件。"

#. AudioImporterFmod/brief_description:0
msgid "Editor import plugin for importing audio files as FMOD audio streams."
msgstr "将音频文件导入为 FMOD 音频流的编辑器导入插件。"

#. FmodAudioPreviewInspector/brief_description:0
msgid "Editor inspector plugin that adds audio preview functionality for FmodAudioStream resources."
msgstr "为 FmodAudioStream 资源提供音频预览的编辑器检查器插件。"

#. ModifyAndroidBuildTemplatePlugin/brief_description:0
msgid "Editor plugin for installing FMOD Android libraries into the Android build template."
msgstr "将 FMOD Android 库安装到 Android 构建模板中的编辑器插件。"

#. FmodGeometryMeshToolsPlugin/brief_description:0
msgid "Editor tool for creating FMOD geometry nodes from selected meshes."
msgstr "从选中的网格创建 FMOD 几何节点的编辑器工具。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/signals:5/signal:geometry_created/description:0
msgid "Emitted after a new FMOD geometry object has been created."
msgstr "创建新的 FMOD 几何体对象后发出。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/signals:5/signal:geometry_rebuilt/description:0
msgid "Emitted after geometry has been rebuilt."
msgstr "几何体重新构建后发出。"

#. FmodServer/signals:5/signal:bus_layout_changed/description:0
msgid ""
"Emitted after the active layout is replaced or its bus names or display order change. Use it to "
"refresh bus selectors."
msgstr "当前布局被替换，或总线名称、显示顺序变化后发出。可用于刷新总线选择列表。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/signals:5/signal:geometry_cleared/description:0
msgid "Emitted after the internal geometry has been released."
msgstr "内部几何体释放后发出。"

#. FmodChannel/signals:5/signal:occlusion/description:2
msgid ""
"Emitted when 3D occlusion is calculated for this channel.\n"
"This signal is only emitted when using FMOD's 3D occlusion features.\n"
"- [param direct_occlusion]: Occlusion factor for direct sound (0.0 = no occlusion, 1.0 = fully "
"occluded)\n"
"- [param reverb_occlusion]: Occlusion factor for reverberant sound (0.0 = no occlusion, 1.0 = "
"fully occluded)\n"
"Higher occlusion values typically result in muffled sound (low-pass filtering)."
msgstr ""
"计算该通道的三维遮挡时发出。\n"
"仅在使用 FMOD 三维遮挡功能时发出。\n"
"- [param direct_occlusion] ：直达声遮挡，0.0 为无遮挡，1.0 为完全遮挡\n"
"- [param reverb_occlusion] ：混响声遮挡，0.0 为无遮挡，1.0 为完全遮挡\n"
"遮挡值越高，声音通常越闷，表现为低通滤波。"

#. FmodChannelControl/signals:5/signal:callback_received/description:1
msgid ""
"Emitted when a callback is received from FMOD. The [param type] parameter indicates the type of "
"callback event that occurred. Connect to this signal to receive notifications about channel "
"events such as sound finished playing, etc."
msgstr "收到 FMOD 回调时发出， [param type] 表示回调事件类型。可连接此信号以接收播放结束等通道事件。"

#. FmodChannel/signals:5/signal:syncpoint/description:1
msgid ""
"Emitted when a sync point embedded in the sound file is reached.\n"
"Sync points are markers that can be embedded in audio files to trigger events at specific times.\n"
"The [param sync_point_index] parameter indicates which sync point was triggered.\n"
"Pass it to [method FmodSound.get_sync_point] to get the sync point handle, which can then be used"
" with [method FmodSound.get_sync_point_info] to retrieve the sync point's name and offset."
msgstr ""
"到达声音文件中嵌入的同步点时发出。\n"
"同步点是嵌入音频文件中的标记，可在指定时刻触发事件。\n"
"[param sync_point_index] 表示触发的同步点索引。\n"
"将索引传给 [method FmodSound.get_sync_point] 获取同步点句柄，再调用 [method FmodSound.get_sync_point_info] "
"查询同步点名称和偏移。"

#. FmodChannel/signals:5/signal:ended/description:0
msgid ""
"Emitted when playback of the sound has finished.\n"
"This is triggered when the sound reaches its end and is not looping,\n"
"or when all loop iterations have completed."
msgstr ""
"声音播放结束时发出。\n"
"声音播放到结尾且未启用循环时触发，\n"
"或在所有循环次数完成后触发。"

#. FmodChannel/signals:5/signal:virtualvoice/description:1
msgid ""
"Emitted when the channel becomes virtual ([param is_becoming_virtual] is [code]true[/code]) or "
"real ([code]false[/code]). Channels with larger priority numbers have lower priority and are "
"virtualized first when voices are scarce."
msgstr ""
"通道变为虚拟声部时发出， [param is_becoming_virtual] 为 [code]true[/code] ；恢复实际声部时为 [code]false[/code] "
"。优先级数值越大，实际优先级越低，声部不足时会先被虚拟化。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/signals:5/signal:finished/description:0
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/signals:5/signal:finished/description:0
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/signals:5/signal:finished/description:0
msgid ""
"Emitted when the playback channel ends. Calling [method stop] or replacing [member stream] does "
"not emit this signal."
msgstr "播放通道结束时发出。调用 [method stop] 或替换 [member stream] 不会发出此信号。"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_LOOP_BIDI
msgid ""
"Enable bidirectional (ping-pong) loop playback. When the audio reaches the end, it will play "
"backwards to the beginning, then forwards again, creating a seamless back-and-forth loop."
msgstr "启用双向（乒乓）循环播放。当音频播放到末尾时，它会向后播放到开始位置，然后再次向前播放，创建一个无缝的来回循环"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_LOOP
msgid "Enable normal loop playback. When the audio reaches the end, it will loop back to the beginning."
msgstr "启用正常循环播放。当音频播放到末尾时，它会回到开头重新播放"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_PROFILE_ENABLE
msgid ""
"Enables TCP/IP profiling host, allowing FMOD Studio or FMOD Profiler to connect and view memory, "
"CPU, and DSP graphs in real-time."
msgstr "启用基于TCP/IP的主机，允许FMOD Studio或FMOD Profiler连接，实时查看内存、CPU 和 DSP 图表"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CLIP_OUTPUT
msgid "Enables hard clipping of output values greater than 1.0 or less than -1.0."
msgstr "支持对输出值大于1.0f或小于-1.0f进行硬削波"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_PROFILE_METER_ALL
msgid ""
"Enables level metering on all DSPs. This is slower but provides level information for all units "
"in the DSP graph."
msgstr ""
"虽然速度较慢，但可以为图表中的每个DSP单元添加电平计量。使用DSP::setMeteringEnable来单独关闭电表。设置这个标志意味着有 "
"[code]FMOD_INIT_PROFILE_ENABLE[/code]"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_LOWPASS
msgid "Enables lowpass gain and 3D occlusion features on channels, and automatic use of the Geometry API."
msgstr ""
"启用 ChannelControl::setLowPassGain、ChannelControl::set3DOcclusion，或 Geometry API 的自动使用。所有语音都会在 DSP"
" 链中添加软件低通滤波效果，除非使用上述功能或特性，否则该效果处于空闲状态"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_MEMORY_TRACKING
msgid ""
"Enables memory allocation tracking. Currently only useful when using the Studio API. Increases "
"memory usage and reduces performance."
msgstr ""
"启用内存分配追踪。目前仅在使用 Studio API 时有效。增加内存占用并降低性能。该标志由 [code]FMOD_STUDIO_INIT_MEMORY_TRACKING "
"<https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.02/api/studio-api-"
"system.html#fmod_studio_init_memory_tracking>[/code] 隐含"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_metering_enabled/description:3
msgid "Enables or disables metering for input and output signals."
msgstr "启用或关闭输入和输出的电平计量。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap1_active/description:2
msgid "Enables or disables tap 1."
msgstr "启用或禁用第一个 Tap。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap2_active/description:2
msgid "Enables or disables tap 2."
msgstr "启用或禁用第二个 Tap。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_emission_angle_enabled/description:2
msgid ""
"Enables or disables the directional emission cone.\n"
"When enabled, sound is projected in a cone rather than omnidirectionally."
msgstr ""
"启用或禁用方向性发射锥\n"
"启用后，声音通过锥形区域向外传播。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_feedback_active/description:2
msgid "Enables or disables the feedback loop."
msgstr "启用或禁用反馈延迟。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_active/description:2
msgid ""
"Enables or disables this geometry object.\n"
"When inactive ([code]false[/code]), the geometry does not contribute to occlusion calculations.\n"
"Use this to toggle geometry on/off without rebuilding it."
msgstr ""
"启用或禁用几何体遮挡计算。\n"
"未激活（ [code]false[/code] ）时不参与遮挡计算。\n"
"可直接切换几何体的启用状态，无需重新构建。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_active/description:2
msgid ""
"Enables or disables this reverb zone.\n"
"When inactive ([code]false[/code]), the reverb does not contribute to the audio output.\n"
"Use this to toggle reverb on/off without destroying and recreating it."
msgstr ""
"启用或禁用该混响区域。\n"
"未激活（ [code]false[/code] ）时不参与音频输出。\n"
"可直接切换混响的启用状态，无需销毁并重新创建。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:set_immediate_mode/description:2
msgid ""
"Enables synchronous FFT calculation for offline analysis. This disables FMOD FFT hardware "
"acceleration."
msgstr "启用同步 FFT 计算以进行离线分析。此模式会关闭 FMOD FFT 硬件加速。"

