#. FmodAudioEffectAmplify/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectAmplify is a basic gain control effect that increases or decreases the volume of "
"the audio signal. It provides both decibel (dB) and linear control over the amplification level."
"\n"
"Use this effect for simple volume adjustments, boosting quiet signals, or attenuating loud "
"signals in your audio pipeline."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectAmplify[/b] 会在总线效果链中创建一个增益 DSP。它适合做总线音量微调、临时放大或衰减，也可以在运行时用 [code skip-"
"lint]volume_db[/code] 或 [code skip-lint]volume_linear[/code] 做平滑的强度控制。\n"
"用于调整音量、放大较弱的信号或衰减过强的信号。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectChorus creates a chorus effect by mixing the original signal with multiple delayed"
" and pitch-modulated copies (voices). This produces a thicker, richer sound similar to multiple "
"instruments or voices playing in unison.\n"
"The effect uses up to 4 voices, each with independently configurable delay, modulation rate, "
"depth, level, filter cutoff, and panning. Use this effect to add warmth, depth, and spatial width"
" to audio."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectChorus[/b] 通过多个轻微延迟并调制的 voice 叠加出合唱感。你可以控制整体干湿比例，也可以逐 voice "
"调整延迟、调制速率、深度、电平、截止频率和声像。\n"
"最多使用 4 个声部，每个声部的延迟、调制速率、深度、电平、截止频率和声像均可独立配置，可增加声音的厚度、层次和立体声宽度。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectCompressor is a dynamic range compression effect that reduces the volume of loud "
"sounds while leaving quiet sounds unchanged. It is commonly used to control dynamics, prevent "
"clipping, and make audio more consistent in loudness.\n"
"The compressor works by measuring the input level and reducing gain when it exceeds a specified "
"threshold. The amount of reduction is determined by the ratio, and the response time is "
"controlled by attack and release parameters.\n"
"This effect supports makeup gain and a dry/wet mix for parallel compression. Sidechain routing is"
" not implemented; setting [member sidechain] only stores the requested bus name."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectCompressor[/b] 用于压低超过阈值的动态范围，并可通过输出增益补偿响度。 [code skip-lint]threshold_db[/code] "
"决定开始压缩的位置， [code skip-lint]ratio[/code] 决定压缩强度， [code skip-lint]attack_us[/code] 和 [code skip-"
"lint]release_ms[/code] 控制响应速度， [code skip-lint]mix[/code] 可用于并行压缩。\n"
"压缩器检测输入电平，并在超过阈值时降低增益。压缩比决定增益衰减量，启动和释放参数决定响应速度。\n"
"该效果器支持补偿增益和用于并行压缩的干湿混合。当前尚未实现侧链路由；设置 [member sidechain] 只会保存请求的总线名称。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectDelay creates echo and delay effects by delaying the audio signal and mixing it "
"back with the original. It features two independent delay taps with configurable delay time, "
"level, and panning, plus a feedback loop for creating repeating echoes.\n"
"Use this effect to create simple echoes, rhythmic delays, or ambient spaces."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectDelay[/b] 提供两个独立 Tap 和一个可选反馈回路。每个 Tap 都可以设置延迟时间、电平和声像，反馈回路则可以设置延迟、电平和低通截止频率。\n"
"用于生成回声、节奏延迟或环境空间感。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectDistortion applies various types of distortion to audio signals, creating effects "
"ranging from subtle overdrive to harsh digital artifacts. It supports multiple distortion modes "
"including hard clipping, soft clipping, tube overdrive, lo-fi reduction, and bitcrushing.\n"
"Use this effect to add grit, warmth, or aggressive character to audio."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectDistortion[/b] 使用自定义 DSP 提供削波、软削波、低保真量化、过载和波形整形等失真模式，可调节前级增益、驱动量、后级增益及高频保留频率。\n"
"用于增加粗粝感、温暖感或强烈的失真音色。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ is a base class for multi-band equalizer audio effects using FMOD's "
"MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It provides flexible frequency equalization with support for multiple bands, "
"each with independent gain, frequency, Q value, and filter type.\n"
"The effect supports three preset configurations: 6-band, 10-band, and 21-band equalizers. Each "
"band uses a peaking filter by default, but can be configured with other filter types including "
"low-pass, high-pass, low-shelf, high-shelf, and more.\n"
"To apply this effect to an audio bus, use [method FmodAudioEffect.apply_to] and pass a "
"[FmodChannelGroup]."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ 是基于 FMOD MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 的多频段均衡器基类。每个频段均可独立设置增益、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。\n"
"支持 6 段、10 段和 21 段配置。各频段默认使用峰值滤波器，也可配置为低通、高通、低架、高架等类型。\n"
"调用 [method FmodAudioEffect.apply_to] 并传入 [FmodChannelGroup] ，将效果器应用到音频总线。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ10/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ10 is a 10-band graphic equalizer using FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. Its initial "
"center frequencies span 31.25 Hz through 16000 Hz.\n"
"Each band can be individually adjusted for gain (-60 dB to +24 dB), frequency, Q value, and "
"filter type. By default, all bands use peaking filters with a Q value of 0.707.\n"
"The initial center frequencies are 31.25 Hz, 62.5 Hz, 125 Hz, 250 Hz, 500 Hz, 1000 Hz, 2000 Hz, "
"4000 Hz, 8000 Hz, and 16000 Hz.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For simpler control, use [FmodAudioEffectEQ6]. For professional-grade equalization, "
"use [FmodAudioEffectEQ21]."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ10 是使用 FMOD MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 的十频段均衡器，初始中心频率覆盖 31.25 Hz 到 16000 Hz。\n"
"每个频段均可独立设置增益（-60 dB 到 +24 dB）、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。默认使用 Q 值为 0.707 的峰值滤波器。\n"
"初始中心频率依次为 31.25、62.5、125、250、500、1000、2000、4000、8000 和 16000 Hz。\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 简单的均衡控制可使用 [FmodAudioEffectEQ6] ，更精细的均衡控制可使用 [FmodAudioEffectEQ21] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ21/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ21 is a 21-band graphic equalizer using FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It provides "
"professional-grade frequency equalization across twenty-one bands spanning from 22Hz to 22000Hz."
"\n"
"Each band can be individually adjusted for gain (-60 dB to +24 dB), frequency, Q value, and "
"filter type. By default, all bands use peaking filters with a Q value of 0.707.\n"
"The frequency bands are: 22Hz, 32Hz, 44Hz, 63Hz, 90Hz, 125Hz, 175Hz, 250Hz, 350Hz, 500Hz, 700Hz, "
"1000Hz, 1400Hz, 2000Hz, 2800Hz, 4000Hz, 5600Hz, 8000Hz, 11000Hz, 16000Hz, and 22000Hz.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This equalizer uses multiple MULTIBAND_EQ DSP units internally (each supports 5 "
"bands). For simpler control, use [FmodAudioEffectEQ6] or [FmodAudioEffectEQ10]."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectEQ21[/b] 是 [code skip-lint]FmodAudioEffectEQ[/code] 的 21 频段预设版本。默认频段从 "
"[code]22[/code] Hz 延伸到 [code]22000[/code] Hz。它继承 [code skip-lint]FmodAudioEffectEQ[/code] "
"的全部属性和方法。\n"
"每个频段均可独立设置增益（-60 dB 到 +24 dB）、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。默认使用 Q 值为 0.707 的峰值滤波器。\n"
"频段中心频率依次为 22、32、44、63、90、125、175、250、350、500、700、1000、1400、2000、2800、4000、5600、8000、11000、16000 和"
" 22000 Hz。\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 内部使用多个 MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 单元，每个单元支持 5 个频段。较简单的控制可使用 [FmodAudioEffectEQ6] 或 "
"[FmodAudioEffectEQ10] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ6/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ6 is a 6-band equalizer using FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. Its initial center "
"frequencies span 32 Hz through 10000 Hz, at approximately logarithmic intervals.\n"
"Each band can be individually adjusted for gain (-60 dB to +24 dB), frequency, Q value, and "
"filter type. By default, all bands use peaking filters with a Q value of 0.707.\n"
"The frequency bands are: 32Hz, 100Hz, 320Hz, 1000Hz, 3200Hz, and 10000Hz.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For finer control, use [FmodAudioEffectEQ10] or [FmodAudioEffectEQ21]."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ6 是使用 FMOD MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 的六频段均衡器，初始中心频率以近似对数间隔分布在 32 Hz 到 10000 Hz 之间。\n"
"每个频段均可独立设置增益（-60 dB 到 +24 dB）、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。默认使用 Q 值为 0.707 的峰值滤波器。\n"
"频段中心频率依次为 32、100、320、1000、3200 和 10000 Hz。\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 需要更精细的控制时，可使用 [FmodAudioEffectEQ10] 或 [FmodAudioEffectEQ21] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectFilter configures one low-pass band in FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It exposes cutoff "
"frequency, slope, gain, and resonance settings. It does not expose high-pass or band-pass modes; "
"use [FmodAudioEffectEQ] for those filter types.\n"
"Use this effect to attenuate high frequencies, create muffled audio, or emphasize the cutoff "
"region through resonance."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectFilter 配置 FMOD MULTIBAND_EQ DSP 中的一个低通频段，并提供截止频率、斜率、增益和共振设置。该类没有高通或带通模式；这些滤波类型可使用 "
"[FmodAudioEffectEQ] 。\n"
"可用于衰减高频、制作沉闷音效，或通过共振突出截止频率附近的声音。"

#. FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter is a brick-wall limiter that prevents the audio signal from exceeding "
"a specified ceiling level. It ensures that the output never goes above the threshold, effectively"
" preventing clipping and distortion that can occur when signals exceed 0 dBFS.\n"
"The limiter uses look-ahead processing with approximately 2 ms of audio delay to control peaks, "
"followed by the configured release. It limits sampled peaks; it does not measure reconstructed "
"inter-sample peaks.\n"
"The limiter can also apply pre-gain to boost the signal before limiting, allowing you to maximize"
" perceived loudness while staying within safe levels."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter[/b] 用于阻止信号峰值超过指定上限。它常放在总线效果链后段，用于保护输出、抑制突发峰值或给某个总线做简单的安全限制。\n"
"限制器使用约 2 ms 音频延迟的前瞻处理控制峰值，并按设定的释放时间恢复增益。它限制采样点峰值，不测量重建后的采样间峰值。\n"
"支持在限幅前增加预增益，以在控制峰值的同时提高感知响度。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPanner/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPanner uses a custom DSP to distribute the first two input channels between the "
"left and right output channels. Additional channels pass through unchanged.\n"
"A pan value of 0.0 preserves the original left and right signals. Negative values move the signal"
" toward the left output, while positive values move it toward the right output. Stereo input is "
"not summed to mono at the center position.\n"
"This effect simulates Godot's AudioEffectPanner and provides a simple way to spatialize mono or "
"stereo audio in a 2D stereo soundstage."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectPanner 使用自定义 DSP，将前两个输入声道分配到左右输出声道，其他声道保持不变。\n"
"声像为 0.0 时保留原始左右声道信号。负值将信号移向左输出，正值将信号移向右输出。位于中央时不会将立体声输入合并为单声道。\n"
"模拟 Godot 的 AudioEffectPanner，用于在二维立体声声场中调整单声道或立体声音频的位置。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPhaser uses a custom DSP with six modulated all-pass stages per channel. The "
"filtered signal is mixed with the original signal, and feedback controls the amount fed back "
"through the filter chain.\n"
"The modulation sweeps between [member range_min_hz] and [member range_max_hz] at [member "
"rate_hz]. [member depth] controls the filtered signal level added to the original signal."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioEffectPhaser 使用自定义 DSP，为每个声道设置六级受调制的全通滤波器。滤波信号会与原始信号混合，反馈量控制重新送入滤波链的信号强度。\n"
"调制以 [member rate_hz] 指定的速率在 [member range_min_hz] 和 [member range_max_hz] 之间扫频。 [member depth] "
"控制叠加到原始信号上的滤波信号电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPitchShift/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPitchShift changes the pitch (perceived frequency) of the audio signal without "
"changing its duration or playback speed. This is useful for creating harmonization effects, "
"correcting pitch, or creating special sound effects.\n"
"The effect uses FFT (Fast Fourier Transform) based processing with adjustable FFT size and "
"oversampling parameters to control the quality and latency trade-offs. Larger FFT sizes provide "
"better frequency resolution but introduce more latency, while oversampling can improve quality at"
" the cost of increased CPU usage.\n"
"Pitch can be adjusted via pitch scale (multiplier) for intuitive control. A pitch scale of 1.0 is"
" unity, 2.0 is one octave up, and 0.5 is one octave down."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectPitchShift[/b] 用 FFT 处理改变信号音高。 [code skip-lint]pitch_scale[/code] 控制音高倍率， [code"
" skip-lint]fft_size[/code] 与 [code skip-lint]oversampling[/code] 会影响声音质量、延迟和 CPU 开销。\n"
"基于 FFT（快速傅里叶变换）处理，可通过 FFT 大小和过采样参数调节质量与延迟。FFT 越大，频率分辨率越高，延迟也越大；过采样可改善质量，同时增加 CPU 开销。\n"
"通过音高倍率控制音高：1.0 为原音高，2.0 升高一个八度，0.5 降低一个八度。"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectReverb creates the impression of sound being played in a physical space by "
"simulating reflections and decay characteristics of various environments. Use this effect to add "
"depth, warmth, and realism to audio sources.\n"
"Adjust the dry/wet mix to control the balance between the original signal and the reverberated "
"signal. Increase room size for cathedral-like spaces, or decrease for small room ambience."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectReverb[/b] 是用于总线的混响效果，参数风格接近 Godot 的 [code skip-lint]AudioEffectReverb[/code] "
"。它通过房间尺寸、阻尼、预延迟、扩散和干湿比例塑造空间感，适合给一组声音统一添加环境混响。\n"
"通过干湿混合比例调节原始信号与混响信号的平衡。较大的房间尺寸可模拟教堂等空间，较小的值可模拟小房间。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer analyzes the frequency content of audio passing through an audio "
"bus in real-time using Fast Fourier Transform (FFT). This is essential for creating audio "
"visualizations such as spectrum analyzers, equalizer displays, or reactive audio effects.\n"
"The effect processes incoming audio and provides frequency magnitude data that can be queried "
"using [method get_magnitude_for_frequency_range]. You can analyze specific frequency ranges "
"(e.g., bass, midrange, treble) independently.\n"
"Queries reuse a spectrum snapshot while the bus DSP clock is unchanged. The next audio block "
"automatically refreshes the snapshot, including when manually mixing multiple blocks in one game "
"frame. Changing [member fft_size] or attaching the effect to another bus invalidates the "
"snapshot.\n"
"The [member fft_size] determines the analysis window and frequency resolution. Larger FFT sizes "
"provide finer frequency detail at the cost of time resolution and processing work. [member "
"buffer_length] is currently stored for compatibility and does not change the FFT window or retain"
" audio history.\n"
"When configured in a [FmodAudioBusLayout] slot, obtain its runtime instance with [method "
"FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] and query that instance. Shared configuration resources "
"create independent analysis state for each slot."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer[/b] 会在总线效果链中插入 FFT "
"DSP，并从中读取频谱数据。它不会主动改变声音，主要用于可视化、节拍/能量检测、频段驱动的 UI 或调试混音。\n"
"处理输入音频并提供频率幅度数据，可通过 [method get_magnitude_for_frequency_range] 分别查询低频、中频、高频等频段。\n"
"总线 DSP 时钟未变化时，查询会复用频谱快照。下一个音频块会刷新快照，同一游戏帧中手动混音多个音频块时也会更新。修改 [member fft_size] 或将效果器挂载到其他总线会使快照失效。"
"\n"
"[member fft_size] 决定分析窗口和频率分辨率。FFT 越大，频率细节越精确，但时间分辨率更低、处理开销更大。 [member buffer_length] "
"当前仅为兼容而保存，不会改变 FFT 窗口，也不会保留音频历史。\n"
"配置在 [FmodAudioBusLayout] 槽位中时，通过 [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] "
"获取运行实例并查询该实例。共享配置资源的槽位各自拥有独立分析状态。"

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance is a stereo widening/enhancement effect that can expand or contract "
"the perceived stereo width of audio signals. It uses multiple techniques including pan pullout, "
"time-based separation, and surround processing to manipulate the stereo image.\n"
"The effect can create wider, more immersive stereo fields for music and sound effects, or narrow "
"the stereo image for mono compatibility. Use it to add spaciousness to narrow recordings, create "
"special stereo effects, or ensure mono compatibility when needed.\n"
"Pan pullout scales the side signal around the average of the left and right channels across the "
"full frequency range. With surround disabled, time pullout delays the right channel. With "
"surround enabled, it delays the mid signal and adds it to the left channel while subtracting it "
"from the right channel."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance[/b] 用于加宽或强化立体声形象。 [code skip-lint]pan_pullout[/code] 调整左右声像拉开感， "
"[code skip-lint]time_pullout_ms[/code] 增加双声道时间差， [code skip-lint]surround[/code] 控制环绕增强量。\n"
"可扩展音乐和音效的立体声声场，也可缩窄声像以改善单声道兼容性。\n"
"声像扩展以左右声道平均值为中心，缩放全频段的侧信号。关闭环绕时，时间扩展会延迟右声道；启用环绕时，会延迟中间信号，再加到左声道并从右声道减去。"

#. FmodAudioPreviewInspector/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioPreviewInspector is an editor plugin that enhances the inspector interface for "
"[FmodAudioStream] resources. It adds a visual waveform preview and playback controls directly in "
"the inspector panel.\n"
"This allows developers to preview audio assets without needing to play them in-game or use "
"external tools."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioPreviewInspector 在 [FmodAudioStream] 的检查器面板中添加波形预览和播放控件。\n"
"可直接预览音频资源，无需运行游戏。"

#. FmodAudioStream/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioStream is a Resource that holds audio data for playback through the FMOD audio engine. "
"It supports loading audio from files (including [code]res://[/code] paths) and provides "
"configurable creation modes for streaming or sample-based playback.\n"
"The stream can be played using [FmodAudioStreamPlayer] or used directly with FMOD's channel "
"system. The underlying [FmodSound] object is created lazily when first requested via [method "
"get_sound]."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioStream 是一个资源，用于通过 FMOD 音频引擎播放音频数据。它支持从文件（包括 [code]res://[/code] "
"路径）加载音频，并提供可配置的创建模式以进行流式或基于样本的播放\n"
"可以使用 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer] 播放该流，也可以直接使用 FMOD 的通道系统。底层的 [FmodSound] 对象会在首次通过 [method get_sound] "
"请求时惰性创建"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3DGizmoPlugin/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer3DGizmoPlugin is an editor-only plugin that provides visual gizmos for "
"[FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D] nodes in the 3D editor viewport. It displays visual indicators for the "
"audio source's position, attenuation range, and emission cone.\n"
"The gizmo helps designers visualize:\n"
"- The position of 3D audio sources in the scene\n"
"- The maximum distance/attenuation radius\n"
"- The directional emission cone (when enabled)\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an editor-only class and is not available in exported projects. It is "
"automatically registered when the plugin loads."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer3DGizmoPlugin 为三维编辑器视口中的 [FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D] 提供位置、衰减范围和发声锥辅助图形。\n"
"辅助图形可显示：\n"
"- 场景中三维音源的位置\n"
"- 最大距离或衰减半径\n"
"- 定向发声锥（启用时）\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 此类仅在编辑器中可用，导出项目中不可用。插件加载时会自动注册。"

#. FmodChannel/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodChannel represents an active voice in the FMOD mixer. When a sound is played via [method "
"FmodSystem.play_sound], FMOD allocates a channel to play that sound. This class provides control "
"over playback parameters such as frequency, position, looping, and virtual voice priority.\n"
"Channels are automatically managed by FMOD's virtual voice system. When there are more sounds "
"playing than physical voices available, lower-priority channels may be \"virtualized\" (silently "
"processed in the background without consuming hardware resources).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class extends [FmodChannelControl], which provides additional functionality "
"including volume, pitch, pan, 3D positioning, DSP effects, and more."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodChannel[/b] 表示 FMOD 中一次实际或虚拟的声音播放实例。它继承 [code skip-lint]FmodChannelControl[/code] "
"的通用控制能力，并额外提供播放频率、优先级、播放位置、循环点、所属 ChannelGroup、当前声音和通道索引等接口。 （参见 [method FmodSystem.play_sound] ）"
"\n"
"FMOD 的虚拟声部系统会自动管理通道。播放的声音多于物理声部时，低优先级通道可能转为虚拟声部，在后台静默处理且不占用硬件声部。\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 继承自 [FmodChannelControl] ，可使用其音量、音高、声像、三维定位和 DSP 等功能。"

#. FmodChannelControl/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodChannelControl provides shared playback, volume, spatialization, DSP-chain, and scheduling "
"operations for [FmodChannel] and [FmodChannelGroup]. Obtain an initialized channel or group from "
"[FmodSystem]; a newly instantiated base object has no FMOD handle."
msgstr ""
"FmodChannelControl 为 [FmodChannel] 和 [FmodChannelGroup] 提供播放、音量、空间化、DSP 链和调度操作。通过 [FmodSystem] "
"获取已绑定句柄的通道或组；直接实例化基类不会创建 FMOD 句柄。"

#. FmodChannelGroup/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodChannelGroup is used to organize multiple channels into a group for collective control. It "
"extends [FmodChannelControl], inheriting all its functionality including volume control, panning,"
" DSP effects, and sample-accurate scheduling.\n"
"Channel groups form a hierarchical tree structure where each group can contain channels and other"
" groups. Audio from all child channels and groups flows through the parent group, allowing for "
"complex mixing hierarchies. The root of this tree is the master channel group, accessible via "
"[method FmodServer.get_master_channel_group].\n"
"Common use cases include:\n"
"- Creating separate mix buses for music, SFX, and dialogue\n"
"- Applying effects (reverb, EQ) to groups of sounds\n"
"- Controlling volume of entire categories of audio\n"
"- Managing complex routing configurations with nested groups"
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodChannelGroup[/b] 表示 FMOD 的 ChannelGroup，可作为多个 Channel 或子 ChannelGroup "
"的输入目标。它继承通用的播放、音量、DSP 和调度控制能力，适合用于分组混音、总线式控制和批量停止声音。 （参见 [FmodChannelControl] ）\n"
"通道组形成层级树，每个组可以包含通道和其他组。所有子通道和子组的音频流向父组。根节点为主通道组，可通过 [method FmodServer.get_master_channel_group] "
"获取。\n"
"常见用途包括：\n"
"- 为音乐、音效和对话分别创建混音总线\n"
"- 为一组声音应用混响或 EQ 等效果\n"
"- 统一控制整个音频分类的音量\n"
"- 通过嵌套通道组管理复杂路由"

#. FmodDSP/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodDSP wraps the FMOD Core API's DSP (Digital Signal Processing) unit. It provides access to "
"various audio effects and processing units such as oscillators, filters, reverb, delay, and more."
" DSP units can be connected together to form complex audio processing chains."
msgstr "FmodDSP 封装 FMOD Core API 的 DSP（数字信号处理）单元，可用于振荡器、滤波、混响、延迟等音频处理。多个 DSP 单元可以连接成音频处理链。"

#. FmodDSPConnection/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodDSPConnection represents a connection between two FmodDSP units in the FMOD DSP signal "
"processing graph. It allows control over the signal flow, including volume mixing and channel "
"matrix routing."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodDSPConnection[/b] 表示两个 [code skip-lint]FmodDSP[/code] 之间的一条连接。可以通过它调整连接混合电平、混音矩阵，并查询输入输出 "
"DSP。"

#. FmodGeometry/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodGeometry is used to create geometric shapes that affect 3D audio propagation in the FMOD "
"audio engine. It allows you to define polygons that act as occluders, blocking or attenuating "
"sound based on their properties.\n"
"Key features:\n"
"- Create polygonal shapes that block sound paths between sources and listeners\n"
"- Configure occlusion properties (direct and reverb path attenuation)\n"
"- Support for double-sided polygons\n"
"- Position, rotate, and scale geometry in 3D space\n"
"- Serialize geometry data for efficient loading/saving\n"
"When a sound source is behind geometry relative to the listener, FMOD calculates occlusion values"
" that can be used to muffle the sound (direct occlusion) and reduce its reverb contribution "
"(reverb occlusion).\n"
"To apply automatic geometry filtering to channels, enable [constant "
"FmodSystem.FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_LOWPASS] or [constant "
"FmodSystem.FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_DISTANCEFILTER] when initializing the system."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodGeometry[/b] 封装 FMOD Geometry，用多边形描述场景中的墙体、地形、门板等遮挡物。FMOD 会根据声源与监听器之间的几何体计算直达声遮挡和混响遮挡，常用于让"
" 3D 声音在墙后变闷、变小，或减少混响发送。\n"
"主要特性：\n"
"- 创建多边形，遮挡音源与监听者之间的声音路径\n"
"- 配置直达声和混响声的遮挡衰减\n"
"- 支持双面多边形\n"
"- 在三维空间中移动、旋转和缩放几何体\n"
"- 序列化几何数据以便加载和保存\n"
"音源相对听者位于几何体背后时，FMOD 计算直达声和混响声的遮挡值，可用于减弱高频和混响贡献。\n"
"要将几何遮挡自动应用到通道滤波，初始化系统时启用 [constant FmodSystem.FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_LOWPASS] 或 [constant "
"FmodSystem.FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_DISTANCEFILTER] 。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodGeometryInstance3D creates an FMOD Geometry object from child [CollisionShape3D] nodes, a "
"selected [MeshInstance3D], or a [Mesh] resource. It is designed to be placed in the scene as a "
"solid audio occluder: add this node, add collision shapes below it, then tune direct and reverb "
"occlusion in the Inspector.\n"
"The node keeps the FMOD geometry transform synchronized with its global transform at runtime."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodGeometryInstance3D[/b] 用于将场景中的几何体注册到 FMOD Geometry 系统，让 3D 声音可以根据场景遮挡产生直达声和混响遮挡 （参见 "
"[CollisionShape3D] ） （参见 [MeshInstance3D] ） （参见 [Mesh] ）\n"
"该节点在运行时将全局变换同步到 FMOD 几何体。"

#. FmodGeometryMeshToolsPlugin/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodGeometryMeshToolsPlugin adds editor actions for selected [MeshInstance3D] nodes. It can "
"create [FmodGeometryInstance3D] children configured for mesh or collision-shape based FMOD "
"occlusion.\n"
"This class is registered for editor integration and is normally managed by the plugin "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"FmodGeometryMeshToolsPlugin 为选中的 [MeshInstance3D] 添加编辑器操作，可创建 [FmodGeometryInstance3D] "
"子节点，并使用网格或碰撞形状配置 FMOD 遮挡。\n"
"此类用于编辑器集成，通常由插件自动管理。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodReverbZone3D owns an internal [FmodReverb3D] while inside the scene tree. Its global position"
" is the center of the reverb environment. The environment has full influence when the listener is"
" within [member min_distance], and fades out at [member max_distance]."
msgstr ""
"FmodReverbZone3D 进入场景树后持有内部 [FmodReverb3D] ，全局位置作为混响环境的中心。监听者位于 [member min_distance] 内时完全生效，到 "
"[member max_distance] 时淡出。"

#. FmodReverbZone3DGizmoPlugin/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodReverbZone3DGizmoPlugin draws the editor visualization for [FmodReverbZone3D] nodes, "
"including the spherical minimum and maximum distance ranges used by FMOD 3D reverb.\n"
"This class is registered for editor integration and is normally managed by the plugin "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"FmodReverbZone3DGizmoPlugin 为 [FmodReverbZone3D] 绘制编辑器辅助图形，包括 FMOD 三维混响的最小和最大距离球形范围。\n"
"此类用于编辑器集成，通常由插件自动管理。"

#. FmodSound/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodSound is a RefCounted wrapper around FMOD::Sound, representing a loaded sound resource. It "
"provides access to sound metadata, format information, raw audio data, music-specific controls "
"for tracker formats (MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI), and metadata tags.\n"
"\n"
"Use [method load_from_file] to load a sound from disk, or create one through [FmodSystem] "
"methods. Once loaded, you can query information about the sound, read raw audio data, or use it "
"with [FmodChannel] for playback."
msgstr ""
"FmodSound 是 FMOD::Sound "
"的引用计数包装器，表示已加载的声音资源。它提供声音元数据、格式信息、原始音频数据、模块音乐格式（MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI）的专用控制和元数据标签。\n"
"\n"
"使用 [method load_from_file] 从磁盘加载音频，或通过 [FmodSystem] 方法创建音频。加载后，你可以查询音频信息、读取原始音频数据，或将其与 "
"[FmodChannel] 一起用于播放"

#. FmodSoundGroup/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodSoundGroup is used to manage a collection of sounds with shared playback constraints. It "
"allows you to limit the number of simultaneously audible sounds and define behavior when that "
"limit is exceeded.\n"
"This is particularly useful for managing sound categories like:\n"
"- Weapon sounds (limit to prevent audio chaos)\n"
"- Ambient sounds (fade in/out smoothly)\n"
"- Voice/dialogue (prioritize important lines)\n"
"When the maximum audible count is reached, the [enum Behavior] setting determines how new "
"playback requests are handled."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodSoundGroup[/b] 封装 FMOD::SoundGroup，可为一组声音设置最大同时可听数量、超出限制时的处理策略、静音淡出速度和整体音量。\n"
"适合管理以下声音分类：\n"
"- 武器声音，通过限制数量避免声音过于杂乱\n"
"- 环境声音，平滑淡入淡出\n"
"- 语音和对话，优先播放重要台词\n"
"达到最大可听声音数时，由 [enum Behavior] 决定如何处理新的播放请求。"

#. FmodSoundLock/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodSoundLock locks a region of sound data and copies its contents into [PackedByteArray] values "
"returned by [method get_data1] and [method get_data2]. Editing these arrays does not write back "
"to the sound.\n"
"A locked region can have two portions if it wraps around the end of the sound buffer.\n"
"Keep the source [FmodSound] alive until [method unlock] is called. The lock stores a native "
"pointer and does not retain the sound wrapper.\n"
"Call [method unlock] when finished. Destroying the lock object also unlocks the region."
msgstr ""
"FmodSoundLock 锁定声音数据区域，并将内容复制到 [method get_data1] 和 [method get_data2] 返回的 [PackedByteArray] "
"中。修改这些数组不会写回声音。\n"
"锁定区域跨越声音缓冲区末尾时，数据会分为两部分。\n"
"调用 [method unlock] 前必须保持源 [FmodSound] 存活。锁对象只保存原生指针，不会持有声音包装器的引用。\n"
"读取完成后调用 [method unlock] 。销毁锁对象也会解锁该区域。"

#. FmodSystem/description:1
msgid ""
"FmodSystem wraps the FMOD Core API's FMOD::System object and provides comprehensive audio system "
"management capabilities. This class handles system initialization, audio device management, sound"
" creation, playback control, and recording functionality.\n"
"The FMOD System is the core of the FMOD audio engine. It manages the mixer, channels, sounds, DSP"
" effects, and output devices. You can create multiple System instances for advanced use cases, or"
" use the global singleton via [FmodServer] for typical applications."
msgstr ""
"[b]FmodSystem[/b] 封装了 FMOD 核心 API 的 FMOD::System "
"对象，并提供全面的音频系统管理功能。该类负责系统初始化、音频设备管理、声音创建、播放控制以及录音功能。\n"
"FMOD System 是 FMOD 音频引擎的核心。它管理混音器、音轨、声音、DSP 效果和输出设备。对于高级应用场景，可以创建多个 [b]FmodSystem[/b] "
"实例；对于常规应用，则可以通过 [FmodServer] 使用全局单例。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_MPEGSEARCH
msgid ""
"For MP2/MP3 files: searches for sync bytes to find the first frame. Increases opening time but "
"improves compatibility with some files."
msgstr "扫描 MPEG 帧信息"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MODPATTERN
msgid "For module formats (MOD/XM/IT/S3M): pattern index."
msgstr "模块音乐样式单位"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MODORDER
msgid "For module formats (MOD/XM/IT/S3M): pattern order position."
msgstr "模块音乐顺序单位"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MODROW
msgid "For module formats (MOD/XM/IT/S3M): row within the current pattern."
msgstr "模块音乐行单位"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_2D
msgid ""
"Force 2D mode, disabling all 3D processing for this sound.\n"
"When set, the sound will play without any 3D spatial positioning, distance attenuation, or "
"doppler effects.\n"
"This is useful for UI sounds, background music, or when using custom 2D audio positioning."
msgstr ""
"强制使用二维模式，关闭该声音的所有三维处理。\n"
"关闭三维定位、距离衰减和多普勒效果。\n"
"适合界面音效、背景音乐或自定义二维音频定位。"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_3D
msgid ""
"Force 3D mode, enabling 3D spatial processing for this sound.\n"
"When set, the sound will be processed with 3D positioning, distance attenuation, and other "
"spatial effects.\n"
"This is the default for 3D audio sources."
msgstr ""
"强制使用三维模式，启用该声音的三维空间处理。\n"
"声音将进行三维定位、距离衰减和其他空间处理。\n"
"三维音源默认使用此模式。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:update_spectrum/description:1
msgid ""
"Forces a fresh spectrum snapshot even if the bus DSP clock has not advanced. Magnitude, bin "
"count, RMS and centroid queries otherwise share the current snapshot."
msgstr "主动刷新频谱数据。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_FORCEINT
msgid "Forces the DSP type to be an integer type."
msgstr "强制 DSP 类型使用整数表示。"

#. FmodDSPConnection/constants:6/constant:DSPCONNECTION_TYPE_FORCEINT
msgid "Forces the connection type to be an integer type."
msgstr "强制连接类型使用整数表示。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_FORCEINT
#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_FORCEINT
#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_FORCEINT
#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_FORCEINT
msgid "Forces the enum to be 32-bit size."
msgstr "将枚举强制为 32 位大小"

#. FmodAudioStream/members:4/member:ignore_set_file_system
msgid "Forces this sound creation call to ignore a custom FMOD file system, if one has been configured."
msgstr "若配置了自定义 FMOD 文件系统，此次创建声音时强制忽略它。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_FLAC
msgid "Free Lossless Audio Codec (FLAC)."
msgstr "无损音频编解码器（.flac）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_FRONT_CENTER
msgid "Front center speaker (dialogue)."
msgstr "前置中置声道"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_FRONT_LEFT
msgid "Front left speaker."
msgstr "前置左声道"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_FRONT_RIGHT
msgid "Front right speaker."
msgstr "前置右声道"

