#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:init/description:3
msgid ""
"Initializes a system created by [method create_system].\n"
"[param max_channels] sets the maximum number of simultaneously playing channels and must be "
"greater than [code]0[/code].\n"
"[param flags] is a bitmask of [enum FmodInitFlags] values."
msgstr ""
"初始化通过 [method create_system] 创建的系统。\n"
"[param max_channels] 设置同时播放的最大通道数，必须大于 [code]0[/code]。\n"
"[param flags] 是 [enum FmodInitFlags] 值组成的位掩码。"

#. FmodServer/description:1
msgid ""
"Initializes the main [FmodSystem], applies the project's [code]audio/fmod[/code] settings, and "
"updates FMOD once per [SceneTree] process frame. Access the singleton through its static methods."
"\n"
"[method get_audio_bus_layout] returns bus configuration; [method get_audio_bus_by_id] and [method"
" get_bus_effect_instance] return the corresponding runtime objects. Each effect slot has an "
"independent runtime instance. Changes to the active configuration are applied on the next update,"
" or immediately with [method flush_bus_updates].\n"
"With [code]audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses[/code] enabled, Godot's [AudioServer] supplies the "
"configuration. When disabled, the server loads [code]audio/fmod/default_bus_layout[/code], whose "
"default is [code]res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres[/code]. Changing the synchronization setting "
"requires reloading the project. See [FmodAudioBusLayout] for editing, saving, and the FMOD Audio "
"Dock.\n"
"Performance monitors are available in Godot's [b]Debugger > Monitors[/b] panel.\n"
"[b]Performance Monitors:[/b]\n"
"The following custom monitors are registered with Godot's Performance system:\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/DSP[/code]: DSP processing CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Stream[/code]: Stream decoding CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Geometry[/code]: 3D geometry processing CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Update[/code]: System update CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Convolution1[/code]: Convolution reverb 1 CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Convolution2[/code]: Convolution reverb 2 CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/SampleBytesRead[/code]: Sample bytes read from disk\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/StreamBytesRead[/code]: Stream bytes read from disk\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/OtherBytesRead[/code]: Other bytes read from disk"
msgstr ""
"初始化主 [FmodSystem]，应用项目的 [code]audio/fmod[/code] 设置，并在每个 [SceneTree] 处理帧更新 FMOD。通过静态方法访问此单例。\n"
"[method get_audio_bus_layout] 返回总线配置，[method get_audio_bus_by_id] 和 [method "
"get_bus_effect_instance] 返回对应运行时对象。每个效果器槽位都有独立运行实例。当前配置的修改在下一次更新时应用，或通过 [method "
"flush_bus_updates] 立即应用。\n"
"开启 [code]audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses[/code] 时，由 Godot 的 [AudioServer] 提供配置。关闭后加载 "
"[code]audio/fmod/default_bus_layout[/code]，默认为 "
"[code]res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres[/code]。修改同步设置需要重新加载项目。编辑、保存和 FMOD Audio 面板的说明见 "
"[FmodAudioBusLayout]。\n"
"性能监视器位于 Godot 的 [b]调试器 > 监视器[/b] 面板。\n"
"[b]性能监控：[/b]\n"
"以下自定义监控已注册到 Godot 的性能系统：\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/DSP[/code] ：DSP 处理的 CPU 使用百分比\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Stream[/code]：流解码的 CPU 使用百分比\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Geometry[/code]：三维几何处理的 CPU 使用百分比\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Update[/code] ：系统更新的 CPU 使用百分比\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Convolution1[/code] ：卷积混响 1 的 CPU 使用百分比\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Convolution2[/code] ：卷积混响 2 的 CPU 使用百分比\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/SampleBytesRead[/code] ：从磁盘读取的样本字节数\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/StreamBytesRead[/code] ：从磁盘读取的流式数据字节数\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/OtherBytesRead[/code] ：从磁盘读取的其他数据字节数"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:init_bus/description:3
msgid ""
"Initializes this bus with the specified [param name] and optional [param parent] channel group.\n"
"This creates the internal FMOD channel group for audio routing."
msgstr ""
"使用指定的 [param name] 和可选的父通道组 [param parent] 初始化总线。\n"
"创建用于音频路由的内部 FMOD 通道组。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:emission_angle
msgid ""
"Inner emission angle in degrees, clamped to [code]0.0[/code] through [code]90.0[/code]. The "
"inspector and saved scenes use degrees without conversion."
msgstr "发声内锥角，单位为度，限制在 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]90.0[/code] 之间。检查器和保存的场景直接使用度数，无需转换。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:add_bus_effect/description:4
msgid ""
"Inserts [param effect] into bus [param bus_id] before [param index]. A negative index appends it."
" Returns a stable slot ID, or [code]-1[/code] for an invalid bus, null effect, out-of-range "
"index, or a bus with 512 slots. Multiple slots may share a configuration resource; each bound "
"slot receives its own runtime instance. Read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, or Record data "
"through [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance]."
msgstr ""
"将 [param effect] 插入总线 [param bus_id] 的 [param index] 之前，负索引表示追加。返回稳定槽位 ID。总线无效、效果为空、索引越界或总线已有 512"
" 个槽位时，返回 [code]-1[/code]。多个槽位可共享配置资源，各自拥有独立运行实例。通过 [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] 读取"
" Capture、SpectrumAnalyzer 或 Record 的实时数据。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:add_effect/description:3
msgid ""
"Inserts [param effect] into the stored effect list at [param index] and applies it to this bus.\n"
"The list index is clamped between [code]0[/code] and [method get_effect_count]. It does not "
"specify the FMOD DSP insertion position."
msgstr ""
"将 [param effect] 插入保存的效果器列表中 [param index] 指定的位置，并应用到此总线。\n"
"列表索引会限制在 [code]0[/code] 到 [method get_effect_count] 之间，不用于指定 FMOD DSP 的插入位置。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_callback/description:1
msgid ""
"Installs the wrapper callback for FMOD channel events. Notifications are deferred to Godot. "
"[FmodChannel] emits its specific signals such as [signal FmodChannel.ended]; the base "
"implementation emits [signal callback_received]."
msgstr ""
"安装封装的 FMOD 通道事件回调，通知会延迟到 Godot 执行。 [FmodChannel] 发出 [signal FmodChannel.ended] 等专用信号；基类实现发出 "
"[signal callback_received] 。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_DATA_TYPE_INT
msgid "Integer value."
msgstr "整数"

