#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:ATTENUATION_INVERSE_DISTANCE
msgid ""
"Inverse distance attenuation model. Volume falls off as 1/distance.\n"
"This is a realistic model for point sources in free field."
msgstr ""
"反距离衰减\n"
"反距离衰减"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_COOLDOWN_INFINITE
msgid "Keeps processing after input becomes idle."
msgstr "输入空闲后继续处理。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_AUDITORIUM
msgid "Large auditorium preset."
msgstr "礼堂"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:late_delay
msgid "Late reverb delay in milliseconds."
msgstr "后期混响延迟，单位为毫秒"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:late_delay
msgid "Late reverb delay time in milliseconds."
msgstr "后期混响延迟，单位为毫秒"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:density
msgid "Late reverb density in percent."
msgstr "密度"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:diffusion
msgid "Late reverb diffusion in percent."
msgstr "扩散度"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_LIMITER
msgid "Limits the sound to a certain volume level."
msgstr "将音量限制在指定电平内。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_LINEAR
msgid "Linear interpolation (fast, good quality)."
msgstr "线性插值重采样"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/constants:6/constant:MODE_LOFI
msgid ""
"Lo-fi amplitude quantization controlled by [member drive]. The current implementation uses the "
"same quantizer as [constant MODE_BITCRUSH] and does not reduce the sample rate."
msgstr "由 [member drive] 控制的低保真幅度量化。当前实现与 [constant MODE_BITCRUSH] 使用相同的量化算法，不会降低采样率。"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_SAMPLE
msgid ""
"Load the entire audio file as a sample into memory. This allows for faster playback and lower CPU"
" usage, but consumes more memory. Best suited for short sound effects."
msgstr "将整个音频文件作为样本加载到内存中。这可以实现更快的播放和更低的 CPU 使用率，但会消耗更多内存。最适合短音效使用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:load_geometry/description:2
msgid ""
"Loads pre-saved geometry data from a PackedByteArray.\n"
"Useful for loading complex geometry from disk."
msgstr ""
"从提供的 [b]PackedByteArray[/b] 加载几何数据并创建一个 [code skip-lint]FmodGeometry[/code] 对象，对于从磁盘加载复杂几何形状非常有用。"
"\n"
"用于从磁盘加载复杂几何体。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_CREATESAMPLE
msgid "Loads the entire sound into memory as a sample. Enables fast seeking and repeated playback."
msgstr "创建解压采样"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:lock/description:3
msgid ""
"Locks a region of the sound buffer and returns a [FmodSoundLock] for reading copies of the PCM "
"data. [param offset] and [param length] are measured in bytes. Returns [code]null[/code] if "
"locking fails.\n"
"Keep this sound alive until the lock is unlocked. Modifying arrays returned by [FmodSoundLock] "
"does not modify the sound buffer."
msgstr ""
"锁定声音缓冲区的一段区域，并返回用于读取 PCM 数据副本的 [FmodSoundLock] 。 [param offset] 和 [param length] 以字节为单位。锁定失败时返回 "
"[code]null[/code] 。\n"
"解锁前必须保持此声音存活。修改 [FmodSoundLock] 返回的数组不会修改声音缓冲区。"

#. FmodSoundLock/brief_description:0
msgid "Locks sound sample data and exposes copies for reading."
msgstr "锁定声音采样数据，并提供可读取的副本。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:lock_dsp/description:1
msgid ""
"Locks the DSP engine mutex.\n"
"Use this when making multiple DSP calls that need to be atomic.\n"
"Always pair with [method unlock_dsp]."
msgstr ""
"锁住 DSP 引擎互斥锁。\n"
"需要原子地完成多个 DSP 调用时使用此方法。\n"
"必须与 [method unlock_dsp] 配对使用。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_LOW_FREQUENCY
msgid "Low frequency effects/subwoofer (LFE)."
msgstr "低频效果声道"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:low_shelf_gain
#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:low_shelf_gain
msgid "Low shelf gain in dB."
msgstr "低频搁架增益，单位为分贝"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:low_shelf_frequency
