msgstr "行为枚举数量"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_MAX
msgid "Maximum output type value, used for bounds checking."
msgstr "支持的最大输出类型数量"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_PORT_TYPE_MAX
msgid "Maximum port type value."
msgstr "端口类型数量"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_MAX
msgid "Maximum resampler method value."
msgstr "重采样方式数量"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:max_distance
msgid ""
"Maximum rolloff distance multiplier. The distance passed to FMOD is this value multiplied by "
"[member unit_size]; it is not a universal hard cutoff.\n"
"In [constant ATTENUATION_DISABLED] mode, a flat custom rolloff curve keeps distance gain at unity"
" regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"最大衰减距离倍率。传递给 FMOD 的距离为此值乘以 [member unit_size] ，并非所有衰减模型都将其作为硬截断距离。\n"
"在 [constant ATTENUATION_DISABLED] 模式下，平坦的自定义衰减曲线使距离增益始终为 1，不受此设置影响。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/members:4/member:max_audible
msgid ""
"Maximum simultaneous audible playbacks. [code]-1[/code] removes the limit; [code]0[/code] permits"
" no audible playbacks. Values below [code]-1[/code] are rejected without changing the current "
"limit."
msgstr "同时可听的最大播放数量。 [code]-1[/code] 取消限制， [code]0[/code] 表示不允许可听播放。小于 [code]-1[/code] 的值会被拒绝，当前限制保持不变。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MAX
msgid "Maximum speaker index."
msgstr "扬声器枚举数量"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_MAX
msgid "Maximum speaker mode value, used for bounds checking."
msgstr "扬声器模式数量"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_MAX
