#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:unit_size
msgid "Minimum rolloff distance in scene units. Also scales [member max_distance] when configuring FMOD."
msgstr "以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离。配置 FMOD 时也用于缩放 [member max_distance] 。"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:density
msgid "Modal density of the late reverb (0.0 to 100.0)."
msgstr "后期混响密度，范围通常为 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]100.0[/code]"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_MONO
msgid "Mono output (1 channel)."
msgstr "单声道输出"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:move_bus/description:3
msgid ""
"Moves bus [param id] to the final display [param index], from [code]1[/code] to [method "
"get_bus_count] minus one. Routing and IDs are preserved. Master cannot be moved. Returns "
"[constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]."
msgstr ""
"将总线 [param id] 移到最终显示位置 [param index]，范围为 [code]1[/code] 到 [method get_bus_count] 减一。保留路由与 "
"ID，Master 不能移动。成功返回 [constant OK]，无效参数返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:move_bus_effect/description:5
msgid ""
"Moves slot [param slot_id] from [param bus_id] to [param target_bus], inserting it before [param "
"index] in the target list before removal. The index may equal the target slot count to append. "
"The stable slot ID and bound DSP state are preserved. Returns [constant OK] on success or "
"[constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]."
msgstr ""
"将槽位 [param slot_id] 从 [param bus_id] 移至 [param target_bus]，插入删除前目标列表的 [param index] "
"之前。索引等于目标槽位数时表示追加。保留稳定槽位 ID 和绑定的 DSP 状态。成功返回 [constant OK]，无效参数返回 [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_dsp_index/description:3
msgid ""
"Moves the specified DSP unit to a new position (index) in the DSP chain. This changes the order "
"in which DSPs process the audio signal."
msgstr "设置指定 DSP 单元在 DSP 链中的索引。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_PARAMETER_DATA_TYPE_3DATTRIBUTES_MULTI
msgid "Multi-instance 3D attributes data parameter type."
msgstr "多实例三维属性数据参数类型。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_MULTIBAND_DYNAMICS
msgid "Multiband dynamics processor (deprecated)."
msgstr "多频段动态处理器，已弃用。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:panning_strength
msgid "Multiplier for the panning effect strength."
msgstr "左右声像强度"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_MIDI
msgid "Musical Instrument Digital Interface (MIDI)."
msgstr "乐器数字接口"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_HALLWAY
msgid "Narrow hallway preset."
msgstr "走廊"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NNAUDIO
msgid "Nintendo Switch nn::audio output."
msgstr "音频输出（Switch默认）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_NOINTERP
msgid "No interpolation (nearest neighbor, lowest quality)."
msgstr "无插值重采样"

#. Class reference template
msgid "No return value."
msgstr "无返回值。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND
msgid ""
"No sound output. All calls succeed but no audio is produced. Useful for servers or offline "
"processing."
msgstr "执行所有混音，但丢弃最终输出"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_NONE
msgid "No speaker (invalid or disabled)."
msgstr "未指定扬声器"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_FORMAT_NONE
msgid "No specific format (unitialized or compressed)."
msgstr "未知"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_STREAM_FROM_UPDATE
msgid ""
"No stream thread is created internally. Streams are driven from [method update]. Useful for non-"
"realtime outputs."
msgstr "内部不创建流线程，通过 [method update] 驱动流处理，适用于非实时输出。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WAVWRITER_NRT
msgid ""
"Non-realtime WAV writer mode. Writes audio to a WAV file without real-time constraints, allowing "
"faster-than-realtime encoding."
msgstr "非实时版本的 [code skip-lint]FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WAVWRITER[/code] ，每个系统更新一次混音"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT
msgid ""
"Non-realtime no-sound mode. Calls to [method update] produce audio output without real-time "
"constraints."
msgstr "非实时版本的 [code skip-lint]FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND[/code] ，每个系统更新一次混音 （参见 [method update] ）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_NORMAL
msgid "Normal initialization, no special flags."
msgstr "正常初始化"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_NORMALIZE
msgid "Normalizes or amplifies the sound to a certain level."
msgstr "将信号归一化或放大到指定电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/constants:6/constant:FILTER_NOTCH
msgid "Notch filter that removes a specific frequency."
msgstr "陷波滤波"

#. FmodChannel/members:4/member:loop_count
msgid ""
"Number of times to loop the sound. Default is 0 (play once, no looping).\n"
"- [code]-1[/code]: Infinite looping\n"
"- [code]0[/code]: No looping (default)\n"
"- [code]1+[/code]: Loop n times"
msgstr ""
"声音循环次数，默认值 0 表示播放一次且不循环。\n"
"- [code]-1[/code] ：无限循环\n"
"- [code]0[/code] ：不循环（默认值）\n"
"- [code]1+[/code]: Loop n times"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_OGGVORBIS
msgid "Ogg Vorbis audio format (OGG)."
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis 音频格式（OGG）。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_MOUNTAINS
msgid "Open mountain ambience preset."
msgstr "山地"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_OHAUDIO
msgid "OpenHarmony OHAudio output."
msgstr "OpenHarmony OHAudio 输出。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_OPENSL
msgid "OpenSL ES output. Android native audio API."
msgstr "OpenSL ES（默认支持 Android 2.3 至 7.1）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_OPENRAW
msgid "Opens a raw audio file with no format parsing. Requires manual specification of format parameters."
msgstr "按原始 PCM 数据打开"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_OPENMEMORY_POINT
msgid ""
"Opens a sound from memory using the provided pointer directly without copying. The application "
"must keep the memory valid during playback."
msgstr "直接引用内存数据"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_OPENMEMORY
msgid "Opens a sound from memory. The memory buffer is copied by FMOD."
msgstr "从内存数据打开"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_OPENONLY
msgid ""
"Opens a sound without prebuffering or reading audio data. Use [method FmodSound.read_data] to "
"decode and read its audio data."
msgstr "打开声音，但不预缓冲或读取音频数据。通过 [method FmodSound.read_data] 解码并读取音频数据。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_OPENUSER
msgid "Opens a user-created sound with custom read callbacks."
msgstr "使用用户回调打开"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_NONBLOCKING
msgid ""
"Opens the sound asynchronously without blocking. Check [method FmodSound.get_open_state] to "
"determine when the sound is ready."
msgstr "非阻塞方式打开 （参见 [method FmodSound.get_open_state] ）"

