#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_QUAD
msgid "Quadraphonic output (4 channels: front left, front right, surround left, surround right)."
msgstr "四声道输出"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_RAW
msgid "Raw PCM data."
msgstr "原始未压缩PCM数据（.raw）"

#. FmodAudioStream/members:4/member:format
msgid ""
"Raw PCM format. This is mainly used with [member suggested_sound_type] set to "
"[code]FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_RAW[/code]."
msgstr "原始 PCM 格式。主要用于将 [member suggested_sound_type] 设为 [code]FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_RAW[/code] 的情况。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_VORBIS
msgid "Raw Vorbis codec data."
msgstr "Vorbis 比特流支持 FSB（.fsb）容器格式"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_RAW
msgid "Raw speaker mode. Speaker mapping is disabled, channels are output as-is."
msgstr "原始扬声器映射"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:read_data/description:2
msgid ""
"Reads raw audio data from the sound into a PackedByteArray using FMOD's internal codec. This is "
"useful for extracting decoded PCM data or for custom processing.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method seek_data] to position the read cursor before reading."
msgstr ""
"使用 FMOD 的内部编解码器将声音中的原始音频数据读取到 [b]PackedByteArray[/b] 中。这对于提取解码后的 PCM 数据或进行自定义处理非常有用\n"
"\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 读取前可调用 [method seek_data] 设置读取游标。"

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:load_from_file/description:3
msgid ""
"Reads the entire file at [param path] into [member audio_data] and returns a new stream. Resource"
" paths and absolute file paths are supported.\n"
"[param flags] controls FMOD decoding and playback using [enum CreateMode]. The default [constant "
"MODE_STREAM] streams decoding from the in-memory data, not directly from disk.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the file cannot be opened or contains no readable data."
msgstr ""
"读取 [param path] 指定文件的全部内容到 [member audio_data] ，并返回新的音频流。支持资源路径和绝对文件路径。\n"
"[param flags] 通过 [enum CreateMode] 控制 FMOD 的解码和播放。默认的 [constant MODE_STREAM] "
"从内存中的数据流式解码，不会直接从磁盘流式读取。\n"
"无法打开文件或没有可读取的数据时返回 [code]null[/code] 。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/members:4/member:auto_rebuild
msgid "Rebuilds geometry automatically when relevant exported properties change."
msgstr "进入场景或属性变化时自动重建几何体"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:rebuild_geometry/description:1
msgid "Rebuilds the FMOD geometry from the configured source."
msgstr "重新检测源节点并重建 FMOD 几何体"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_RETURN
msgid "Receives signals from multiple send DSPs."
msgstr "接收多个发送节点的信号。"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:hf_reference
msgid "Reference high frequency in Hz."
msgstr "高频参考频率，单位为 Hz"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:low_shelf_frequency
msgid "Reference low frequency in Hz."
msgstr "低频搁架参考频率，单位为 Hz"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_STONE_CORRIDOR
msgid "Reflective stone corridor preset."
msgstr "石质走廊"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_STONE_ROOM
msgid "Reflective stone room preset."
msgstr "石室"

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:generate_bus_layout/description:1
msgid ""
"Refreshes the FMOD mirror from Godot AudioServer when synchronization is enabled. Does nothing in"
" independent mode."
msgstr "开启同步时，从 Godot AudioServer 刷新 FMOD 镜像；独立模式下不执行操作。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Releases an owned DSP unit and frees its memory. Borrowed DSP handles returned by graph or "
"channel queries cannot be released through this method."
msgstr "释放当前对象拥有的 DSP 单元及其内存。通过 DSP 图或通道查询取得的借用句柄不能调用此方法释放。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:clear_geometry/description:1
msgid "Releases the internal [FmodGeometry]."
msgstr "释放当前 FMOD 几何体并清空引用 （参见 [FmodGeometry] ）"

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Releases this ChannelGroup. Its input channels and child groups are moved to the master channel "
"group. After a successful release, this wrapper has no FMOD handle."
msgstr "释放当前 ChannelGroup。输入通道和子通道组会被移到主通道组；释放成功后，该封装不再持有 FMOD 句柄。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Releases this SoundGroup and returns all its sounds to the master sound group.\n"
"After calling this method, the SoundGroup becomes invalid and should not be used.\n"
"Sounds that were playing continue to play, but are no longer subject to this group's constraints."
msgstr ""
"释放 SoundGroup，并将其中的声音返回主 SoundGroup。\n"
"调用后，SoundGroup 失效，不应继续使用。\n"
"正在播放的声音会继续播放，但不再受本组的限制。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Releases this geometry object and frees its memory.\n"
"After calling this method, the geometry becomes invalid and should not be used.\n"
"Any polygons in the geometry are also destroyed."
msgstr ""
"释放底层 FMOD Geometry。释放后该对象不应继续用于遮挡计算。\n"
"调用后几何体失效，不应继续使用。\n"
"几何体中的所有多边形也会被销毁。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Releases this reverb object and frees its memory.\n"
"After calling this method, the reverb becomes invalid and should not be used."
msgstr ""
"释放底层 FMOD Reverb3D。\n"
"调用后混响对象失效，不应继续使用。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:delete_sync_point/description:2
msgid ""
"Removes a sync point from the sound. The [code skip-lint]point[/code] parameter should be a "
"handle obtained from [method get_sync_point] or [method add_sync_point]. Returns "
"[code]true[/code] on success."
msgstr ""
"从声音中删除同步点。 [code skip-lint]point[/code] 应为 [method get_sync_point] 或 [method add_sync_point] "
"返回的句柄。成功时返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:remove_fade_points/description:3
msgid ""
"Removes all fade points between the specified DSP clock start and end values. This cancels any "
"volume automation scheduled within that time range."
msgstr "移除两个 DSP 时钟值之间的所有淡变点。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/methods:3/method:get_buffer/description:2
msgid ""
"Removes and returns up to [param frames] queued stereo frames as a [PackedVector2Array]. Each "
"[Vector2] stores left and right samples in [code]x[/code] and [code]y[/code]. If fewer frames are"
" available, the returned array is shorter. Returns an empty array for a nonpositive count or an "
"empty buffer. Reading does not reset either counter."
msgstr ""
"从队列中取出最多 [param frames] 个立体声帧，以 [PackedVector2Array] 返回。每个 [Vector2] 的 [code]x[/code] 和 "
"[code]y[/code] 分别存放左右声道采样。可用帧数不足时返回较短的数组；帧数非正或缓冲区为空时返回空数组。读取不会重置计数器。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:remove_bus/description:2
msgid ""
"Removes bus [param id] and its effect slots. Buses sending to it are redirected to its previous "
"send target. Bound runtime channels are redirected on the next update. Master cannot be removed. "
"Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]."
msgstr ""
"移除总线 [param id] 及其效果器槽位。发送到该总线的其他总线会转接到其原发送目标，绑定的运行通道在下一次更新时转接。Master 不能删除。成功返回 [constant "
"OK]，无效参数返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:remove_bus_effect/description:3
msgid ""
"Removes slot [param slot_id] from bus [param bus_id]. Returns [constant OK] on success or "
"[constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]."
msgstr ""
"移除总线 [param bus_id] 的槽位 [param slot_id]。成功返回 [constant OK]，无效参数返回 [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:clear_callback/description:1
msgid ""
"Removes the FMOD callback installed by [method set_callback], stopping both base and derived "
"channel-event notifications for this handle."
msgstr "移除 [method set_callback] 安装的 FMOD 回调，停止该句柄的基类和派生类通道事件通知。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:remove_effect/description:2
msgid "Removes the audio effect at the specified [param index] from this bus."
msgstr "移除此总线中索引 [param index] 处的音频效果器。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:remove_dsp/description:2
msgid ""
"Removes the specified DSP unit from the DSP chain. The DSP will no longer process audio for this "
"channel."
msgstr "从 DSP 链中移除指定 DSP 单元。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:release/description:1
msgid ""
"Removes this bus's effects and clears its channel-group references. Releases the native channel "
"group for buses other than [code]Master[/code]. Call this only for standalone buses whose "
"lifetime you manage; the server releases buses obtained through [FmodServer]."
msgstr ""
"移除总线效果器并清空通道组引用。对于 [code]Master[/code] 以外的总线，还会释放原生通道组。仅对自行管理生命周期的独立总线调用此方法；通过 [FmodServer] "
"获取的总线由服务器释放。"

#. FmodAudioEffect/methods:3/method:remove_from_bus/description:2
msgid "Removes this effect from the specified audio bus, detaching all DSP units."
msgstr "从指定通道组移除此效果。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:rename_bus/description:3
msgid ""
"Renames bus [param id] while preserving its ID, routing, and runtime instances. The name must be "
"unique, nonblank, and contain no comma. Master cannot be renamed. Player nodes store bus names; "
"update their [code]bus[/code] properties when renaming a bus. Returns [constant OK] on success or"
" [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]."
msgstr ""
"重命名总线 [param id]，保留 ID、路由和运行实例。名称必须唯一、非空白且不含逗号，Master 不能重命名。播放器节点保存总线名称，重命名后需同步修改其 "
"[code]bus[/code] 属性。成功返回 [constant OK]，无效参数返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER]。"

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:reset_main_system/description:2
msgid ""
"Replaces the main system with [param system]. Configure and initialize the new system before "
"calling this method. Releases the previous runtime instances and system, then rebuilds the active"
" layout configuration on the new system. Objects from the previous system must not be reused."
msgstr "用 [param system] 替换主系统，调用前需配置并初始化新系统。释放旧运行实例和旧系统后，在新系统上重建当前布局。旧系统的对象不可继续复用。"

#. FmodReverb3D/brief_description:0
msgid "Represents a 3D reverb zone for spatial audio reverberation effects."
msgstr "FMOD 3D 混响对象，用于在空间中创建球形混响区域"

#. FmodDSPConnection/brief_description:0
msgid "Represents a connection between DSP nodes in the audio processing graph."
msgstr "DSP 节点之间的连接对象"

#. FmodGeometry/brief_description:0
msgid "Represents a geometry object for 3D audio occlusion calculations."
msgstr "用于 3D 声音遮挡计算的 FMOD 几何体对象"

#. FmodChannelGroup/brief_description:0
msgid "Represents a group of channels for sub-mixing and collective control."
msgstr "用于组织和混合多个 Channel 的通道组"

#. FmodChannel/brief_description:0
msgid "Represents a single playing channel (voice) in FMOD."
msgstr "单个播放通道的控制对象"

#. FmodReverb3D/description:1
msgid ""
"Represents a spherical 3D reverb environment whose contribution depends on the listener position."
" The reverb has full influence inside [code]min_distance[/code] and fades out by "
"[code]max_distance[/code].\n"
"FMOD blends the environments that cover the listener. When none covers the listener, FMOD uses "
"the global reverb settings.\n"
"Create an instance with [method FmodSystem.create_reverb_3d]."
msgstr ""
"表示球形 3D 混响环境，其影响程度取决于监听者的位置。在 [code]min_distance[/code] 内完全生效，到 [code]max_distance[/code] 时淡出。\n"
"FMOD 会混合覆盖监听者的混响环境；没有环境覆盖监听者时，使用全局混响设置。\n"
"通过 [method FmodSystem.create_reverb_3d] 创建实例。"

#. FmodAudioBus/brief_description:0
msgid "Represents an audio bus for mixing with effects support."
msgstr "表示一个用于混音的音频总线，支持效果处理"

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/members:4/member:buffer_length
msgid ""
"Requested buffer length in seconds. It must be finite and positive. Capacity uses the current "
"implementation's 48,000-frames-per-second sizing policy, clamped to 512 through 480,000 frames. "
"Changing it clears queued audio while preserving the frame counters."
msgstr "请求的缓冲时长，单位为秒，必须是有限的正数。当前实现按每秒 48,000 帧计算容量，并将容量限制在 512 到 480,000 帧之间。修改该属性会清空队列，保留帧计数器。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:reset/description:1
msgid "Resets the DSP's internal state to prepare it for new input signals."
msgstr "重置 DSP 内部状态，准备接收新的输入信号。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_HIGHPASS
msgid "Resonant highpass filter (deprecated)."
msgstr "谐振高通滤波器，已弃用。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_ITLOWPASS
msgid "Resonant lowpass filter used in Impulse Tracker, limited cutoff range (0 to 8060Hz)."
msgstr "Impulse Tracker 使用的谐振低通滤波器，截止频率范围为 0 到 8060 Hz。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:mixer_resume/description:1
msgid ""
"Resumes the mixer thread and re-acquires access to the audio hardware. Use after [method "
"mixer_suspend] to restore audio processing."
msgstr "恢复混音器线程并重新获取对音频硬件的访问权限。在 [method mixer_suspend] 之后使用以恢复音频处理。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_channel/description:2
msgid ""
"Retrieves a [FmodChannel] by its channel index, as returned by [method FmodChannel.get_index]. "
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the lookup fails. Channel indices may be reused and are not "
"persistent playback IDs."
msgstr ""
"通过 [method FmodChannel.get_index] 返回的通道索引获取 [FmodChannel] 。查找失败时返回 [code]null[/code] "
"。通道索引可能被重复使用，不是持久的播放 ID。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_tag/description:3
msgid ""
"Retrieves a metadata tag from the sound. Tags can be retrieved by index or by name. If [code "
"skip-lint]name[/code] is non-empty, it will search for a tag with that name; otherwise, it "
"retrieves the tag at the specified index.\n"
"\n"
"Returns a dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]type[/code]: Tag type ([enum FmodTagType]).\n"
"- [code]datatype[/code]: Data type of the tag value ([enum FmodTagDataType]).\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code]: Name of the tag.\n"
"- [code]data[/code]: The tag value (type varies based on [code]datatype[/code]).\n"
"- [code]data_len[/code]: Length of the data in bytes.\n"
"- [code]updated[/code]: [code]true[/code] if the tag was updated (for streaming sources).\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Common tags include \"TITLE\", \"ARTIST\", \"ALBUM\" for music files."
msgstr ""
"从声音中检索元数据标签。可以通过索引或名称检索标签。如果名称非空，它将搜索具有该名称的标签；否则，它将检索指定索引处的标签\n"
"\n"
"返回一个字典，包括：\n"
"- [code]type[/code] ：标签类型，见 [enum FmodTagType] 。\n"
"- [code]datatype[/code] ：标签值的数据类型，见 [enum FmodTagDataType] 。\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code] ：标签名称。\n"
"- [code]data[/code] ：标签值，其类型由 [code]datatype[/code] 决定。\n"
"- [code]data_len[/code] ：数据字节长度。\n"
"- [code]updated[/code] ：标签更新时为 [code]true[/code] ，适用于流式音源。\n"
"\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 音乐文件的常见标签包括 TITLE、ARTIST 和 ALBUM。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_dsp_info_by_type/description:2
msgid ""
"Retrieves information about a built-in DSP type.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code]: Name of the DSP.\n"
"- [code]version[/code]: Plugin version number.\n"
"- [code]plugin_sdk_version[/code]: FMOD Plugin SDK version.\n"
"- [code]has_create[/code]: Whether the DSP has a create callback.\n"
"- [code]has_release[/code]: Whether the DSP has a release callback.\n"
"- [code]has_reset[/code]: Whether the DSP has a reset callback.\n"
"- [code]has_process[/code]: Whether the DSP has a process callback.\n"
"- [code]has_setposition[/code]: Whether the DSP has a setposition callback.\n"
"Also includes [code]mode[/code], [code]input_channels[/code], [code]output_channels[/code], and "
"[code]default_cooldown[/code] (sample frames)."
msgstr ""
"检索有关内置 DSP 类型的信息。\n"
"返回的字典包含：\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code] ：DSP 的名称。\n"
"- [code]version[/code] ：插件版本号。\n"
"- [code]plugin_sdk_version[/code] ：FMOD Plugin SDK 版本。\n"
"- [code]has_create[/code] ：DSP 是否具有 create 回调。\n"
"- [code]has_release[/code] ：DSP 是否具有 release 回调。\n"
"- [code]has_reset[/code] ：DSP 是否具有 reset 回调。\n"
"- [code]has_process[/code] ：DSP 是否具有 process 回调。\n"
"- [code]has_setposition[/code] ：DSP 是否具有 setposition 回调。\n"
"还包含 [code skip-lint]mode[/code] 、 [code]input_channels[/code] 、 [code]output_channels[/code] 和 "
"[code]default_cooldown[/code] ，后者以采样帧为单位。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_dsp/description:2
msgid ""
"Retrieves the DSP unit at the specified index in the DSP chain. Returns [code]null[/code] if the "
"index is invalid."
msgstr "返回 DSP 链中指定索引处的 DSP 单元；索引无效时返回 [code]null[/code] 。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_default_mix_matrix/description:5
msgid ""
"Retrieves the default mixing matrix used to convert audio from one speaker mode to another.\n"
"The returned array is always compact and ordered by target channel, then source channel. Its "
"length is the source channel count multiplied by the target channel count.\n"
"[param hop] controls the temporary FMOD matrix row stride. A nonpositive value uses the source "
"channel count; a positive value must be at least that count and no greater than [code]32[/code]. "
"It does not add padding to the returned array.\n"
"[param array_length] controls temporary storage. A positive value must be at least the target "
"channel count multiplied by the effective row stride; a nonpositive value allocates the required "
"size automatically. Raw speaker modes and invalid arguments return an empty array."
msgstr ""
"返回从一种扬声器模式转换到另一种扬声器模式的默认混音矩阵。\n"
"返回的数组始终紧密排列，先按目标声道、再按源声道排序。数组长度等于源声道数乘以目标声道数。\n"
"[param hop] 控制传给 FMOD 的临时矩阵行步长。非正值表示使用源声道数；正值不得小于源声道数，也不得大于 [code]32[/code] 。返回数组不会保留这些填充。\n"
"[param array_length] 控制临时存储空间。正值不得小于目标声道数乘以实际行步长；非正值表示自动分配所需空间。原始扬声器模式或无效参数返回空数组。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_3d_rolloff_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns 3d rolloff callback."
msgstr "返回自定义三维距离衰减回调。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_cpu_usage/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns CPU usage statistics for different parts of the FMOD Core API.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code]dsp[/code]: CPU time spent on DSP processing.\n"
"- [code]stream[/code]: CPU time spent on stream decoding.\n"
"- [code]geometry[/code]: CPU time spent on 3D geometry processing.\n"
"- [code skip-lint]update[/code]: CPU time spent on system updates.\n"
"- [code]convolution1[/code]: CPU time spent on convolution reverb processing.\n"
"- [code]convolution2[/code]: CPU time spent on additional convolution processing."
msgstr ""
"返回 Core API 各部分的 CPU 使用率信息。\n"
"返回的字典包含：\n"
"- [code]dsp[/code] ：DSP 处理的 CPU 时间。\n"
"- [code]stream[/code] ：流解码的 CPU 时间。\n"
"- [code]geometry[/code] ：三维几何处理的 CPU 时间。\n"
"- [code skip-lint]update[/code] ：系统更新的 CPU 时间。\n"
"- [code]convolution1[/code] ：卷积混响处理的 CPU 时间。\n"
"- [code]convolution2[/code] ：额外卷积处理的 CPU 时间。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_cpu_usage/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns CPU usage statistics for this DSP. Contains [code]exclusive[/code] and "
"[code]inclusive[/code] values."
msgstr "返回当前 DSP 的 CPU 用量，包含 [code]exclusive[/code] 和 [code]inclusive[/code] 。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_info/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code skip-lint]name[/code], [code]version[/code], [code]channels[/code], and "
"[code]mode[/code] ([enum FmodDSPMode]). FMOD 2.04 does not return configuration dialog "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"返回 [code skip-lint]name[/code] 、 [code]version[/code] 、 [code]channels[/code] 和 [code]mode[/code]"
" （ [enum FmodDSPMode] ）。FMOD 2.04 不再返回配置对话框的尺寸。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:has_stream_playback/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a stream playback channel is currently active."
msgstr "如果内部通道对象有效，则返回 [code]true[/code]"

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:is_data_loaded/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if audio data has been loaded into this stream, [code]false[/code] "
"otherwise."
msgstr "如果音频数据已加载到此流中，则返回 [code]true[/code] ，否则返回 [code]false[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:is_preload_on_set_stream_enabled/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:is_preload_on_set_stream_enabled/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:is_preload_on_set_stream_enabled/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if streams are preloaded as soon as they are assigned."
msgstr "如果启用了赋值时预加载，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:is_tap1_active/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if tap 1 is active."
msgstr "返回第一个 Tap 是否启用。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:is_tap2_active/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if tap 2 is active."
msgstr "返回第二个 Tap 是否启用。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_mute/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the channel is currently muted."
msgstr "返回当前静音状态。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_paused/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the channel is currently paused."
msgstr "返回当前暂停状态。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:is_playing/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the channel is currently playing audio. Returns [code]false[/code] "
"if the channel has stopped or if the underlying FMOD handle has become invalid."
msgstr "返回该 Channel 或 ChannelGroup 当前是否正在播放。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:is_emission_angle_enabled/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the emission angle cone is enabled.\n"
"When enabled, sound is directional within the configured cone."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了方向性发射锥，则返回 [code]true[/code]\n"
"启用后，声音仅在配置的发声锥内具有完整指向性。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:is_feedback_active/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the feedback loop is active."
msgstr "返回反馈延迟是否启用。"

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:is_preloaded/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the internal [FmodSound] has already been created."
msgstr "如果内部 [FmodSound] 已经创建并缓存，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodSoundLock/methods:3/method:is_locked/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the sound data is currently locked and accessible."
msgstr "如果声音数据当前被锁定并且可访问，则返回 [code]true[/code]"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:is_recording/description:2
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified recording device is currently recording."
msgstr "如果指定的录音设备当前正在录音，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:channel_group_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stored ChannelGroup pointer is non-null. This checks the wrapper"
" pointer, not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 ChannelGroup 指针为非空时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:channel_group_is_null/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stored ChannelGroup pointer is null. This checks the wrapper "
"pointer, not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 ChannelGroup 指针为空时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:geometry_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stored Geometry pointer is non-null. This checks the wrapper "
"pointer, not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 Geometry 指针为非空时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:geometry_is_null/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stored Geometry pointer is null. This checks the wrapper "
"pointer, not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 Geometry 指针为空时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:reverb_3d_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stored Reverb3D pointer is non-null. This checks the wrapper "
"pointer, not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 Reverb3D 指针为非空时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:reverb_3d_is_null/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stored Reverb3D pointer is null. This checks the wrapper "
"pointer, not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 Reverb3D 指针为空时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_stream_paused/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_stream_paused/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_stream_paused/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the stream playback is currently paused."
msgstr "返回当前播放流的暂停状态"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:is_virtual/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this channel is being virtualized by the virtual voice system.\n"
"When virtualized, the channel continues to process silently in the background without consuming a"
" hardware voice.\n"
"This happens automatically when there are more playing sounds than available physical voices.\n"
"Use [signal virtualvoice] to be notified when a channel becomes virtual or real."
msgstr ""
"返回该 Channel 是否当前由 FMOD 虚拟语音系统模拟。\n"
"虚拟化后，通道会在后台继续静默处理，不占用硬件声部。\n"
"播放声音数超过可用物理声部时会自动发生。\n"
"可通过 [signal virtualvoice] 接收通道在虚拟声部和实际声部之间切换的通知。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_active/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this geometry object is currently active and being processed by the "
"geometry engine.\n"
"Inactive geometry does not contribute to occlusion calculations."
msgstr ""
"如果几何体处于激活状态，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。\n"
"未激活的几何体不参与遮挡计算。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:channel_is_null/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper has no Channel pointer. Playback ending or stopping "
"does not automatically clear the stored pointer."
msgstr "封装没有 Channel 指针时返回 [code]true[/code] 。播放结束或停止时，保存的指针不会自动清空。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:channel_control_is_null/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper has no ChannelControl pointer. A stopped channel can "
"still have a non-null stored pointer."
msgstr "封装没有 ChannelControl 指针时返回 [code]true[/code] 。已经停止的通道仍可能保存非空指针。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:sound_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper holds a non-null FMOD Sound pointer. For nonblocking "
"sounds, use [method get_open_state] to check loading progress."
msgstr "如果包装器持有非空的 FMOD Sound 指针，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。对于非阻塞加载的声音，应通过 [method get_open_state] 检查加载进度。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:sound_group_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper holds a non-null FMOD SoundGroup pointer. This does not"
" query the native handle for validity."
msgstr "如果包装器持有非空的 FMOD SoundGroup 指针，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法不会向 FMOD 查询原生句柄是否仍然有效。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:system_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper holds a non-null FMOD System pointer. This does not "
"check whether [method init] has succeeded."
msgstr "如果包装器持有非空的 FMOD System 指针，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法不检查 [method init] 是否成功。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:sound_is_null/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper holds no FMOD Sound pointer."
msgstr "如果包装器没有持有 FMOD Sound 指针，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:sound_group_is_null/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper holds no FMOD SoundGroup pointer."
msgstr "如果包装器没有持有 FMOD SoundGroup 指针，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:system_is_null/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper holds no FMOD System pointer. A created but "
"uninitialized system returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "如果包装器没有持有 FMOD System 指针，则返回 [code]true[/code] 。已创建但尚未初始化的系统返回 [code]false[/code] 。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:channel_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper stores a non-null Channel pointer. This does not check "
"whether FMOD has stopped or stolen the channel. Use [method FmodChannelControl.is_playing] to "
"query playback."
msgstr ""
"封装保存了非空 Channel 指针时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法不会检查通道是否已停止或被 FMOD 回收；可通过 [method "
"FmodChannelControl.is_playing] 查询播放状态。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:channel_control_is_valid/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this wrapper stores a non-null ChannelControl pointer. It does not "
"validate the native handle or check whether a channel is still playing."
msgstr "封装保存了非空 ChannelControl 指针时返回 [code]true[/code] 。此方法不会验证底层句柄，也不会检查通道是否仍在播放。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_volume_ramp/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if volume changes are ramped smoothly (interpolated over time), or "
"[code]false[/code] if volume changes are applied instantaneously."
msgstr "返回音量变化是否使用平滑斜坡。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/methods:3/method:can_get_buffer/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when at least [param frames] complete audio frames are queued. Zero "
"returns [code]true[/code]; a negative count returns [code]false[/code]. Availability may change "
"before another call reads the data."
msgstr ""
"队列中至少有 [param frames] 个完整音频帧时返回 [code]true[/code] 。传入零返回 [code]true[/code] ，负数返回 "
"[code]false[/code] 。后续读取前，可用帧数仍可能发生变化。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:is_playing/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:is_playing/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:is_playing/description:1
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] while a playback channel is active, including while paused."
msgstr "播放通道处于活动状态时返回 [code]true[/code] ，暂停时也返回 [code]true[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:validate/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns [constant OK] for a supported format version, a valid Master, unique names and IDs, non-"
"null effect resources, finite volumes, and acyclic routes. Otherwise returns [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_DATA]."
msgstr "格式版本受支持、Master 有效、名称与 ID 唯一、效果资源非空、音量为有限值且路由无环时，返回 [constant OK]；否则返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA]。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:get_active/description:1
#. FmodReverbZone3D/methods:3/method:get_active/description:1
msgid "Returns [member active]."
msgstr "返回 [member active] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/methods:3/method:get_attack_us/description:1
