#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/methods:3/method:get_format/description:1
#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:get_format/description:1
msgid "Returns [member format]."
msgstr "返回 [member format] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/methods:3/method:get_gain/description:1
