#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:set_auto_play/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_auto_play/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets [member auto_play]. Automatic playback is deferred until the node is ready and is disabled "
"in the editor."
msgstr "设置 [member auto_play] 。自动播放会延迟到节点就绪后执行，在编辑器中不生效。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:set_auto_rebuild/description:2
