#. FmodDSPConnection/methods:3/method:set_mix_matrix/description:5
msgid ""
"Sets a 2D pan matrix that maps signals from input channels (columns) to output speakers (rows).\n"
"[param outchannels] and [param inchannels] must be between [code]1[/code] and [code]32[/code]. "
"[param inchannel_hop] is the row stride: [code]0[/code] uses [param inchannels]; otherwise it "
"must be at least [param inchannels] and at most [code]32[/code].\n"
"The input must contain at least [code](outchannels - 1) * effective_hop + inchannels[/code] "
"elements. Padding after the last row is optional. Invalid dimensions, strides, and short arrays "
"are rejected before calling FMOD; the caller's array is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"设置二维声像矩阵，将输入通道（列）映射到输出扬声器（行）。\n"
"[param outchannels] 和 [param inchannels] 必须在 [code]1[/code] 到 [code]32[/code] 之间。 [param "
"inchannel_hop] 是行步长： [code]0[/code] 表示使用 [param inchannels] ，其他值必须不小于 [param inchannels] 且不大于 "
"[code]32[/code] 。\n"
"输入数组至少包含 [code](outchannels - 1) * effective_hop + inchannels[/code] "
"个元素，最后一行末尾可省略填充。无效尺寸、步长和过短数组会在调用 FMOD 前被拒绝，不会修改调用方数组。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_parameter_data/description:3
msgid "Sets a binary data parameter value by index."
msgstr "按索引设置二进制数据参数。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_parameter_bool/description:3
msgid "Sets a boolean parameter value by index."
msgstr "按索引设置布尔参数。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_process_callback/description:2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Sets a callback [code]func(samples: PackedFloat32Array, frames: int, input_channels: int, "
"output_channels: int) -> Dictionary[/code]. Samples are interleaved; generators receive an empty "
"input array. Return [code]{\"output\": samples}[/code]. Short output is padded with zeros. "
"Optional [code]cooldown[/code] (sample frames), [code skip-lint]bypass[/code], and "
"[code]silence[/code] control FMOD 2.04 DSP state. Callbacks execute only when FMOD mixes on the "
"Godot main thread, such as [constant FmodSystem.FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT]; other threads use "
"passthrough for filters and zero output for generators."
msgstr ""
"设置回调 [code]func(samples: PackedFloat32Array, frames: int, input_channels: int, output_channels: "
"int) -> Dictionary[/code] 。采样数据按声道交错排列，生成器接收空输入数组。通过 [code]{\"output\": samples}[/code] "
"返回输出，长度不足的部分补零。可选的 [code]cooldown[/code] （采样帧数）、 [code skip-lint]bypass[/code] 和 "
"[code]silence[/code] 用于控制 FMOD 2.04 的 DSP 状态。只有 FMOD 在 Godot 主线程混音时才会执行回调，例如使用 [constant "
"FmodSystem.FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND_NRT] 。其他线程中，滤波器直接传递输入，生成器输出零。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_custom_rolloff/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets a custom distance rolloff curve.\n"
"Each point is a Vector3 where x=distance, y=volume, z=unused."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义 3D 距离衰减曲线。通常需要配合 [code]FMOD_MODE_3D_CUSTOMROLLOFF[/code] 使用。\n"
"每个点使用 Vector3 表示，其中 x 为距离，y 为音量，z 不使用。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_parameter_float/description:3
msgid "Sets a float parameter value by index."
msgstr "按索引设置浮点参数。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_network_proxy/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets a proxy server URL for all subsequent internet streaming connections. Pass an empty string "
"to disable proxy."
msgstr "为所有后续的互联网流连接设置代理服务器 URL。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_parameter_int/description:3
msgid "Sets an integer parameter value by index."
msgstr "按索引设置整数参数。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_bus_bypass/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets bypass for the managed effect slots on bus [param id]. Slot configuration and DSP state are "
"retained. This does not bypass the bus fader or unrelated DSPs added through low-level APIs."
msgstr "设置总线 [param id] 受管效果器槽位的旁路状态，保留槽位配置和 DSP 状态。总线音量推子及通过低层 API 单独添加的 DSP 保持原状。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/methods:3/method:set_gain/description:2
msgid "Sets gain."
msgstr "设置输出补偿增益。"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/methods:3/method:set_hpf/description:2
msgid "Sets hpf."
msgstr "设置高通滤波量。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_properties/description:2
msgid "Sets properties."
msgstr "从字典批量设置混响参数。适合保存和恢复预设。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_delay/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets sample-accurate start and stop times relative to the parent ChannelGroup's DSP clock. This "
"allows precise scheduling of when playback should begin and end.\n"
"- [param start]: The DSP clock value when playback should start. Use 0 for immediate playback.\n"
"- [param end]: The DSP clock value when playback should stop. Use 0 to play until manually "
"stopped.\n"
"- [param stop_channels]: If [code]true[/code], channels will be stopped when the end time is "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"设置相对于父 ChannelGroup DSP 时钟的样本精确开始和停止时间。\n"
"- [param start] ：开始播放时的 DSP 时钟值，0 表示立即播放。\n"
"- [param end] ：停止播放时的 DSP 时钟值，0 表示持续播放到手动停止。\n"
"- [param stop_channels] ：为 [code]true[/code] 时，到达结束时间即停止通道。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_mode/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets supported playback mode flags, including looping and 2D/3D spatialization. See [enum "
"FmodSystem.FmodMode] for the flags; sound creation flags must be supplied when creating the "
"sound."
msgstr "设置支持的播放模式标志，包括循环和 2D/3D 空间化。标志见 [enum FmodSystem.FmodMode] ；声音创建标志应在创建声音时传入。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_3d_attributes/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets the 3D attributes of the reverb zone.\n"
"- [param position]: The center position of the reverb sphere in world space\n"
"- [param min_distance]: Distance from center where reverb is at full strength\n"
"- [param max_distance]: Distance from center where reverb fades to zero\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] min_distance should be less than max_distance for proper fading behavior."
msgstr ""
"设置混响区域中心位置、完整混响半径和淡出结束半径。\n"
"- [param position] ：世界空间中的混响球心位置\n"
"- [param min_distance] ：保持完整混响强度的半径\n"
"- [param max_distance] ：混响衰减至零的半径\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] min_distance 应小于 max_distance，以实现正常的衰减。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_level/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the 3D panning level (0.0 to 1.0).\n"
"0.0 = full 2D panning, 1.0 = full 3D spatialization."
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 平移与 2D 平移之间的混合比例。\n"
"0.0 表示完全使用 2D 声像，1.0 表示完全使用 3D 空间化。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_attributes/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the 3D position and velocity for spatial audio.\n"
"- [param pos]: Position in world space\n"
"- [param vel]: Velocity for doppler effect calculations"
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 位置和速度，用于平移、距离衰减和多普勒计算。\n"
"- [param pos] ：世界空间位置\n"
"- [param vel] ：用于计算多普勒效果的速度"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_dsp_buffer_pool_size/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the DSP buffer pool size for intermediate mixing buffers.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置 DSP 缓冲池中间混合缓冲区数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_dsp_buffer_size/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the DSP buffer size for the software mixer.\n"
"Smaller buffer sizes reduce latency but increase CPU usage and risk of audio dropouts.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置软件混音器的 DSP 缓冲区大小。\n"
"较小的缓冲可降低延迟，同时增加 CPU 开销和音频中断风险。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_input_channel_format/description:3
msgid "Sets the PCM channel format this DSP receives during processing."
msgstr "设置 DSP 处理时接收的 PCM 声道格式。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:set_band_q/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the Q value (quality factor) for the specified band. Valid range is 0.01 to 10.0. Higher "
"values create a narrower, more selective filter."
msgstr "设置指定频段的 Q 值。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_profile_port/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the TCP port for FMOD Profiler connections.\n"
"Use with [constant FMOD_INIT_FLAG_PROFILE_ENABLE] to enable profiling."
msgstr ""
"设置 FMOD Profiler 监听端口。\n"
"与 [constant FMOD_INIT_FLAG_PROFILE_ENABLE] 配合启用性能分析。"

#. FmodAudioPreviewProperty/methods:3/method:set_stream/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the [FmodAudioStream] to preview, stops any current audition, and requests its waveform from"
" the shared cache."
msgstr "设置要预览的 [FmodAudioStream]，停止当前试听，并从共享缓存请求波形。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_attenuation/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the attenuation factor controlling how quickly sound fades with distance.\n"
"[code]1.0[/code] is linear attenuation. Higher values cause faster fade-out."
msgstr ""
"设置距离衰减曲线强度\n"
"[code]1.0[/code] 表示线性衰减。值越大，随距离衰减越快。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_attenuation_model/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the attenuation model for distance-based volume falloff.\n"
"See [enum AttenuationModel] for available options."
msgstr ""
"设置距离衰减模型\n"
"可用选项见 [enum AttenuationModel] 。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_emission_angle_filter_attenuation_db/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the attenuation outside the emission cone in dB, clamped to [code]-80.0[/code] through "
"[code]0.0[/code].\n"
"More negative values create a sharper directional effect."
msgstr ""
"设置发声锥外的衰减量，单位为 dB，限制在 [code]-80.0[/code] 到 [code]0.0[/code] 之间。\n"
"值越负，方向性效果越明显。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_polygon_attributes/description:5
msgid ""
"Sets the attributes of an existing polygon.\n"
"- [param index]: The polygon index\n"
"- [param direct_occlusion]: Direct sound occlusion factor (0.0 = transparent, 1.0 = fully opaque)"
"\n"
"- [param reverb_occlusion]: Reverb occlusion factor (0.0 = transparent, 1.0 = fully opaque)\n"
"- [param double_sided]: Whether the polygon blocks sound from both sides"
msgstr ""
"修改指定多边形的遮挡属性。\n"
"- [param index] ：多边形索引\n"
"- [param direct_occlusion] ：直达声遮挡系数，0.0 为完全透明，1.0 为完全阻挡\n"
"- [param reverb_occlusion] ：混响声遮挡系数，0.0 为完全透明，1.0 为完全阻挡\n"
"- [param double_sided] ：多边形是否从两侧阻挡声音"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_delay_ms/description:3
msgid "Sets the base delay time in milliseconds for the specified voice."
msgstr "设置指定 voice 的延迟时间。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:set_max_audible_behavior/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the behavior when attempting to play more sounds than [member max_audible] allows.\n"
"See [enum Behavior] for available options."
msgstr ""
"设置超过最大可听数量时的处理方式。 （参见 [member max_audible] ）\n"
"可用选项见 [enum Behavior] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:set_band_frequency/description:3
msgid "Sets the center frequency (in Hz) for the specified band. Valid range is 10 Hz to 22000 Hz."
msgstr "设置指定频段的中心频率。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_distance_filter_center_freq/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the center frequency for the distance filter.\n"
"Used with [constant FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_DISTANCEFILTER]."
msgstr ""
"设置距离滤波器默认中心频率。\n"
"与 [constant FMOD_INIT_FLAG_CHANNEL_DISTANCEFILTER] 配合使用。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_cone_settings/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets the cone parameters for directional audio.\n"
"- [param inside_cone_angle]: Angle in degrees where volume is at maximum (0-360)\n"
"- [param outside_cone_angle]: Angle in degrees where volume begins to attenuate (0-360)\n"
"- [param outside_volume_db]: Volume level outside the cone in dB"
msgstr ""
"设置方向性 3D 声音锥体的内角、外角和外部音量衰减。\n"
"- [param inside_cone_angle] ：保持最大音量的锥角，单位为度，范围为 0 到 360\n"
"- [param outside_cone_angle] ：外部锥角，单位为度，范围为 0 到 360\n"
"- [param outside_volume_db] ：锥外音量，单位为 dB"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_bus_mute/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the configured mute flag of bus [param id]. When any bus is soloed, the solo routing path "
"takes precedence over configured mute flags."
msgstr "设置总线 [param id] 的配置静音标记。有总线处于 Solo 状态时，Solo 路径的可听状态优先于配置静音标记。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_bus_solo/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the configured solo flag of bus [param id]. Bound runtimes keep each soloed bus and its path"
" to Master audible, and mute unrelated buses."
msgstr "设置总线 [param id] 的配置 Solo 标记。绑定的运行时保留 Solo 总线及其到 Master 的路径可听，并静音其他总线。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_bus_volume_db/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the configured volume of bus [param id] in decibels. Non-finite values and unknown IDs are "
"ignored."
msgstr "以分贝设置总线 [param id] 的配置音量，忽略非有限值和未知 ID。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:set_position/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the current playback position.\n"
"Use this to seek to a specific point in the sound.\n"
"The [param timeunit] parameter specifies the unit for the position value:\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS[/code]: Milliseconds (default)\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_PCM[/code]: PCM samples\n"
"- Other time units from [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Seeking in compressed streams (MP3, Vorbis) may not be sample-accurate."
msgstr ""
"设置当前播放位置。默认使用毫秒时间单位。\n"
"用于定位到声音中的指定位置。\n"
"[param timeunit] 指定位置值的单位：\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS[/code] ：毫秒（默认值）\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_PCM[/code] ：PCM 采样数\n"
"- [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit] 中的其他时间单位\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 对 MP3、Vorbis 等压缩音频流进行定位时，可能无法达到采样精度。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_3d_rolloff_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the custom distance attenuation callback. The callback receives the distance and must return"
" a [float] attenuation value.\n"
"The script callback is invoked only on the main thread. Calls from other threads return "
"[code]1.0[/code] without invoking it. Only one system can be the active callback target at a "
"time."
msgstr ""
"设置自定义距离衰减回调。回调接收距离，必须返回 [float] 类型的衰减值。\n"
"脚本回调仅在主线程执行。其他线程上的调用直接返回 [code]1.0[/code] ，不执行脚本。同一时间只有一个系统可作为活动回调目标。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_stream_buffer_size/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the default buffer size for streaming sounds.\n"
"This affects how much data is read ahead for streamed audio files."
msgstr ""
"设置流式声音的默认缓冲区大小。\n"
"这会影响为流式音频文件预读的数据量。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_default_decode_buffer_size/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the default decode buffer size for streams.\n"
"Larger buffers reduce the risk of buffer underruns but use more memory."
msgstr ""
"设置流式解码双缓冲区默认大小。\n"
"较大的缓冲可降低缓冲不足风险，同时占用更多内存。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap1_delay_ms/description:2
msgid "Sets the delay time for tap 1 in milliseconds."
msgstr "设置第一个 Tap 的延迟时间。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap2_delay_ms/description:2
msgid "Sets the delay time for tap 2 in milliseconds."
msgstr "设置第二个 Tap 的延迟时间。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_feedback_delay_ms/description:2
msgid "Sets the delay time for the feedback loop in milliseconds."
msgstr "设置反馈延迟时间。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_distance_factor/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the distance factor for 3D spatial audio.\n"
"This converts the units used in 3D positioning (e.g., meters) to FMOD's internal units.\n"
"Default is 1.0 (1 unit = 1 meter)."
msgstr ""
"设置世界距离到米的换算比例。\n"
"用于将三维定位中的单位（例如米）转换为 FMOD 内部单位。\n"
"默认值为 1.0，即 1 个单位对应 1 米。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_distance_filter/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets the distance filter parameters.\n"
"- [param custom]: Enable custom filter settings\n"
"- [param custom_level]: Filter level when custom is enabled\n"
"- [param center_freq]: Center frequency of the distance filter"
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 距离滤波器覆盖值，用于随距离改变低通/高通滤波表现。\n"
"- [param custom] ：是否启用自定义滤波设置\n"
"- [param custom_level] ：启用自定义设置时的滤波电平\n"
"- [param center_freq] ：距离滤波器的中心频率"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:set_drive/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the distortion drive/amount. Range: 0.0 to 1.0.\n"
"Higher values produce more distortion."
msgstr ""
"设置驱动量。\n"
"值越大，失真越强。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:set_mode/description:2
msgid "Sets the distortion mode. See [enum Mode] for available options."
msgstr "设置失真算法。 （参见 [enum Mode] ）"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_doppler_level/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the doppler effect intensity for this channel.\n"
"Higher values increase the pitch shift due to velocity."
msgstr ""
"设置多普勒效果缩放量。该功能主要用于 Channel。\n"
"值越大，速度造成的音高变化越明显。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_doppler_tracking/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the doppler tracking mode for velocity-based pitch changes.\n"
"See [enum DopplerTracking] for available options."
msgstr ""
"设置多普勒速度追踪模式\n"
"可用选项见 [enum DopplerTracking] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_dry/description:2
msgid "Sets the dry (unprocessed) signal level (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "设置原始信号电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_dry/description:2
msgid "Sets the dry (unprocessed) signal level."
msgstr "设置原始信号电平。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_early_late_mix/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the early/late reflection mix in percent, clamped to [code]0.0[/code] through "
"[code]100.0[/code]. The initial value is [code]96.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置早期与后期反射的混合百分比，限制在 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]100.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]96.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:set_mute_fade_speed/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the fade duration in seconds for [constant BEHAVIOR_MUTE]. [param speed] must be "
"nonnegative; [code]0.0[/code] disables fading, and larger values produce longer fades."
msgstr ""
"设置 [constant BEHAVIOR_MUTE] 的淡入淡出时长，单位为秒。 [param speed] 必须为非负数； [code]0.0[/code] "
"表示不淡化，数值越大，淡化时间越长。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:set_feedback/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the feedback amount. Range: 0.1 to 0.9.\n"
"Higher feedback creates more resonant, intense phasing effects."
msgstr ""
"设置反馈量。\n"
"反馈越强，移相效果的谐振感越明显。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:set_band_filter_type/description:3
msgid "Sets the filter type for the specified band. See [enum FilterType] for available filter types."
msgstr "设置指定频段的滤波器类型。 （参见 [enum FilterType] ）"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:set_depth/description:2
msgid "Sets the filtered signal gain added to the original signal, clamped to 0.1 through 4.0."
msgstr "设置叠加到原始信号上的滤波信号增益，限制在 0.1 到 4.0。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:set_band_gain_db/description:3
msgid "Sets the gain (in dB) for the specified band. The value is clamped to the range -60 dB to +24 dB."
msgstr "设置指定频段的增益，单位为分贝。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_low_pass_gain/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the gain of the dry signal when the built-in lowpass filter is applied. This affects how "
"much the original unfiltered signal passes through when filtering is active. Values range from "
"0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr "设置内置低通/距离滤波应用时干信号的增益。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_reverb_3d_instance/description:2
msgid "Sets the global reverb instance to use for 3D reverb calculations."
msgstr "设置 Reverb3D 使用的全局混响实例索引。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_high_cut/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the high-cut frequency in Hz, clamped to [code]20.0[/code] through [code]20000.0[/code]. The"
" initial value is [code]14500.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置高频截止频率，单位为 Hz，限制在 [code]20.0[/code] 到 [code]20000.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]14500.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:set_keep_hf_hz/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the high-frequency preservation cutoff in Hertz.\n"
"Frequencies above this value are preserved and mixed back with the distorted signal."
msgstr ""
"设置高频保留频率。\n"
"高于该频率的信号会被保留，并与失真后的信号混合。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_hf_decay_ratio/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the high-frequency to mid-frequency decay-time ratio in percent, clamped to "
"[code]10.0[/code] through [code]200.0[/code]. The initial value is [code]83.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置高频与中频衰减时间的百分比，限制在 [code]10.0[/code] 到 [code]200.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]83.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_early_delay/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the initial reflection delay in milliseconds (range: 0.0 to 300.0).\n"
"This is the time before the first reflections arrive. Larger rooms have longer early delays."
msgstr ""
"设置初始反射延迟，单位为毫秒，范围为 0.0 到 300.0。\n"
"表示首个反射到达前的时间。较大的房间通常有更长的早期延迟。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_emission_angle/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the inner emission angle in degrees, clamped to [code]0.0[/code] through [code]90.0[/code]. "
"The inspector and saved scenes use degrees without conversion.\n"
"Sound is at full volume within this cone and attenuated outside."
msgstr ""
"设置发声内锥角，单位为度，限制在 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]90.0[/code] 之间。检查器和保存的场景直接使用度数，无需转换。\n"
"声音在该发声锥内保持完整音量，在锥外衰减。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_mix_levels_input/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the input mix levels for each channel of a multi-channel sound.\n"
"This allows per-channel volume control."
msgstr ""
"为多声道输入信号的每个输入通道设置电平。该功能主要用于 Channel。\n"
"用于逐声道控制音量。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_late_delay/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the late reverb delay in milliseconds (range: 0.0 to 100.0, default: 11.0).\n"
"This is the time between early reflections and the onset of the late reverb tail."
msgstr ""
"设置后期混响延迟，单位为毫秒，范围为 0.0 到 100.0，默认值为 11.0。\n"
"表示早期反射到后期混响尾音开始之间的时间。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_diffusion/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the late-reverb echo density in percent, clamped to [code]0.0[/code] through "
"[code]100.0[/code]. The initial value is [code]100.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置后期混响的回声密度百分比，限制在 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]100.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]100.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:set_loop_points/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets the loop start and end points for this channel.\n"
"When the sound reaches the end point during playback, it will jump back to the start point.\n"
"The [param timeunit] parameter specifies the unit for the start and end values:\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS[/code]: Milliseconds (default)\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_PCM[/code]: PCM samples\n"
"- Other time units from [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must also set [member loop_count] to enable looping behavior."
msgstr ""
"设置循环起点和终点。\n"
"播放到终点时会跳回起点。\n"
"[param timeunit] 指定起点和终点的单位：\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS[/code] ：毫秒（默认值）\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_PCM[/code] ：PCM 采样数\n"
"- [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit] 中的其他时间单位\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 还需要设置 [member loop_count] 才能启用循环。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_low_shelf_gain/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the low-shelf gain in dB, clamped to [code]-36.0[/code] through [code]12.0[/code]. The "
"initial value is [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置低频搁架增益，单位为 dB，限制在 [code]-36.0[/code] 到 [code]12.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]0.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_feedback_lowpass/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the lowpass filter cutoff frequency for the feedback loop.\n"
"Lower values create darker, more muffled echoes."
msgstr ""
"设置反馈低通截止频率。\n"
"较低的值会让回声更暗、更闷。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_cutoff_hz/description:3
msgid "Sets the lowpass filter cutoff frequency for the specified voice."
msgstr "设置指定 voice 的截止频率。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_max_distance/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum distance for 3D attenuation.\n"
"Beyond this distance, the sound volume stays at the minimum level."
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 距离衰减的最大距离。\n"
"超过该距离后，音量保持在最低电平。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_geometry_max_fade_time/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum fade time for geometry occlusion changes.\n"
"When sound is occluded by geometry, the transition is smoothed over this duration (in "
"milliseconds)."
msgstr ""
"设置几何遮挡变化时 Channel 淡入新音量的最长时间。\n"
"声音被几何体遮挡时，在此时长内平滑过渡，单位为毫秒。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:set_range_max_hz/description:2
msgid "Sets the maximum frequency of the LFO sweep in Hertz. Range: 10 to 10000."
msgstr "设置扫频范围上限。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_at9_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of ATRAC9 (AT9) codecs to allocate.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 AT9 解码器数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_convolution_threads/description:2
msgid "Sets the maximum number of CPU threads for convolution reverb processing."
msgstr "设置卷积混响 DSP 可使用的最大 CPU 线程数。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_fadpcm_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of FADPCM codecs to allocate.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 FADPCM 解码器数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_adpcm_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of IMA-ADPCM codecs to allocate.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 IMA-ADPCM 解码器数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_mpeg_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of MPEG (MP3) codecs to allocate.\n"
"Each playing MPEG sound requires a codec. Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 MPEG 解码器数量。\n"
"每个正在播放的 MPEG 声音需要一个解码器。必须在 [method init] 之前调用。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_opus_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of Opus codecs to allocate.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 Opus 解码器数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_vorbis_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of Vorbis codecs to allocate.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 Vorbis 解码器数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_xma_codecs/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of XMA codecs to allocate.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置最大 XMA 解码器数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:set_max_audible/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of playbacks from this group that can be audible simultaneously. "
"[code]-1[/code] removes the limit; [code]0[/code] permits no audible playbacks. Values below "
"[code]-1[/code] are rejected without changing the current limit.\n"
"When this limit is exceeded, the [member behavior] determines how new sounds are handled."
msgstr ""
"设置此组同时可听的最大播放数量。 [code]-1[/code] 取消限制， [code]0[/code] 表示不允许可听播放。小于 [code]-1[/code] "
"的值会被拒绝，当前限制保持不变。\n"
"超过限制时，由 [member behavior] 决定如何处理新的声音。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_software_channels/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of real, software-mixed channels. Additional playing channels may become "
"virtual when this limit is reached.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置实际参与软件混音的最大通道数。达到此上限后，其他正在播放的通道可能转为虚拟通道。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_max_spatial_objects/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of spatial audio objects for object-based audio output.\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置每个 FmodSystem 可预留的最大空间对象数量。\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_max_distance/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum rolloff distance multiplier, clamped to at least [code]0.01[/code]. FMOD "
"receives [param distance] multiplied by [member unit_size]. The attenuation model determines "
"behavior beyond that distance.\n"
"In [constant ATTENUATION_DISABLED] mode, a flat custom rolloff curve keeps distance gain at unity"
" regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"设置最大衰减距离倍率，最小为 [code]0.01[/code] 。传递给 FMOD 的距离为 [param distance] 乘以 [member unit_size] "
"。超出此距离后的行为由衰减模型决定。\n"
"在 [constant ATTENUATION_DISABLED] 模式下，平坦的自定义衰减曲线使距离增益始终为 1，不受此设置影响。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_3d_max_world_size/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum world size for 3D spatial audio calculations.\n"
"This affects the precision of spatial calculations."
msgstr ""
"设置三维空间音频计算的最大世界尺寸。\n"
"影响空间计算的精度。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_min_distance/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum distance for 3D attenuation.\n"
"Inside this distance, the sound plays at full volume."
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 距离衰减开始前的最小距离。\n"
"该距离以内保持完整音量。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:set_range_min_hz/description:2
msgid "Sets the minimum frequency of the LFO sweep in Hertz. Range: 10 to 10000."
msgstr "设置扫频范围下限。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_unit_size/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum rolloff distance in scene units, clamped to at least [code]0.001[/code]. Also "
"scales [member max_distance] when configuring FMOD."
msgstr "设置以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离，最小为 [code]0.001[/code] 。配置 FMOD 时也用于缩放 [member max_distance] 。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:set_mix_target/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the mix target. On surround output, [constant MIX_TARGET_STEREO] routes to the front "
"left/right speakers, [constant MIX_TARGET_SURROUND] routes to all speaker positions, and "
"[constant MIX_TARGET_CENTER] routes to center/LFE."
msgstr ""
"设置混音目标。环绕输出下， [constant MIX_TARGET_STEREO] 路由到前置左右扬声器， [constant MIX_TARGET_SURROUND] 路由到所有扬声器位置，"
" [constant MIX_TARGET_CENTER] 路由到中置和 LFE。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_density/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the modal density (range: 0.0 to 100.0, default: 100.0).\n"
"Controls the coloration of the late reverb. Lower values create more distinct echoes, higher "
"values create a smoother decay."
msgstr ""
"设置模态密度，范围为 0.0 到 100.0，默认值为 100.0。\n"
"控制后期混响的音色，值较低时回声更清晰，较高时衰减更平滑。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_depth_ms/description:3
msgid "Sets the modulation depth in milliseconds for the specified voice."
msgstr "设置指定 voice 的调制深度。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_rate_hz/description:3
msgid "Sets the modulation rate in Hertz for the specified voice."
msgstr "设置指定 voice 的调制速率。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:set_rate_hz/description:2
msgid "Sets the modulation rate in Hz, clamped to 0.01 through 20.0."
msgstr "设置调制速率，单位为 Hz，限制在 0.01 到 20.0。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_mute/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the mute state of the channel. When muted, the channel produces no audio output but "
"continues processing."
msgstr "设置静音状态。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_3d_num_listeners/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the number of 3D listeners in the scene.\n"
"Multiple listeners can be used for split-screen multiplayer or other scenarios.\n"
"[param num_listeners] must be between [code]1[/code] and [code]8[/code], inclusive."
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 声音场景中的监听器数量。\n"
"多个听者可用于分屏多人游戏等场景。\n"
"[param num_listeners] 必须在 [code]1[/code] 到 [code]8[/code] 之间，包含两端。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_asio_num_channels/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the number of ASIO channels for input/output.\n"
"Only applicable when using ASIO output mode."
msgstr ""
"设置 ASIO 输入和输出通道数量。\n"
"仅适用于 ASIO 输出模式。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_count/description:2
msgid "Sets the number of active chorus voices (1-4)."
msgstr "设置 voice 数量。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:set_loop_count/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the number of times to loop before stopping.\n"
"[b]Values:[/b]\n"
"- [code]-1[/code]: Loop infinitely\n"
"- [code]0[/code]: Play once, no looping (default)\n"
"- [code]1[/code]: Play twice (loop once)\n"
"- [code]n[/code]: Loop n times (play n+1 times total)\n"
"The loop points (set via [method set_loop_points]) determine which portion of the sound loops."
msgstr ""
"设置停止前的循环次数。 [code]-1[/code] 通常表示无限循环。\n"
"[b]Values:[/b]\n"
"- [code]-1[/code] ：无限循环\n"
"- [code]0[/code] ：播放一次，不循环（默认值）\n"
"- [code]1[/code] ：播放两次，即循环一次\n"
"- [code]n[/code] ：循环 n 次，总计播放 n+1 次\n"
"通过 [method set_loop_points] 设置的循环点决定声音中循环播放的区间。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_occlusion/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the occlusion factors for direct and reverb paths.\n"
"- [param direct_occlusion]: 0.0 (no occlusion) to 1.0 (fully occluded)\n"
"- [param reverb_occlusion]: 0.0 (no occlusion) to 1.0 (fully occluded)"
msgstr ""
"设置直接声和混响路径的遮挡衰减因子，范围通常为 [code]0.0[/code] 到 [code]1.0[/code] 。\n"
"- [param direct_occlusion] ：0.0 为无遮挡，1.0 为完全遮挡\n"
"- [param reverb_occlusion] ：0.0 为无遮挡，1.0 为完全遮挡"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_cone_orientation/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the orientation of the directional cone for directional audio.\n"
"The vector should be normalized and point in the direction the sound is facing."
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 声音锥体方向，用于方向性遮挡和衰减。\n"
"此向量应归一化，并指向音源朝向。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_driver/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the output driver for the currently selected output type. Use [method get_driver_info] to "
"enumerate available drivers."
msgstr "设置当前选定输出类型的输出驱动程序。使用 [method get_driver_info] 枚举可用的驱动程序。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_software_format/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets the output format for the software mixer.\n"
"- [param sample_rate]: Output sample rate in Hz (typically 44100 or 48000)\n"
"- [param speaker_mode]: Speaker output configuration (stereo, 5.1, etc.)\n"
"- [param num_raw_speakers]: Number of speakers for raw speaker mode\n"
"Must be called before [method init]."
msgstr ""
"设置软件混音器的输出格式。\n"
"- [param sample_rate] ：输出采样率，单位为 Hz，通常为 44100 或 48000\n"
"- [param speaker_mode] ：扬声器输出配置，例如立体声或 5.1\n"
"- [param num_raw_speakers] ：原始扬声器模式的扬声器数量\n"
"必须在调用 [method init] 之前调用"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_output/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the output interface type used to run the mixer. Call this before [method init] for "
"portability across platforms.\n"
"Common options include [constant FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AUTODETECT], [constant FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WASAPI]"
" (Windows), and [constant FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND] (silent mode)."
msgstr ""
"设置混音器使用的输出接口类型。为兼容不同平台，应在 [method init] 之前调用。\n"
"常用选项包括 [constant FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AUTODETECT] 、 [constant FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WASAPI] （Windows）和 "
"[constant FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_NOSOUND] （静音模式）"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap1_level_db/description:2
msgid "Sets the output level for tap 1 in decibels."
msgstr "设置第一个 Tap 的电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap2_level_db/description:2
msgid "Sets the output level for tap 2 in decibels."
msgstr "设置第二个 Tap 的电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_feedback_level_db/description:2
msgid "Sets the output level for the feedback loop in decibels."
msgstr "设置反馈电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_level_db/description:3
msgid "Sets the output level in decibels for the specified voice."
msgstr "设置指定 voice 的电平。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_mix_levels_output/description:9
msgid ""
"Sets the output mix levels for each speaker channel.\n"
"Allows custom routing to specific speaker outputs."
msgstr ""
"为每个输出扬声器设置音量电平。\n"
"用于自定义路由到指定扬声器输出。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_panning_strength/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the panning strength multiplier.\n"
"Higher values create more pronounced left/right panning effect.\n"
"Set to [code]0.0[/code] to disable panning."
msgstr ""
"设置左右声像强度\n"
"值越大，左右声像变化越明显。\n"
"设为 [code]0.0[/code] 可关闭声像调整。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:set_parent/description:2
msgid "Sets the parent channel group that this bus outputs to."
msgstr "设置此总线输出到的父通道组"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_paused/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the pause state of the channel. When paused, playback is temporarily suspended and can be "
"resumed by setting paused to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "设置暂停状态。 [code]true[/code] 会暂停播放， [code]false[/code] 会恢复播放。"

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:set_resampler_method/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the per-sound FMOD resampler. Invalidates the cached sound so the next playback uses the new"
" method."
msgstr "设置单个声音的 FMOD 重采样器。修改会使缓存的声音失效，下次播放使用新设置。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:set_pitch_scale/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_pitch_scale/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_pitch_scale/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the pitch scale of the audio playback.\n"
"[code]1.0[/code] is normal pitch. Higher values increase pitch and playback speed."
msgstr ""
"设置播放速度和音高缩放\n"
"[code]1.0[/code] 为正常音高。较大的值会提高音高和播放速度。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:set_frequency/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the playback frequency in Hertz (Hz).\n"
"This affects both the playback speed and pitch of the sound.\n"
"[b]Examples:[/b]\n"
"- [code]44100[/code]: Normal speed (for 44.1kHz sounds)\n"
"- [code]22050[/code]: Half speed / one octave lower\n"
"- [code]88200[/code]: Double speed / one octave higher\n"
"For pitch shifting without speed change, use the [FmodDSP] pitch shift effect instead."
msgstr ""
"设置播放频率，单位为赫兹。改变频率会影响播放速度和音高。\n"
"会同时影响声音的播放速度和音高。\n"
"[b]Examples:[/b]\n"
"- [code]44100[/code] ：正常速度，适用于 44.1 kHz 音频\n"
"- [code]22050[/code] ：半速播放，降低一个八度\n"
"- [code]88200[/code] ：双速播放，升高一个八度\n"
"需要保持速度并改变音高时，可使用 [FmodDSP] 的音高变换效果。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_speaker_position/description:5
msgid ""
"Sets the position of a speaker in the speaker configuration.\n"
"This allows custom speaker positioning for non-standard speaker setups.\n"
"The position is specified in 2D coordinates relative to the listener."
msgstr ""
"设置扬声器在扬声器配置中的位置。\n"
"这允许为非标准扬声器设置自定义扬声器位置。\n"
"位置是相对于听者以二维坐标指定的。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_polygon_vertex/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets the position of a specific vertex in a polygon.\n"
"- [param index]: The polygon index\n"
"- [param vertex_index]: The vertex index within the polygon\n"
"- [param vertex]: The new position of the vertex"
msgstr ""
"设置指定多边形中的单个顶点位置。\n"
"- [param index] ：多边形索引\n"
"- [param vertex_index] ：多边形内的顶点索引\n"
"- [param vertex] ：顶点的新位置"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_position/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the position of this geometry object in world space.\n"
"All polygons in the geometry are transformed by this position."
msgstr ""
"设置几何体位置。\n"
"此位置变换应用到几何体中的所有多边形。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_3d_listener_attributes/description:6
msgid ""
"Sets the position, velocity, and orientation of a 3D listener.\n"
"The listener index specifies which listener to configure (for multi-listener setups).\n"
"- [param position]: World position of the listener\n"
"- [param velocity]: Velocity for doppler calculations\n"
"- [param forward]: Forward direction vector (must be normalized)\n"
"- [param up]: Up direction vector (must be normalized)"
msgstr ""
"设置3D监听器的位置、速度和方向。\n"
"监听器索引指定要配置的监听器（用于多监听器设置）。\n"
"- [param position] ：听者的世界空间位置\n"
"- [param velocity] ：用于计算多普勒效果的速度\n"
"- [param forward] ：前向向量，需要归一化\n"
"- [param up] ：上方向向量，需要归一化"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:set_post_gain/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the post-distortion gain in decibels.\n"
"Use this to compensate for volume changes caused by distortion."
msgstr ""
"设置后级增益。\n"
"用于补偿失真处理造成的音量变化。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:set_pre_gain/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the pre-distortion gain in decibels.\n"
"Higher values drive the distortion harder."
msgstr ""
"设置前级增益。\n"
"值越大，驱动失真的信号越强。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_random_seed/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the random seed for FMOD's internal random number generator.\n"
"Affects randomized features like chorus and flange effects."
msgstr ""
"设置 FMOD 内部随机数生成器种子。\n"
"影响合唱、镶边等效果中的随机行为。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_hf_reference/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the reference high frequency in Hz (range: 20.0 to 20000.0, default: 5000.0).\n"
"Frequencies above this value are affected by the HF decay ratio setting."
msgstr ""
"设置高频参考频率，单位为 Hz，范围为 20.0 到 20000.0，默认值为 5000.0。\n"
"高于该频率的信号受高频衰减比例影响。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_low_shelf_frequency/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the reference low frequency in Hz (range: 20.0 to 1000.0, default: 250.0).\n"
"Frequencies below this value are affected by the low shelf gain setting."
msgstr ""
"设置低频参考频率，单位为 Hz，范围为 20.0 到 1000.0，默认值为 250.0。\n"
"低于该频率的信号受低架增益影响。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_pitch/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the relative pitch/playback rate.\n"
"- [code]1.0[/code]: Normal playback speed\n"
"- Values below 1.0: Slower playback (lower pitch)\n"
"- Values above 1.0: Faster playback (higher pitch)"
msgstr ""
"设置相对音高和播放速率。 [code]1.0[/code] 为原始音高， [code]2.0[/code] 为两倍速， [code]0.5[/code] 为半速。\n"
"- [code]1.0[/code] ：正常播放速度\n"
"- 小于 1.0：播放变慢、音高降低\n"
"- 大于 1.0：播放变快、音高升高"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:set_music_speed/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the relative playback speed for MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI music. A value of 1.0 is normal speed, "
"0.5 is half speed, 2.0 is double speed, etc.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works for module music formats (tracker formats)."
msgstr ""
"设置 MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI 音乐的相对播放速度。数值 1.0 为正常速度，0.5 为半速，2.0 为双倍速度，依此类推\n"
"\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 仅适用于模块音乐，即 Tracker 格式。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_resampler_method/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the resampling method for pitch changes.\n"
"Higher quality methods use more CPU. See [enum FmodResamplerMethod]."
msgstr ""
"设置软件混音器使用的重采样方法。\n"
"较高质量的算法会占用更多 CPU，见 [enum FmodResamplerMethod] 。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_decay_time/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the reverb decay time in milliseconds, clamped to [code]100.0[/code] through "
"[code]20000.0[/code]. The initial value is [code]1500.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置混响衰减时间，单位为毫秒，限制在 [code]100.0[/code] 到 [code]20000.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]1500.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_reverb_properties/description:14
msgid ""
"Sets the reverb properties for the specified global reverb instance.\n"
"Parameters control various aspects of the reverb effect:\n"
"- [param decay_time]: Reverberation decay time in milliseconds\n"
"- [param early_time]: Initial reflection delay time\n"
"- [param late_delay]: Late reverberation delay time\n"
"- [param hf_reference]: High-frequency reference in Hz\n"
"- [param hf_decay_ratio]: High-frequency decay ratio\n"
"- [param diffusion]: Diffusion amount (echo density)\n"
"- [param dennsity]: Density of late reverberation\n"
"- [param low_shelf_frequency]: Low shelf filter frequency\n"
"- [param low_shelf_gain]: Low shelf filter gain\n"
"- [param high_cut]: High cut frequency\n"
"- [param early_late_mix]: Mix between early and late reflections\n"
"- [param wet_level]: Wet (effected) signal level in dB"
msgstr ""
"设置指定混响实例的混响属性。\n"
"以下参数控制混响效果的各个方面：\n"
"- [param decay_time]：混响衰减时间，单位为毫秒\n"
"- [param early_time] ：初始反射延迟时间\n"
"- [param late_delay] ：后期混响延迟时间\n"
"- [param hf_reference] ：高频参考频率，单位为 Hz\n"
"- [param hf_decay_ratio] ：高频衰减比例\n"
"- [param diffusion] ：扩散量，即回声密度\n"
"- [param dennsity] ：后期混响密度\n"
"- [param low_shelf_frequency] ：低架滤波频率\n"
"- [param low_shelf_gain] ：低架滤波增益\n"
"- [param high_cut] ：高频截止频率\n"
"- [param early_late_mix] ：早期和后期反射的混合比例\n"
"- [param wet_level] ：效果湿信号电平，单位为 dB"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_scale/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the scale of this geometry object.\n"
"All polygons in the geometry are transformed by this scale."
msgstr ""
"设置几何体缩放。\n"
"此缩放变换应用到几何体中的所有多边形。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_rolloff_scale/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the scaling factor for 3D distance rolloff attenuation.\n"
"Higher values cause sounds to attenuate more quickly with distance.\n"
"Default is 1.0."
msgstr ""
"设置全局 3D 距离衰减缩放因子。\n"
"值越大，声音随距离衰减得越快。\n"
"默认值为 1.0。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_doppler_scale/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the scaling factor for 3D doppler effect calculations.\n"
"Higher values exaggerate the doppler effect, lower values reduce it.\n"
"A value of 1.0 represents the default scaling."
msgstr ""
"设置全局多普勒效果缩放因子。\n"
"值越大，多普勒效果越明显；值越小，效果越弱。\n"
"1.0 表示默认倍率。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap1_pan/description:2
msgid "Sets the stereo panning position for tap 1 (-1.0 = left, 1.0 = right)."
msgstr "设置第一个 Tap 的声像。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:set_tap2_pan/description:2
msgid "Sets the stereo panning position for tap 2 (-1.0 = left, 1.0 = right)."
msgstr "设置第二个 Tap 的声像。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_voice_pan/description:3
msgid "Sets the stereo panning position for the specified voice (-1.0 = left, 1.0 = right)."
msgstr "设置指定 voice 的声像。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_3d_spread/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the stereo spread angle for 3D positioned sounds.\n"
"Higher values make the sound more diffuse in the stereo field."
msgstr ""
"设置 3D 声音在扬声器空间中的扩散角度。\n"
"值越大，立体声声场中的声音越分散。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_network_timeout/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the timeout in milliseconds for network streams. This affects how long FMOD waits for data "
"before considering a stream stalled."
msgstr "设置网络流的超时时间（以毫秒为单位）。这会影响 FMOD 在将流视为停滞之前等待数据的时间。"

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:set_priority/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the virtual voice priority for this channel.\n"
"Priority values range from 0 (highest priority) to 256 (lowest priority).\n"
"When FMOD runs out of physical voices, lower priority channels are virtualized first.\n"
"Set important sounds (music, dialogue) to high priority (low numbers),\n"
"and less important sounds (ambient, effects) to lower priority (high numbers)."
msgstr ""
"设置虚拟语音排序优先级。数值越低优先级越高。\n"
"优先级范围为 0 到 256，0 最高，256 最低。\n"
"FMOD 的物理声部不足时，低优先级通道会先转为虚拟声部。\n"
"可为音乐、对话等重要声音设置较高优先级，即较小的数值，\n"
"并为环境声、次要音效等设置较低优先级，即较大的数值。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:set_vol0_virtual_vol/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the virtual voice threshold volume.\n"
"Sounds with volume below this threshold become virtual voices."
msgstr ""
"设置低于该音量时转为虚拟声道的阈值。\n"
"音量低于此阈值的声音会转为虚拟声部。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_volume_linear/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the volume as a linear value (0.0 to 1.0+).\n"
"This is converted internally to decibels."
msgstr ""
"使用线性音量设置基础音量\n"
"内部会转换为分贝。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:set_volume_db/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_volume_db/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_volume_db/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the volume in decibels.\n"
"[code]0.0[/code] is unity gain. Negative values attenuate, positive values amplify (if supported)."
msgstr ""
"设置音量，单位为分贝\n"
"[code]0.0[/code] 为单位增益；负值衰减，正值放大（若支持）。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_volume_db/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the volume level in decibels (dB).\n"
"- [code]0.0 dB[/code]: Unity gain (no change)\n"
"- Negative values: Attenuate (quieter)\n"
"- Positive values: Amplify (louder)\n"
"Typical range is -80 dB to +24 dB."
msgstr ""
"设置音量，单位为分贝。\n"
"- [code]0.0 dB[/code] ：单位增益，保持原音量\n"
"- 负值：衰减，降低音量\n"
"- 正值：放大，提高音量\n"
"常用范围为 -80 dB 到 +24 dB。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:set_music_channel_volume/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the volume of a specific channel in a MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI file, in decibels (dB). This allows"
" individual control over each track/instrument in module music.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works for module music formats. Valid channel indices are 0 to [method "
"get_music_num_channels] - 1."
msgstr ""
"设置 MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI 文件中某个特定通道的音量，以分贝为单位。这允许对模块音乐中的每个音轨/乐器进行单独控制\n"
"\n"
"[b]注意：[/b] 仅适用于模块音乐。有效通道索引范围为 0 到 [method get_music_num_channels] 减一。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:set_volume_db/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the volume of this SoundGroup in decibels.\n"
"This volume is applied to all sounds belonging to the group.\n"
"The default value is [code]0.0[/code] dB (unity gain)."
msgstr ""
"设置 SoundGroup 音量，单位为分贝。\n"
"此音量应用到组内所有声音。\n"
"默认值为 [code]0.0[/code] dB，即单位增益。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:set_volume_db/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the volume of this bus in decibels.\n"
"The default value is [code]0.0[/code] dB (unity gain)."
msgstr ""
"设置总线音量，单位为分贝\n"
"默认值为 [code]0.0[/code] dB，即单位增益。"

#. FmodDSPConnection/methods:3/method:set_mix/description:2
msgid "Sets the volume scale of the connection in dB."
msgstr "设置连接混合电平。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:set_wet/description:2
msgid "Sets the wet (processed) signal level (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "设置效果信号电平。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_wet_dry_mix/description:4
msgid "Sets the wet and dry signal mix ratios."
msgstr "设置干湿信号的混合比例。"

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:set_wet_level/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets the wet reverb level in dB, clamped to [code]-80.0[/code] through [code]20.0[/code]. The "
"initial value is [code]-8.0[/code]."
msgstr "设置混响湿声电平，单位为 dB，限制在 [code]-80.0[/code] 到 [code]20.0[/code] 之间，初始值为 [code]-8.0[/code] 。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_reverb_properties/description:3
msgid ""
"Sets the wet/send level for a specific reverb instance (0-3). This controls how much of the "
"channel's audio is sent to the global reverb effect. Higher values result in more reverberation."
msgstr "设置指定全局混响实例的发送电平。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_rotation/description:2
msgid "Sets the world-space Euler rotation in radians. The Inspector displays this property in degrees."
msgstr "设置世界空间的欧拉旋转，单位为弧度；检查器中以度显示。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/methods:3/method:set_threshold/description:2
msgid "Sets threshold."
msgstr "设置压缩阈值。"

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/methods:3/method:set_time_pullout/description:2
msgid "Sets time pullout."
msgstr "设置时间差拉开量。"

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:set_transform/description:2
msgid "Sets transform."
msgstr "一次性同步几何体的 3D 变换。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_bus_effect_enabled/description:4
msgid ""
"Sets whether slot [param slot_id] on bus [param bus_id] is enabled. Disabled slots retain their "
"runtime instances in bypass. The bus bypass flag also bypasses enabled slots. Unknown IDs are "
"ignored."
msgstr "设置总线 [param bus_id] 的槽位 [param slot_id] 是否启用。禁用时保留运行实例并旁路；总线旁路也会使该实例旁路。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_active/description:2
msgid "Sets whether the DSP is active (processing)."
msgstr "设置 DSP 是否激活并处理音频。"

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_bypass/description:2
msgid "Sets whether the DSP should be bypassed."
msgstr "设置 DSP 是否旁通。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_volume_ramp/description:2
msgid ""
"Sets whether volume changes should be ramped (interpolated smoothly over time) or applied "
"instantaneously. Ramping prevents clicks and pops when changing volume."
msgstr "设置音量变化是否使用 FMOD 的平滑斜坡。启用后可减少突然变更音量时的爆音。"

#. Class reference template
msgid "Setter"
msgstr "设值函数"

#. FmodDSPConnection/constants:6/constant:DSPCONNECTION_TYPE_SIDECHAIN
msgid "Sidechain connection type where the input DSP's output is fed to the output DSP's sidechain input."
msgstr "侧链连接"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_PARAMETER_DATA_TYPE_SIDECHAIN
msgid "Sidechain data parameter type."
msgstr "侧链数据参数类型。"

#. Class reference template
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "信号"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_HIGHPASS_SIMPLE
msgid "Simple highpass without resonance but with very flexible cutoff and fast."
msgstr "无谐振的简单高通滤波器，截止频率可调，开销较低。"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_LOWPASS_SIMPLE
msgid "Simple lowpass without resonance but with flexible cutoff and fast."
msgstr "无谐振的简单低通滤波器，截止频率可调，开销较低。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_ROOM
msgid "Small room preset."
msgstr "普通房间"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_LIVING_ROOM
msgid "Soft furnished room preset."
msgstr "客厅"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_LOOP_OFF
msgid "Sound does not loop. Playback stops at the end."
msgstr "禁用循环播放"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OPEN_STATE_PLAYING
msgid "Sound is in a \"playing\" state (for streams)."
msgstr "已经准备好并可以播放，但目前无法释放，否则主线会停滞"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OPEN_STATE_READY
msgid "Sound is ready to be played."
msgstr "准备就绪"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OPEN_STATE_LOADING
msgid "Sound is still loading/opening."
msgstr "正在加载中"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_LOOP_BIDI
msgid "Sound loops bidirectionally, playing forward then backward (ping-pong)."
msgstr "双向循环播放"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_LOOP_NORMAL
msgid "Sound loops normally, jumping from end back to start."
msgstr "正常循环播放"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_VOL0_BECOMES_VIRTUAL
msgid "Sounds with volume 0 become virtual voices and are not processed except for position updates."
msgstr "任何音量为0的声音都会变成虚拟声音，除了它们的位置在虚拟中更新外不会被处理。请调整 FmodSystem 属性来处理除了 0 以外的音量切换到虚拟"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/members:4/member:source_mode
msgid "Source used to build FMOD polygons."
msgstr "几何体来源模式"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_TYPE_OBJECTPAN
msgid "Spatializes by passing input signal to the external object mixer."
msgstr "将输入信号传给外部对象混音器，进行空间化处理。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_RESAMPLER_SPLINE
msgid "Spline interpolation (slowest, best quality)."
msgstr "样条插值重采样"

#. FmodDSPConnection/constants:6/constant:DSPCONNECTION_TYPE_STANDARD
msgid "Standard connection type where the input DSP's output is fed directly to the output DSP's input."
msgstr "标准 DSP 连接"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:play/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:play/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:play/description:2
msgid "Starts or restarts playback at [param from_position], in seconds. Use a nonnegative position."
msgstr "从 [param from_position] 指定的位置开始或重新播放，单位为秒。位置应为非负数。"

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/methods:3/method:set_recording_active/description:2
msgid ""
"Starts or stops recording. Changing from inactive to active clears the previous recording and "
"allocates a new capture buffer. Setting the current state again does nothing. Stopping preserves "
"captured samples for [method get_recording]."
msgstr "开始或停止录音。从停止切换到录音会清除上一次录音并分配新的捕获缓冲；重复设置当前状态没有效果。停止后保留已捕获采样，供 [method get_recording] 读取。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:record_start/description:4
msgid ""
"Starts recording from the specified device into the provided sound object.\n"
"If loop is [code]true[/code], recording will wrap around to the beginning of the sound buffer "
"when it reaches the end."
msgstr ""
"从指定设备开始录音到提供的音频对象中。\n"
"loop 为 [code]true[/code] 时，录音到达声音缓冲区末尾后会回到开头继续写入。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/brief_description:0
msgid "Static 3D audio occlusion geometry for FMOD."
msgstr "从 3D 网格生成 FMOD 遮挡几何体的节点"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:load_from_file/description:2
msgid ""
"Static method to load a sound from a file path. The path should be a valid file system path or a "
"Godot resource path (res://).\n"
"\n"
"[b]Example:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var sound: FmodSound = FmodSound.load_from_file(\"res://music.mp3\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"用于从文件路径加载声音的静态方法。该路径应是有效的文件系统路径或 Godot 资源路径（ [code]res://[/code] ）\n"
"\n"
"[b]Example:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var sound: FmodSound = FmodSound.load_from_file(\"res://music.mp3\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/brief_description:0
msgid "Stereo enhancement effect for widening or narrowing the stereo field."
msgstr "立体声增强效果。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_STEREO
msgid "Stereo output (2 channels: left, right)."
msgstr "立体声输出"

#. FmodAudioEffectPanner/brief_description:0
msgid "Stereo panner for positioning audio in the stereo field."
msgstr "左右声像控制。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:stop/description:1
msgid ""
"Stops all sounds in this SoundGroup that are currently playing.\n"
"This stops the channels but does not release the sounds or the group itself."
msgstr ""
"停止 SoundGroup 中所有正在播放的声音。\n"
"停止通道，但保留声音和声音组对象。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:stop/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:stop/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:stop/description:1
msgid "Stops playback and resets the position to the beginning."
msgstr "停止播放并清除暂停状态"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:record_stop/description:2
msgid "Stops recording from the specified device."
msgstr "停止从指定设备录制。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:set_stream/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_stream/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_stream/description:2
msgid ""
"Stops the current playback and assigns [param stream]. Playback must be started again with "
"[method play]."
msgstr "停止当前播放并设置 [param stream] ，之后需调用 [method play] 开始播放。"

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:stop/description:1
msgid ""
"Stops this channel, or all channels in this group and its nested groups. A stopped Channel handle"
" becomes invalid; a ChannelGroup remains available for subsequent playback."
msgstr "停止当前通道，或停止当前组及其嵌套组中的所有通道。停止后的 Channel 句柄失效；ChannelGroup 仍可用于后续播放。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:area_mask
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:area_mask
msgid "Stored area mask. Area-based audio filtering is not implemented."
msgstr "保存的区域掩码。尚未实现基于区域的音频过滤。"

#. FmodAudioBus/members:4/member:bypass
msgid ""
"Stored bypass flag. [method sync_bypass] applies it to the stored effect instances. For the "
"active layout, use [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass]."
msgstr "保存的旁路标记。[method sync_bypass] 将其应用到效果器实例。对于当前布局，使用 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass]。"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/members:4/member:buffer_length
msgid ""
"Stored compatibility value in seconds, clamped to 0.1 through 10.0. The default is 2.0. The "
"current implementation does not use this property to allocate history, smooth results, or change "
"analysis latency."
msgstr "保存的兼容值，单位为秒，限制在 0.1 到 10.0，默认为 2.0。当前实现不使用该属性分配历史缓冲、平滑结果或改变分析延迟。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/members:4/member:oversample
msgid ""
"Stored oversampling setting, clamped to 1 through 16. The default is 4. The current "
"implementation does not perform oversampling and does not use this value in the DSP."
msgstr "保存的过采样设置，限制在 1 到 16，默认为 4。当前实现不执行过采样，DSP 也不使用该值。"

#. FmodAudioBus/members:4/member:solo
msgid ""
"Stored solo flag. Use [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo] to update audibility across the "
"active layout."
msgstr "保存的 Solo 标记。通过 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo] 更新整个当前布局的可听状态。"

#. FmodAudioBus/members:4/member:mute
msgid ""
"Stored user mute flag. [method apply_mute] applies it to the channel group. For the active "
"layout, use [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute]."
msgstr "保存的用户静音标记。[method apply_mute] 将其应用到通道组。对于当前布局，使用 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute]。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_area_mask/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:set_area_mask/description:2
msgid "Stores [param mask]. Area-based audio filtering is not implemented by this player."
msgstr "保存 [param mask] 。此播放器尚未实现基于区域的音频过滤。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:sidechain
msgid ""
"Stores a requested sidechain bus name. Sidechain routing is not implemented, so this property "
"does not change which signal controls compression. The default is an empty name."
msgstr "保存请求的侧链总线名称。当前尚未实现侧链路由，因此该属性不会改变用于控制压缩的信号，默认为空名称。"

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/description:1
msgid ""
"Stores bus configuration in display order. Bus and effect-slot IDs are stable identifiers, "
"separate from array indices. [code]Master[/code] has ID [code]0[/code] and remains first. Sends "
"can target any bus without creating a cycle; moving a bus changes only its display order.\n"
"Load and save layouts with [ResourceLoader] and [ResourceSaver]. The resource stores a format "
"version and dynamic properties such as [code]bus/0/name[/code] and "
"[code]bus/0/effect/0/effect[/code]. Channel groups, DSP instances, metering data, and capture "
"buffers belong to the runtime managed by [FmodServer].\n"
"By default, [code]audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses[/code] is [code]true[/code]: Godot's "
"[AudioServer] supplies the bus configuration. To author an independent layout, disable this "
"setting and reload the project. [code]audio/fmod/default_bus_layout[/code] defaults to "
"[code]res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres[/code]. A missing or invalid default falls back to an "
"in-memory Master; load failures are reported.\n"
"The [b]FMOD Audio[/b] editor Dock edits the active layout and saves configuration changes after a"
" [code]0.8[/code]-second delay. Loading another layout does not change the project default; use "
"[b]FMOD > Set as Default[/b] for that. The saved default reference uses a resource UID, and the "
"export plugin includes the default layout and its dependencies.\n"
"In independent mode, the Dock displays levels for audio played inside the editor. It uses the "
"native Audio panel's color settings, holds peaks for [code]1.5[/code] seconds, and stops polling "
"while hidden. Levels from a separate running game process are not displayed. In synchronization "
"mode, the Dock shows a hint and an entry to open Godot's Audio panel; the FMOD bus controls and "
"meters are hidden.\n"
"Edit the layout returned by [method FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout] to update its bound runtime "
"on the next server update. Call [method FmodServer.flush_bus_updates] when immediate access to a "
"new bus or slot is needed. Each slot has its own runtime effect; obtain it with [method "
"FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance]. Direct runtime edits do not modify the configuration "
"resource.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Independent mode: Godot bus synchronization must be disabled\n"
"var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"if music_id == -1:\n"
"\tmusic_id = layout.add_bus(&\"Music\")\n"
"layout.set_bus_volume_db(music_id, -6.0)\n"
"var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(music_id, slot_id) as "
"FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"按显示顺序保存总线配置。总线和效果器槽位使用稳定 ID，与数组索引分别管理。[code]Master[/code] 的 ID 为 "
"[code]0[/code]，始终位于首项。发送可指向任意无环目标；移动总线只改变显示顺序。\n"
"通过 [ResourceLoader] 和 [ResourceSaver] 加载、保存布局。资源保存格式版本及 "
"[code]bus/0/name[/code]、[code]bus/0/effect/0/effect[/code] 等动态属性。通道组、DSP 实例、电平数据及 Capture 缓冲由 "
"[FmodServer] 管理的运行时持有。\n"
"[code]audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses[/code] 默认为 [code]true[/code]，由 Godot 的 [AudioServer] "
"提供总线配置。关闭此设置并重新加载项目后，可编辑独立布局。[code]audio/fmod/default_bus_layout[/code] 默认为 "
"[code]res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres[/code]。默认布局缺失或无效时，回退到内存中的 Master，并报告加载错误。\n"
"[b]FMOD Audio[/b] 编辑器面板编辑当前布局，配置修改在 [code]0.8[/code] 秒后合并保存。加载其他布局会保留项目默认值；通过 [b]FMOD > Set as "
"Default[/b] 将当前布局设为默认。保存的默认引用使用资源 UID，导出插件会包含默认布局及其依赖。\n"
"独立模式下，面板显示编辑器内播放音频的电平，沿用原生 Audio 面板的颜色设置，保持峰值 [code]1.5[/code] "
"秒，隐藏时停止轮询。独立游戏进程的电平暂未接入。同步模式下，面板显示提示和打开 Godot Audio 面板的入口，并隐藏 FMOD 总线控件及电平表。\n"
"修改 [method FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout] 返回的布局，会在下一次服务器更新时应用到绑定的运行实例。需要立即访问新总线或槽位时，调用 [method "
"FmodServer.flush_bus_updates]。每个槽位都有独立效果器实例，通过 [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] "
"获取。直接修改运行时对象不会改变配置资源。\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Independent mode: Godot bus synchronization must be disabled\n"
"var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"if music_id == -1:\n"
"    music_id = layout.add_bus(&\"Music\")\n"
"layout.set_bus_volume_db(music_id, -6.0)\n"
"var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(music_id, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(music_id, slot_id) as "
"FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:set_pcmsetpos_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the PCM position callback on this wrapper.\n"
"The current sound creation methods do not register the corresponding native FMOD callback; "
"assigning a [Callable] here does not enable callback delivery."
msgstr ""
"在此包装器上保存PCM 定位回调。\n"
"当前声音创建方法未注册相应的原生 FMOD 回调；在此处设置 [Callable] 不会启用回调通知。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:set_pcmread_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the PCM read callback on this wrapper.\n"
"The current sound creation methods do not register the corresponding native FMOD callback; "
"assigning a [Callable] here does not enable callback delivery."
msgstr ""
"在此包装器上保存PCM 读取回调。\n"
"当前声音创建方法未注册相应的原生 FMOD 回调；在此处设置 [Callable] 不会启用回调通知。"

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:set_nonblock_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the nonblocking load callback on this wrapper.\n"
"The current sound creation methods do not register the corresponding native FMOD callback; "
"assigning a [Callable] here does not enable callback delivery."
msgstr ""
"在此包装器上保存非阻塞加载回调。\n"
"当前声音创建方法未注册相应的原生 FMOD 回调；在此处设置 [Callable] 不会启用回调通知。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:set_oversample/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the oversampling setting, clamped to 1 through 16. The current DSP does not use this "
"setting, so it does not change the audio processing."
msgstr "保存过采样设置，限制在 1 到 16。当前 DSP 不使用该设置，因此不会改变音频处理结果。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:set_max_polyphony/description:2
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:max_polyphony
msgid ""
"Stores the requested voice limit, clamped to at least [code]1[/code]. This player currently uses "
"one channel; this setting does not enable overlapping voices."
msgstr "保存请求的声部上限，最小为 [code]1[/code] 。此播放器目前只使用一个通道，该设置不会启用重叠播放。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:set_bypass/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the runtime bypass flag. Call [method sync_bypass] to apply it to this bus's effect "
"instances. For layout-managed slots, use [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass] so slot "
"enable flags are also respected."
msgstr ""
"保存运行时旁路标记，调用 [method sync_bypass] 后应用到总线效果器实例。对于布局管理的槽位，使用 [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass]，以同时遵循槽位启用状态。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:set_solo/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the solo flag. Use [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo] to also recompute muting "
"across the layout."
msgstr "保存独奏标志。使用 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo] 可同时重新计算布局中的静音状态。"

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:set_mute/description:2
msgid ""
"Stores the user mute flag. Call [method apply_mute] to apply it, or use [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute] to update muting across the layout."
msgstr "保存用户静音标志。调用 [method apply_mute] 应用，或使用 [method FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute] 更新布局中的静音状态。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_DATA_TYPE_STRING
msgid "String (ASCII/UTF-8)."
msgstr "字符串（ASCII/UTF-8）。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_SURROUND_LEFT
msgid "Surround left speaker."
msgstr "环绕左声道"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_SURROUND
msgid "Surround output (5 channels: front left, front right, center, surround left, surround right)."
msgstr "五声道环绕输出"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SPEAKER_SURROUND_RIGHT
msgid "Surround right speaker."
msgstr "环绕右声道"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:mixer_suspend/description:1
msgid ""
"Suspends the mixer thread, relinquishing use of the audio hardware while maintaining internal "
"state. Useful for handling audio focus changes on mobile platforms."
msgstr "暂停混音器线程，同时释放音频硬件的使用权，但保持内部状态。在移动平台上处理音频焦点变化时非常有用。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:sync_geometry_transform/description:1
msgid "Synchronizes the FMOD geometry transform with this node's global transform."
msgstr "立即将节点当前变换同步到底层 [code skip-lint]FmodGeometry[/code] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/members:4/member:preset
msgid ""
"The EQ preset determining the number of bands. Use [constant PRESET_6_BANDS], [constant "
"PRESET_10_BANDS], or [constant PRESET_21_BANDS]. Changing this will reinitialize all bands with "
"default values."
msgstr ""
"均衡器频段预设 （参见 [constant PRESET_6_BANDS] ） （参见 [constant PRESET_10_BANDS] ） （参见 [constant "
"PRESET_21_BANDS] ）"

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/members:4/member:fft_size
msgid ""
"The FFT (Fast Fourier Transform) size used for spectrum analysis. Larger FFT sizes provide better"
" frequency resolution (more frequency bins) but worse time resolution and higher CPU usage. See "
"[enum FFTSize] for available options. The default [constant FFT_SIZE_1024] provides a good "
"balance for general visualization."
msgstr "FFT 窗口大小 （参见 [enum FFTSize] ） （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_1024] ）"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/members:4/member:stream
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:stream
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:stream
msgid ""
"The [FmodAudioStream] resource to play. In the editor, its resource picker displays a waveform "
"preview. Expanding the resource exposes the inspector audition panel, which shares the same "
"waveform cache. Assigning another stream stops current playback."
msgstr "要播放的 [FmodAudioStream] 资源。编辑器的资源选择器显示波形预览，展开资源可使用检查器试听面板，两者共享波形缓存。赋值另一个音频流会停止当前播放。"

#. FmodChannel/members:4/member:channel_group
msgid ""
"The [FmodChannelGroup] this channel outputs to. If not set, outputs to the master channel group.\n"
"Use channel groups to organize sounds into sub-mixes for group-level control."
msgstr ""
"当前通道输出到的 [FmodChannelGroup] ；未设置时输出到主通道组。\n"
"可通过通道组将声音组织为子混音，统一控制。"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/members:4/member:resonance
msgid ""
"The amount of resonance (boost) applied around the cutoff frequency. Range: 0.0 to 1.0. Higher "
"values create a more pronounced peak at the cutoff frequency, useful for creating vocal-like or "
"synthesizer filter effects."
msgstr "截止频率附近的共振提升"

#. FmodAudioEffectAmplify/members:4/member:volume_linear
msgid ""
"The amplification level as a linear value. A value of 1.0 is unity gain. The setter floors values"
" at 0.001 before converting to [member volume_db]; inputs at or below this floor map to -60 dB. "
"The getter returns 0.0 for stored gains at or below -60 dB, so setting 0.0 produces silence. The "
"maximum stored gain of +24 dB corresponds to approximately 15.8489."
msgstr ""
"线性增益，1.0 为单位增益。设置时先将数值下限限制为 0.001，再转换为 [member volume_db]；小于或等于该下限的输入映射到 -60 dB。存储增益小于或等于 -60 dB "
"时，读取返回 0.0，因此设置 0.0 会静音。最大存储增益 +24 dB 对应约 15.8489。"

#. FmodAudioEffectAmplify/members:4/member:volume_db
msgid ""
"The amplification level in decibels (dB). Range: -80 dB to +24 dB. Default value of 0 dB means no"
" change to the signal. Negative values attenuate the signal, positive values amplify it. The "
"current conversion helper produces silence at -60 dB and below."
msgstr "增益，单位为分贝（dB），范围为 -80 dB 到 +24 dB。默认 0 dB 保持信号增益不变，负值衰减，正值放大。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/members:4/member:behavior
msgid "The behavior when max audible sounds is exceeded. See [enum Behavior]."
msgstr "超过最大可听声音数时的处理行为，见 [enum Behavior] 。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:ratio
msgid ""
"The compression ratio, clamped to 1.0 through 48.0. The default is 4.0: for every 4 dB the input "
"exceeds the threshold, the output increases by 1 dB."
msgstr "压缩比，限制在 1.0 到 48.0，默认为 4.0。输入超过阈值 4 dB 时，输出增加 1 dB。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:tap1_delay_ms
msgid "The delay time for tap 1 in milliseconds."
msgstr "第一个 Tap 的延迟时间"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:tap2_delay_ms
msgid "The delay time for tap 2 in milliseconds."
msgstr "第二个 Tap 的延迟时间"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:feedback_delay_ms
msgid "The delay time for the feedback loop in milliseconds."
msgstr "反馈延迟时间"

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/members:4/member:surround
msgid ""
"The delayed mid-signal gain used for surround processing, clamped to 0.0 through 1.0. The default"
" 0.0 disables surround processing. Positive values add the delayed mid signal to the left channel"
" and subtract it from the right channel."
msgstr "环绕处理中延迟的中间信号增益，限制在 0.0 到 1.0。默认值 0.0 关闭环绕处理；正值会将延迟的中间信号加到左声道，并从右声道减去。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/members:4/member:drive
msgid "The distortion drive/amount. Range: 0.0 to 1.0. Higher values produce more distortion."
msgstr "失真驱动量"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/members:4/member:mode
msgid "The distortion mode. See [enum Mode] for available options."
msgstr "失真算法 （参见 [enum Mode] ）"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:dry
msgid "The dry (unprocessed) signal level."
msgstr "原始信号电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/members:4/member:dry
msgid "The dry (unprocessed) signal level. Range: 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr "原始信号电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/members:4/member:predelay_feedback
msgid ""
"The feedback amount in the predelay section, clamped to 0.0 through 0.98. The default is 0.4. It "
"controls how much of the predelay output is fed back into the delay."
msgstr "预延迟部分的反馈量，限制在 0.0 到 0.98，默认为 0.4。控制预延迟输出重新送入延迟的比例。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/members:4/member:feedback
msgid ""
"The feedback amount. Range: 0.1 to 0.9. Higher feedback creates more resonant, intense phasing "
"effects."
msgstr "反馈量"

#. FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter/members:4/member:pre_gain_db
msgid ""
"The gain applied before limiting, in decibels, clamped to -24.0 through +24.0 dB. The default is "
"0.0 dB."
msgstr "限幅前的增益，单位为分贝，限制在 -24.0 到 +24.0 dB，默认为 0.0 dB。"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/members:4/member:gain
msgid ""
"The gain applied to frequencies within the passband, specified as a linear value. Values above "
"1.0 boost the filtered frequencies, while values below 1.0 attenuate them."
msgstr "滤波后频率的线性增益"

#. FmodChannelControl/members:4/member:gain
msgid ""
"The gain of the dry signal when the built-in lowpass filter is applied. Controls how much "
"unfiltered signal passes through when filtering is active (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "内置低通/距离滤波使用的干信号增益"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/members:4/member:depth
msgid ""
"The gain of the filtered signal mixed with the original signal, clamped to 0.1 through 4.0. The "
"default is 1.0. This controls effect intensity rather than the frequency sweep limits."
msgstr "与原始信号混合的滤波信号增益，限制在 0.1 到 4.0，默认为 1.0。该属性控制效果强度，扫频边界由频率范围属性控制。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/members:4/member:keep_hf_hz
msgid ""
"The high-frequency preservation cutoff in Hz. Frequencies above this value are preserved and "
"mixed back with the distorted signal to maintain clarity."
msgstr "高频保留频率"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ10/members:4/member:preset
msgid ""
"The initial preset is [constant FmodAudioEffectEQ.PRESET_10_BANDS]. The inherited [method "
"FmodAudioEffectEQ.set_preset] can change it and reinitialize the bands."
msgstr ""
"初始预设为 [constant FmodAudioEffectEQ.PRESET_10_BANDS]。继承的 [method FmodAudioEffectEQ.set_preset] "
"可更改预设并重新初始化频段。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ21/members:4/member:preset
msgid ""
"The initial preset is [constant FmodAudioEffectEQ.PRESET_21_BANDS]. The inherited [method "
"FmodAudioEffectEQ.set_preset] can change it and reinitialize the bands."
msgstr ""
"初始预设为 [constant FmodAudioEffectEQ.PRESET_21_BANDS]。继承的 [method FmodAudioEffectEQ.set_preset] "
"可更改预设并重新初始化频段。"

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ6/members:4/member:preset
msgid ""
"The initial preset is [constant FmodAudioEffectEQ.PRESET_6_BANDS]. The inherited [method "
"FmodAudioEffectEQ.set_preset] can change it and reinitialize the bands."
msgstr ""
"初始预设为 [constant FmodAudioEffectEQ.PRESET_6_BANDS]。继承的 [method FmodAudioEffectEQ.set_preset] "
"可更改预设并重新初始化频段。"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/members:4/member:dry
msgid ""
"The level of the original (dry) signal. Range: 0.0 to 1.0. A value of 1.0 passes the original "
"signal at full volume. Lower values reduce the direct sound, emphasizing the reverb effect."
msgstr "原始信号电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/members:4/member:wet
msgid ""
"The level of the reverberated (wet) signal. Range: 0.0 to 1.0. Controls how much of the processed"
" reverb signal is mixed with the dry signal. A value of 0.0 produces no reverb effect."
msgstr "混响信号电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/members:4/member:cutoff_hz
msgid ""
"The low-pass cutoff frequency in Hz, clamped to 1.0 through 20500.0. Frequencies above the cutoff"
" are attenuated."
msgstr "低通截止频率，单位为 Hz，限制在 1.0 到 20500.0。截止频率以上的成分会被衰减。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:feedback_lowpass
msgid ""
"The lowpass filter cutoff frequency for the feedback loop in Hz. Lower values create darker "
"echoes."
msgstr "反馈低通截止频率"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:gain_db
msgid ""
"The makeup gain applied after compression, in decibels. Clamped to -20.0 through +20.0 dB; the "
"default is 0.0 dB."
msgstr "压缩后的补偿增益，单位为分贝。限制在 -20.0 到 +20.0 dB，默认为 0.0 dB。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/members:4/member:range_max_hz
msgid "The maximum frequency of the LFO sweep in Hz. Range: 10 to 10000."
msgstr "扫频范围上限"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/members:4/member:range_min_hz
msgid "The minimum frequency of the LFO sweep in Hz. Range: 10 to 10000."
msgstr "扫频范围下限"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:mix
msgid ""
"The mix between dry (unprocessed) and wet (compressed) signal, as a value from 0.0 to 1.0. "
"Default: 1.0 (fully wet). A value of 0.0 outputs only the dry signal, 1.0 outputs only the "
"compressed signal, and intermediate values blend the two. This enables parallel compression "
"effects."
msgstr "干湿混合比例"

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/members:4/member:rate_hz
msgid "The modulation rate in Hz, clamped to 0.01 through 20.0. The default is 0.5 Hz."
msgstr "调制速率，单位为 Hz，限制在 0.01 到 20.0，默认为 0.5 Hz。"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/members:4/member:voice_count
msgid "The number of active chorus voices. Range: 1 to 4."
msgstr "参与合唱的 voice 数量"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:tap1_level_db
msgid "The output level for tap 1 in decibels."
msgstr "第一个 Tap 的电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:tap2_level_db
msgid "The output level for tap 2 in decibels."
msgstr "第二个 Tap 的电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:feedback_level_db
msgid "The output level for the feedback loop in decibels."
msgstr "反馈电平"

#. FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter/members:4/member:ceiling_db
msgid ""
"The output sample-peak ceiling in decibels, clamped to -24.0 through 0.0 dB. The default is -0.3 "
"dB. Leaving headroom below 0 dB can reduce clipping risk, but this is not a true-peak limiter."
msgstr "输出采样点峰值上限，单位为分贝，限制在 -24.0 到 0.0 dB，默认为 -0.3 dB。在 0 dB 以下保留余量可降低削波风险，但该效果器不是真峰值限制器。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPitchShift/members:4/member:oversampling
msgid ""
"The overlap factor passed to FMOD's pitch-shift DSP, clamped to 4 through 32. The default is 4. "
"This property controls FFT overlap, rather than increasing the output sample rate."
msgstr "传给 FMOD 音高变换 DSP 的重叠因子，限制在 4 到 32，默认为 4。该属性控制 FFT 重叠，不会提高输出采样率。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPanner/members:4/member:pan
msgid ""
"The pan position, clamped to -1.0 through 1.0. The default 0.0 preserves the input stereo image. "
"At -1.0 the two input channels are summed into the left output, and at 1.0 they are summed into "
"the right output."
msgstr "声像位置，限制在 -1.0 到 1.0。默认值 0.0 保留输入的立体声声像。-1.0 将两个输入声道相加送到左输出，1.0 将其相加送到右输出。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPitchShift/members:4/member:pitch_scale
msgid ""
"The pitch multiplier, clamped to 0.01 through 16.0. It must be greater than 0.0; invalid "
"nonpositive values are rejected. The default is 1.0. A value of 2.0 shifts up one octave and 0.5 "
"shifts down one octave. Convert semitones with [code]pow(2.0, semitones / 12.0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"音高倍率，限制在 0.01 到 16.0，必须大于 0.0，非正值会被拒绝。默认为 1.0。2.0 升高一个八度，0.5 降低一个八度。半音数可使用 [code]pow(2.0, "
"semitones / 12.0)[/code] 转换。"

#. FmodGeometry/members:4/member:position
msgid "The position of this geometry object in world space."
msgstr "几何体在世界空间中的位置"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/members:4/member:post_gain
msgid "The post-distortion gain in decibels. Use this to compensate for volume changes."
msgstr "失真后增益"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/members:4/member:pre_gain
msgid "The pre-distortion gain in decibels. Higher values drive the distortion harder."
msgstr "失真前增益"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/members:4/member:predelay_msec
msgid ""
"The predelay time in milliseconds, clamped to 0.0 through 500.0. The default is 150.0 ms. It "
"delays the signal entering the reverb network."
msgstr "预延迟时间，单位为毫秒，限制在 0.0 到 500.0，默认为 150.0 ms。用于延迟进入混响网络的信号。"

#. FmodAudioStream/members:4/member:audio_data
msgid ""
"The raw audio data loaded from file. This is typically set by the audio importer or by [method "
"load_from_file]. The data is stored in memory and used to create the FMOD sound object when "
"[method get_sound] is called."
msgstr ""
"从文件加载的原始音频数据。通常由音频导入器或通过 [method load_from_file] 设置。数据存储在内存中，并在调用 [method get_sound] 时用于创建 FMOD "
"声音对象"

#. FmodChannelControl/members:4/member:pitch
msgid ""
"The relative pitch/playback rate. 1.0 is normal speed, values below 1.0 slow down playback, "
"values above 1.0 speed it up."
msgstr "相对音高和播放速率"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:release_ms
msgid ""
"The release time in milliseconds, clamped to 20.0 through 2000.0. The default is 250.0 ms. It "
"controls how quickly compression recovers after the input level falls below the threshold."
msgstr "释放时间，单位为毫秒，限制在 20.0 到 2000.0，默认为 250.0 ms。控制输入电平低于阈值后压缩恢复的速度。"

#. FmodAudioEffectHardLimiter/members:4/member:release
msgid ""
"The release time in seconds, clamped to 0.01 through 3.0. The default is 0.1 seconds. It controls"
" how quickly gain recovers after limiting."
msgstr "释放时间，单位为秒，限制在 0.01 到 3.0，默认为 0.1 秒。控制限幅后增益恢复的速度。"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:attack_us
msgid ""
"The requested attack time in microseconds, clamped to 20.0 through 2000.0. The stored default is "
"20.0 microseconds. The value is converted to milliseconds for FMOD and clamped to a minimum of "
"0.1 ms, so requests below 100 microseconds use an effective attack time of 100 microseconds."
msgstr ""
"请求的启动时间，单位为微秒，限制在 20.0 到 2000.0，保存的默认值为 20.0 微秒。传给 FMOD 时会转换为毫秒，并限制为至少 0.1 ms，因此小于 100 微秒的请求实际使用 "
"100 微秒。"

#. FmodAudioEffectFilter/members:4/member:db
msgid ""
"The rolloff steepness of the filter, specified in dB per octave. Determines how sharply "
"frequencies beyond the cutoff are attenuated. See [enum FilterDB] for available values."
msgstr "截止曲线斜率 （参见 [enum FilterDB] ）"

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/members:4/member:format
msgid ""
"The sample format used when [method get_recording] exports the captured floating-point samples. "
"Changing it does not change the capture buffer. [constant FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM] currently exports "
"16-bit PCM, like [constant FORMAT_16_BITS]."
msgstr ""
"[method get_recording] 导出已捕获浮点采样时使用的采样格式。修改它不会改变捕获缓冲。 [constant FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM] 当前与 [constant "
"FORMAT_16_BITS] 一样导出 16 位 PCM。"

#. FmodGeometry/members:4/member:scale
msgid "The scale of this geometry object."
msgstr "几何体缩放"

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/members:4/member:pan_pullout
msgid ""
"The side-signal multiplier used for stereo width, clamped to 0.0 through 4.0. At 0.0, the first "
"two channels collapse to their mono average before delay or surround processing. The default 1.0 "
"preserves their width; values above 1.0 widen the stereo difference."
msgstr "用于控制立体声宽度的侧信号倍率，限制在 0.0 到 4.0。0.0 会在延迟或环绕处理前将前两个声道合并为单声道平均值；默认值 1.0 保留原有宽度，大于 1.0 会放大立体声差异。"

#. FmodAudioEffectPitchShift/members:4/member:fft_size
msgid ""
"The size of the FFT window used for pitch shifting. Larger sizes provide better frequency "
"resolution but increase latency. Options: [constant FFT_SIZE_256], [constant FFT_SIZE_512], "
"[constant FFT_SIZE_1024], [constant FFT_SIZE_2048], [constant FFT_SIZE_4096]. Default: [constant "
"FFT_SIZE_2048]. Use smaller sizes for lower latency and larger sizes for better quality."
msgstr ""
"FFT 窗口大小 （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_256] ） （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_512] ） （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_1024]"
" ） （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_2048] ） （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_4096] ） （参见 [constant FFT_SIZE_2048] ）"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/members:4/member:room_size
msgid ""
"The size of the simulated acoustic space. Range: 0.0 to 1.0. Higher values create the impression "
"of larger spaces (halls, cathedrals) with longer decay times, while lower values simulate smaller"
" rooms."
msgstr "房间尺寸"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/members:4/member:mix_target
msgid "The speaker mix target used by this player."
msgstr "当前播放器使用的扬声器混音目标。"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:tap1_pan
msgid "The stereo panning position for tap 1. Range: -1.0 (left) to 1.0 (right)."
msgstr "第一个 Tap 的声像"

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/members:4/member:tap2_pan
msgid "The stereo panning position for tap 2. Range: -1.0 (left) to 1.0 (right)."
msgstr "第二个 Tap 的声像"

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/members:4/member:spread
msgid ""
"The stereo spread of the reverb. Range: 0.0 to 1.0. Higher values create a wider stereo image in "
"the reverberated signal, simulating reflections from wider spaces."
msgstr "立体声扩散"

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/members:4/member:threshold_db
msgid ""
"The threshold level in decibels (dB) above which compression begins. Range: -60 dB to 0 dB. "
"Default: 0 dB. Signals below this level pass through unaffected; signals above are reduced "
"according to the ratio. Lower threshold values result in more compression."
msgstr "压缩阈值"

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/members:4/member:time_pullout_ms
msgid ""
"The time-based stereo separation in milliseconds. Range: 0.0 to 50.0 ms. Default: 0.0. This "
"introduces a small delay between the left and right channels to create stereo width. The effect "
"mimics natural acoustic delays and can make sources sound wider. Higher values create more width "
"but may cause comb filtering artifacts if too extreme. Use subtle values (1-10 ms) for natural "
"enhancement."
msgstr "时间差拉开量，单位为毫秒"

#. FmodChannelControl/members:4/member:volume_db
msgid ""
"The volume level in decibels (dB). 0 dB is unity gain, negative values attenuate, positive values"
" amplify."
msgstr "音量，单位为分贝"

#. FmodDSPConnection/members:4/member:mix
msgid "The volume mix level of the connection in dB."
msgstr "连接混合电平，单位为分贝"

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/members:4/member:wet
msgid "The wet (processed) signal level. Range: 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr "效果信号电平"

#. FmodGeometry/members:4/member:rotation
msgid "The world-space Euler rotation in radians, displayed in degrees in the Inspector."
msgstr "世界空间的欧拉旋转，脚本中使用弧度，检查器中以度显示。"

