#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_DATA_TYPE_STRING_UTF8
msgid "UTF-8 encoded string."
msgstr "8位UTF字符串"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_UNDERWATER
msgid "Underwater muffled reverb preset."
msgstr "水下"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_UNKNOWN
msgid "Unknown or unsupported audio format."
msgstr "未知或不支持的音频格式"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_UNKNOWN
msgid "Unknown output type, returned when the system cannot determine the output mode."
msgstr "未知输出类型，无法确定输出模式时返回。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_TYPE_UNKNOWN
msgid "Unknown tag type."
msgstr "FMOD不识别的标签类型"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:unlock_dsp/description:1
msgid ""
"Unlocks the DSP engine mutex.\n"
"Must be called after [method lock_dsp]."
msgstr ""
"解锁 DSP 引擎互斥锁。\n"
"必须在 [method lock_dsp] 之后调用。"

#. FmodSoundLock/methods:3/method:unlock/description:1
msgid ""
"Unlocks the sound data, allowing FMOD to resume normal processing.\n"
"This should be called as soon as you're finished accessing the data.\n"
"The destructor automatically calls this if the data is still locked."
msgstr ""
"解锁声音数据，允许 FMOD 恢复正常处理，在访问数据完成后应立即调用此函数\n"
"完成数据访问后应尽快调用。\n"
"对象析构时若仍处于锁定状态，会自动调用此方法。"

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:update/description:1
msgid ""
"Updates the FMOD System. This should be called regularly (typically every frame) to process "
"streams, 3D positioning, and non-realtime output modes.\n"
"[constant FMOD_INIT_FLAG_STREAM_FROM_UPDATE] decodes streams during update. NRT outputs also "
"perform mixing during update."
msgstr ""
"更新 FMOD 系统。这个方法应该定期调用（通常每帧一次），以处理流、3D 定位和非实时输出模式。\n"
"[constant FMOD_INIT_FLAG_STREAM_FROM_UPDATE] 使流解码在更新时进行。非实时输出模式也会在更新时执行混音。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_USER
msgid "User-created sound with custom read callback."
msgstr "用户自制的声音"

#. FmodDSP/constants:6/constant:DSP_PARAMETER_DATA_TYPE_USER
msgid "User-defined data parameter type."
msgstr "用户定义的数据参数类型。"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_TYPE_USER
msgid "User-supplied metadata."
msgstr ""
"对于编解码器开发者来说，这种标签类型可以配合 [code]FMOD_CODEC_METADATA_FUNC <https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.02/api/plugin-"
"api-codec.html#fmod_codec_metadata_func>[/code] 生成自定义元数据"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:ATTENUATION_INVERSE_SQUARE_DISTANCE
msgid ""
"Uses FMOD inverse-tapered rolloff ([constant FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF]). "
"This is not a pure inverse-square volume curve."
msgstr "使用 FMOD 的反比渐变衰减（ [constant FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_3D_INVERSETAPEREDROLLOFF] ），并非纯粹的反平方音量曲线。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:ATTENUATION_LOGARITHMIC
msgid ""
"Uses FMOD linear rolloff between [member unit_size] and [member max_distance] multiplied by "
"[member unit_size]."
msgstr "在 [member unit_size] 到 [member max_distance] 乘以 [member unit_size] 的距离之间，使用 FMOD 线性衰减。"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/constants:6/constant:ATTENUATION_DISABLED
msgid ""
"Uses a flat custom rolloff curve with unity gain at every distance. Preserves 3D panning, Doppler"
" and emission-cone settings. [member unit_size] and [member max_distance] do not affect distance "
"gain in this mode."
msgstr ""
"使用平坦的自定义衰减曲线，使所有距离处的增益均为 1。保留 3D 声像、多普勒和发声锥设置。此模式下， [member unit_size] 和 [member max_distance] "
"不影响距离增益。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_LOWMEM
msgid "Uses less memory when loading sounds, at the cost of some features and compatibility."
msgstr "使用低内存模式"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_PORT_TYPE_VR_VIBRATION
msgid "VR controller vibration port. Use the platform-specific user ID as the port index."
msgstr "VR 振动输出端口"

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:set_audio_bus_layout/description:2
msgid ""
"Validates and builds [param layout] before replacing the current runtime graph. Playing channels "
"move to matching bus names or Master. Returns [constant OK] on success, [constant ERR_BUSY] in "
"Godot synchronization mode, [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA] for an invalid resource, or an "
"initialization error. This does not save the resource or change the project default."
msgstr ""
"验证并建立 [param layout] 的运行实例后替换当前图。播放通道转移到同名总线，找不到时转到 Master。成功返回 [constant OK]；Godot 同步模式返回 "
"[constant ERR_BUSY]；无效资源返回 [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA]，初始化失败则返回对应错误。此方法不保存资源，也不改变项目默认值。"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_ARENA
msgid "Very large arena preset."
msgstr "竞技场"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/constants:6/constant:PRESET_PADDED_CELL
msgid "Very small, heavily damped room."
msgstr "软包小房间"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_VIRTUAL_PLAYFROMSTART
msgid ""
"Virtual channels resume from the start of the sound when they become real, rather than from where"
" they went virtual."
msgstr "虚拟声道从头播放"

#. FmodChannel/members:4/member:priority
msgid ""
"Virtual voice priority from [code]0[/code] (highest) to [code]256[/code] (lowest). A playing "
"channel inherits its initial priority from the sound defaults. Lower-priority channels are "
"virtualized first."
msgstr "虚拟声部优先级， [code]0[/code] 最高， [code]256[/code] 最低。播放通道的初始优先级继承声音的默认设置；低优先级通道会先被虚拟化。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_PORT_TYPE_VOICE
msgid "Voice chat port. Use the platform-specific user ID as the port index."
msgstr "语音输出端口"

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/members:4/member:volume_db
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/members:4/member:volume_db
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/members:4/member:volume_db
msgid "Volume in decibels. [code]0.0[/code] is unity gain, negative values attenuate."
msgstr "音量，单位为分贝。[code]0.0[/code] 为单位增益，负值表示衰减。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/members:4/member:volume_db
msgid "Volume of this sound group in decibels, applied to all contained sounds."
msgstr "SoundGroup 音量，单位为分贝"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_TYPE_VORBISCOMMENT
msgid "Vorbis comment tag (used in OGG/FLAC)."
msgstr "元数据容器，适用于 Vorbis、FLAC、Theora、Speex 和 Opus 文件格式"

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/constants:6/constant:MODE_WAVESHAPE
msgid "Wave shaping distortion. Uses a waveshaping function to create harmonic distortion."
msgstr "波形整形"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_WAV
msgid "Waveform Audio File Format (WAV)."
msgstr "Microsoft 波形音频文件格式（.wav）。支持的编码：无压缩PCM，IMA ADPCM。平台提供仅在Windows上可用的ACM解码扩展"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WEBAUDIO
msgid "Web Audio API output for HTML5/WebAssembly builds."
msgstr "Web Audio ScriptProcessorNode 输出（如果 AudioWorkletNode 不可用，默认为 HTML5）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AUDIOWORKLET
msgid "Web Audio Worklet output for improved HTML5 audio performance."
msgstr "Web Audio AudioWorkletNode 输出（如果有，默认为 HTML5）"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:wet_level
msgid "Wet signal level in dB."
msgstr "混响湿声电平，单位为分贝"

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/description:1
msgid ""
"When configured in a [FmodAudioBusLayout] slot, use [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] "
"to obtain the runtime recorder. Start and stop recording, then call [method get_recording] on "
"that instance. The layout's configuration resource does not contain recorded audio.\n"
"FmodAudioEffectRecord captures audio data passing through an audio bus and records it to an "
"internal buffer. When recording is complete, the captured audio can be saved as an "
"[AudioStreamWAV] resource.\n"
"This effect is useful for recording gameplay audio, capturing microphone input (when applied to a"
" microphone bus), or creating audio samples from synthesized sounds.\n"
"To start recording, apply the effect to an audio bus and set [member recording_active] to "
"[code]true[/code]. To stop, set [member recording_active] to [code]false[/code] and call [method "
"get_recording] to retrieve the recorded audio as an [AudioStreamWAV]."
msgstr ""
"配置在 [FmodAudioBusLayout] 槽位中时，通过 [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] "
"获取运行时录音器。在该实例上开始、停止录音并调用 [method get_recording]。布局的配置资源不保存录音数据。\n"
"[b]FmodAudioEffectRecord[/b] 是一个通过型录音 DSP。它不会改变总线输出，而是在 [code skip-lint]recording_active[/code] "
"启用时把经过效果器的音频写入内部缓冲。停止录制后，可以通过 [code skip-lint]get_recording()[/code] 得到 [AudioStreamWAV] ，也可以通过 "
"[code skip-lint]get_waveform_snapshot()[/code] 获取波形预览数据。\n"
"可用于录制游戏音频、捕获麦克风总线输入，或从合成声音中制作音频样本。\n"
"将效果器应用到音频总线，并将 [member recording_active] 设为 [code]true[/code] 即可开始录音。将 [member recording_active] "
"设为 [code]false[/code] 后，调用 [method get_recording] ，以 [AudioStreamWAV] 获取录音。"

#. FmodSoundGroup/constants:6/constant:BEHAVIOR_FAIL
msgid "When max audible is reached, [method FmodSystem.play_sound] calls fail for new sounds."
msgstr "调用播放接口时，如果超过最大可听数量则播放失败 （参见 [method FmodSystem.play_sound] ）"

#. FmodSoundGroup/constants:6/constant:BEHAVIOR_MUTE
msgid "When max audible is reached, new sounds start muted and become audible when other sounds stop."
msgstr "超出的声音从静音开始，直到有足够声音停止后再变得可听"

#. FmodSoundGroup/constants:6/constant:BEHAVIOR_STEAL_LOWEST
msgid "When max audible is reached, the quietest (lowest audibility) sound is stolen for the new sound."
msgstr "超出限制时抢占当前最安静的声音"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_PREFER_DOLBY_DOWNMIX
msgid ""
"When using 5.1 speaker mode with stereo output devices, use Dolby Pro Logic II downmix algorithm "
"instead of the default stereo downmix."
msgstr ""
"使用立体声输出设备 [code]FmodSpeakerMode[/code] 中的 [code skip-lint]FMOD_SPEAKER_MODE_5POINT1[/code] 时，请使用 "
"Dolby Pro Logic II 的下混算法，而非默认的立体声下混算法"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_INIT_FLAG_GEOMETRY_USECLOSEST
msgid ""
"When using the geometry engine, only process the closest polygon instead of accumulating all "
"polygons intersecting the sound-to-listener line."
msgstr "使用几何引擎时，只需处理最近的多边形，而不是累积所有声音到听者线路相交的多边形"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/members:4/member:show_debug_gizmo
msgid "Whether editor gizmo visualization is enabled."
msgstr "是否显示编辑器调试 Gizmo"

#. FmodDSP/members:4/member:bypass
msgid "Whether the DSP is bypassed (input passes through unprocessed)."
msgstr "DSP 是否旁通。旁通时输入信号直接输出。"

#. FmodDSP/members:4/member:active
msgid "Whether the DSP is currently active and processing."
msgstr "DSP 是否处于激活并处理音频的状态。"

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/members:4/member:active
msgid "Whether this FMOD geometry contributes to occlusion."
msgstr "几何体是否参与遮挡计算"

#. FmodGeometry/members:4/member:active
msgid "Whether this geometry object is active and contributes to occlusion calculations."
msgstr "几何体是否参与遮挡计算"

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:active
msgid "Whether this reverb zone contributes to the FMOD mix."
msgstr "该混响区域是否参与输出"

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:active
msgid "Whether this reverb zone is active and contributing to the audio output."
msgstr "混响是否参与输出"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WASAPI
msgid "Windows Audio Session API. Default output mode on Windows Vista and later."
msgstr "Windows 音频会话 API（Windows、Xbox One、Game Core 和 UWP 默认使用）"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WINSONIC
msgid "Windows Sonic output with spatial audio support."
msgstr "支持空间音频的 Windows Sonic 输出。"

#. FmodAudioStream/constants:6/constant:MODE_DEFAULT
msgid ""
"With no flags set, creates a non-looping 2D sample. The resource property default is [constant "
"MODE_STREAM]."
msgstr "未设置标志时创建不循环的 2D 采样音频。资源属性的默认值为 [constant MODE_STREAM] 。"

#. FmodSystem/brief_description:0
msgid "Wrapper class for the FMOD::System object, providing audio system management and control."
msgstr "FMOD::System 对象的包装类，提供音频系统管理和控制"

#. FmodDSP/brief_description:0
msgid "Wrapper for FMOD::DSP, providing digital signal processing effects."
msgstr "FMOD::DSP 的封装，用于数字信号处理。"

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_WAVWRITER
msgid "Write output to a WAV file instead of playing through speakers."
msgstr "将输出写入.wav文件"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_XMA
msgid "Xbox 360 XMA format."
msgstr "Microsoft XMA 位流支持，支持FSB（.fsb）容器格式。平台提供解码器，仅在Xbox上可用"

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_AUDIOQUEUE
msgid "iOS AudioQueue codec."
msgstr "Apple 音频队列解码器（.mp4、.m4a、.mp3）。支持的编码：AAC、ALAC、MP3。平台提供解码器，仅在 iOS/tvOS 设备上使用"

#. Class reference template
msgid "value"
msgstr "值"
